<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Kuman New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Luk ka i bogl yagl kade ta Tiofilus we digwa i, togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Yagl kade Tiofilus yo, taragl podo ta no munara plau dugwa i, yoba tau mere bogl atne edinamnedi prisre, pepa tau mere bogl kodigwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Ye beglkwa i, Jisas kogon mabuno bogl eruko, yoba akie ere wan meglkwa i, ye yoba i di teigo, kano mudu bogl atne edigwa pre diga. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ba na prika i, na ama Jisas kamo bogl atne edenaglka i, kuno erumedi prika. Jisas kamo mabuno boglmara ede pi dudumara i, na wakai ere dokiga pre na epigl epigl boglbo, ene kerenatnedi prika. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />I siragl pre Jisas kamo yoba ene beke teigo, pitnga i, kaima yegl yegl pamedi pre pogl sinatnedi prika.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angelo ta Sekaraia di te, Ene yagl gak ta kuglsre, kagie Jon yenatniwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Angel appears to Zecharias" file="FM 124 Zacharias in the Temple_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.5" />Ana okna tawa togwa yagl ta moglkwa, kagie Sekaraia we digwa. King Herot ye distrik Judia sugl moglkwa igne i yagl Sekaraia i moglkwa. Sekaraia moglkwa i, ye tawa togwa yagl Aron okna ibo moglkwa i gawamo ta moglsre, Aron gawama yugobuno kebra kebra meglmara i, ye Abiya we digwa ta meglmara suna i moglkwa. Te, yagl Sekaraia i, ebie kidagl kagie Elisabet we digwa. Abu i ama yagl Aron ikra gawamo ta moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ana yagl abu suo Sekaraia ya Elisabet i, ye God gumuglo mina yoba du miurka. Yagl Kade lomo ya ye yoba siragl mere eraiglmedi di togwa i, yagl abu suo i duglo borabugledi ere miurko, yoba ye gagno ka ta sikrikwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Yegl miurka ba abu Elisabet we, ye temne paugwa pre yagl abu suo i gak ta kuglkribrika. Ye gak ta kuglkre, kidagl yei kodibrika.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ana aglke ta Abiya gawama ikra tawa teigwa yugu yomara kogon eraiglkwa egemo ugwa pre Sekaraia ama akie pidre, tawa teigwa yugu yomara kogon erikwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Kogon ersre, ye ege ege erimere yagl swara ira ta ede yugugl pi ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa gagl tenabuka i, kere inamnedi kagno mudu bogl atne edidre, swara ta gudu i meda edigo, Sekaraia kagie yogo, kanigwa. Yegl pre Sekaraia ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa i gagl tawa tenagledi ede yugugl ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ye ede yugugl pidre, ede nuglo gagl tawa togo, yoba tau mere ye ede nuglo gagl tawa tomedi prisre, meda mogl, kamage ere meglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ana Sekaraia ye ede nuglo gagl tawa togo, Yagl Kade angelomo ta ye moglmara u plau didre, ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa gaiglmara boglmo i, ogo wo kra adigl moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Adigl moglko, Sekaraia ye kandre, wai kugl, kudugl podo goglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Kudugl podo goglkwa ba angelo i ye di te, yegl dugwa, Sekaraia yo, ene kudugl goglkro! dugwa. Ene God kamage ere tenga i, God prukwa pre ye ene ebin Elisabet gak ta kurabedi eran, ye yagl gak ta kurabuka. Ye yagl gak kuran, ene kagie Jon yenatniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Angelo i ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene ebin ye yagl gak i kuran, ene gun podo yebr, yoba tau mere ama akie gun podo yenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Yoba mere gun podo yenaiglkwa i, i siragl pre yagl gak Jon i, Yagl Kade gumuglo mina yoba kade ta morabuka. Ye nigl wain ya ki ta nekrabuka. Te, ye mam dane wagle morabuka igne, Mudu Murubuglo mabuno bogl u, yagl gak Jon morabara si kau si tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Te, yagl gak i kade morabuka igne, ye Israel yoba tau mere agre i ede ikne u Yaglno Kade God moglkwa unabuka. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ene wan kuratnga i, ka kep yagl Elaija okna ibo yobuglo ersre, kogon podo erumere yegl ye okuo yegl mere ersre, Yagl Kade unabara ede okna pi konbaunamo ere wakai erabiwe dugwa. Yagl Kade konbaunamo ere wakai eran, yoba yagl moraiglkwa i, ye gagroma bogl aglke kor deno muduno swara yebi, te yoba God kamo duglo boglkrikwa i nomane kor idre, yoba tau God gumuglo mina du meglkwa i primere yegl praiglmiwe dugwa. Wan Jon i yegl mere Yagl Kade unabedi yoba ake kun erabiwe di, angelo yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Ana angelo i, yegl dugo, Sekaraia di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na kidagl moglko, ebina ama kidagl mogl kodugwa pre ene ka dinga i, kaima plau dinabo mo, na kinana yomiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Sekaraia yegl dugo, angelo aglke kor yegl dugwa, Na moglka i, na ege ege God gumuglo mina adigl moglko, na kagna Gebriel we digwa. Te, na ka wakai ene di te kodiga i, God na ene di tenatnedi dedugo, wiga. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ba na ka diga i, ene pre mediglkitnga pre ene dran kegl di pai moran, ene ka dikre, mogl en, wan kurantnga igne, aglke kor ka dinatnga. Ba na taragl tau plau dinabedi diga i, God yene ege paduglmere mere, kaima plau dinabiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ana Sekaraia tawa teigwa yugu yugugl moglkwa igne, yoba meda meglkwa i, ye tau kanana yugugl moglmiwedi prisre, kinano gudu meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ye kinano gudu meglko, Sekaraia ede meda ugwa ba ka ta dinabuka mere manugo, arie keme ere moglkwa pre yoba i kandre, ye yugugl moglkwa igne, gumuglomugl eruko, taragl ta kanugwa pamiwe di, yegl prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ana okuo Sekaraia ye tawa teigwa yugu yomara kogon ta erabuka paugwa i, ere kodidre, ede ikne yugomugl ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ana okuo Sekaraia ebie Elisabet dane paugo, ye ba 5-pela mere yugugl mogl, yoba meglmara wankre, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Yagl Kade na wakai pre narsre, na ere wakai ere narukwa. Na okna gak ta kuglkrika pre agai goglka ba erme agai ta goglkraluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angelo ta Maria di te, Ene Yagl Gak ta kuratne dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Gabriel appears to Mary" file="FM 125 Gabriel Appears to Mary_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.26" />Ana Elisabet dane paugo, ba 6-pela mere ede ogo, God ere mogl, ye angelomo ta kagie Gebriel we digwa ikra dedugo, angelo i ye distrik Galili suna dumo kebra ta Nasaret we dimara udre, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />abai mor ta kagie Maria we digwa i, moglmara ugwa. Maria ege swara ta kumugl yagl bogl paikriko, ye yagl ta kagie Josep we digwa i moglmara enabedi yoba di padigl kodigwa. Yagl Josep i, ye king Devit gawamo ta moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ana angelo Gebriel ye Maria moglmara udre, yegl dugwa, Abai yo, ene motno? dugwa. Yagl Kade ene ere wakai ere tedre, motnara mogl tomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Yegl dugwa ba Maria nomane sidre, Ye ka i siragl pre di narume? di, yegl kina gudu prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Yegl kina gudu pruko, angelo ye aglke kor di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kudugl goglkro! God ene wakai kanumiwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Te, ene pro! Ene dan panan, yagl gak ta kuglsre, kagie Jisas yenatniwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ye Yagl Kade ta moran, yoba ye God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa Wam moglmiwe di, yegl dinaiglmiwe dugwa. Te, Yagl Kade God ere mogl, ye kowamo Devit agaimo ye tenan, king morabuka. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ye king moglsre, Jekop gawama, Israel yoba meglkwa i, aimadi kamin sugl morabuka. Ye king morabuka i ta dudukrabiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Ana angelo i yegl di kodugo, Maria di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ege swara ta kumugl yagl bogl pai kankrika pre na siragl mere gak ta kuragle? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Yegl dugo, angelo aglke kor dugwa, God Murubuglomo ene motnara unan, God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa yobuglomo bi dinan, ene dan panabiwe dugwa. Yegl pre ene yagl gak ta kuratnga i, dem muduo pe si yenan, yoba ere mogl, Ye God Wam moglmiwe dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Te, ene pro! Abu Elisabet, ye ene bogl bormai swara meglbrika i, kidagl yei kodidre, dane paugwa. Ye ama yagl gak ta kurabuka. Yoba okna ye temne pame digwa ba ye erme dane paugo, ba 6-pela ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />I siragl pre God ye siragl ta eragledi prukwa i, erabuka keme yomiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Angelo i yegl dugo, Maria di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na Yagl Kade nigl kogonmo abai moglka. Yegl pre pra, ene taragl ta na moglmara plau dinabe dinga i, plau dinabedi priwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, angelo ye moglmara kide kodidre, ede ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria ede pi Elisabet moglmara ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ana igne i Maria ere mogl, abu Elisabet ikra kanagledi tabre ede pi muglo meglbi tau distrik Judia suna paimara i, ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Pidre, Sekaraia ya Elizabet kipabrara ede yugugl pi Elisabet kandre, wakai we di togwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ana Maria ka dugo, Elisabet prukwa igne, gak kebra ye Elisabet dane mina moglkwa i tabre kaima sumun sugwa. Yegl eruko, Mudu Murubuglo ye Elisabet moglmara si kau si togo, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Elisabet ere mogl, Maria ka podo yegl di togwa, Abu mudu meglmara suna i God ene swara ere wakai kaima ere tedre, gak ta dan mina moglkwa i ama ere wakai ere tomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ana siragl eruko, ene na Yaglna Kade mam motnga i, ede na moglmara une? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Ene pro! Ene ka dingo, na prika igne, gak ta na dana mina moglkwa i gun podo yedre, tabre sumun sugo, na prika. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Yagl Kade ene ka ta di togo, kaima plau dinabedi pre mediglnga pre ye ene ere wakai ere tomiwe di, Elisabet yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria God kagie kade togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Ana Elisabet ka yegl di kodugo, Maria ere mogl, yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">Na dena muduna mina Yaglna Kade kagie kade tedre,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />kiana mina God, gun yei teiga. Ye na ere yugwa yagle moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />I siragl pre, na ye niglmo kogonmo abu moglka i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">yoba yoko ta moglka ba ye na pre kiurekre, ere wakai ere narukwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Yegl pre yoba erme meglkwa ya okuo moraiglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">God Maria ere wakai ere tomiwe dinaiglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />God, ye yobuglomo podo paugwa i, taragl podo ere naruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">kagie i ta ede paugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Yoba ta God kuduglmo geglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">ye mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere togwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">God yoba erme meglkwa i yegl ere tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">yugobuno okuo mogl unaiglkwa i, ama yegl keme ere tenabuka.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Yene yobuglo mina taragl podo ersre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">yoba ye nomano mina mogl mitna edigwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">si pere pere edugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Yoba sia king mina moglsre, yoba pere suglno meglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">God si atne edidre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">yoba mogl atne edigwa i, ake mitna edugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ye yoba kidan gogl meglkwa i, taragl wakai wakai nenaiglmedi tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">yoba mige moni mere kan neigwa i, Yoko ede pio! dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />God ye niglmo kogonmo yoba, Israel yoba meglkwa i, ake ple di togwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">I siragl pre ye okna mitno goragle dugwa i, pre moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ye kowano awano okna di tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Abraham ya ye gawama okuo ta moraiglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">ere wakai ere tenagle dumere yegl, erme plau dumiwe di,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:55">Maria yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Ana mokomugl i, Maria ye Elisabet kana ba suota mere yegl moglsre, okuo ede ikne kipamara ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisabet Jon kuglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ana okuo Elisabet gak kurabuka egemo ugo, ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Kuglko, yoba magigl kipaigwa ya bormai swara meglkwa i ye gak ta kuglme digo, prisre, Yagl Kade ye Elisabet mirie podo goglsre, ake ple di tomiwedi pre, Elisabet bogl akie gun yei meglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ana Elisabet ye gak kuglko, wakan swara ta ede ogo, ye nagie puduo nagie boraiglkwa ege yogwa pre yoba tau mere u makai si meglkwa. Makai si moglsre, yagl gak i nem kagie, Sekaraia, ama yei tenamniwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Yegl digwa ba Elisabet mane didre, Ye kagie Jon we dinamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Dugo, yoba makai si meglkwa i aglke kor yegl digwa, Yoba ene bogl bormai swara meglmara suna i, yoba kagie yegl paugwa ta moglkrikwa pre ene kagie yegl yei tenatnga i, kuno ta erekrumiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Yegl didre, ogono mina arie ere, gak nem ama ye wam kagie siragl mere yei tenagledi prabuka i, obuno di noran, kanamnedi erikwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Yegl eriko, ye taragl ta yuibi, taragl i mina bogl atne edenagledi ogo mina yuio dugo, yuigwa. Yuigo, ye taragl i mina boglsre, Ye kagie Jon yomiwe di, yegl boglkwa. Boglko, yoba mudu i kandre, nagino keglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ana Sekaraia ye ka yegl bogl kodugo, ye dra okna si kegl dugwa ikra tabre kaima bu yogo, ye ka didre, God kagie kade togwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Yegl eruko, yoba magigl kipai meglkwa i mudu kandre, kudugl geglkwa. Kudugl goglsre, ka i di wan meglko, yoba distrik Judia, muglo meglbi paimara suna kipaigwa i, mudu prisre, ka i di ikne ikne ede meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Te, yoba ka i prikwa igne, ye kinano gudu prisre, Yagl gak i, okuo siragl mere morabada? we di, yegl digwa. I siragl pre ye prikwa i, Yagl Kade yobuglo ere, yagl gak i ake ple di togwa pamedi prikwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sekaraia God dra idre, ka kep ere dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Ana Sekaraia, yagl gak Jon nem moglkwa i, Mudu Murubuglo ye moglmara si kau si togo, ye ka kep ere, yegl dugwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />Yagl Kade, Israel yoba Godno moglkwa i, nono Israel yoba, ye yobama munga i, ake ple di norsre, nono ere ikne edugwa pre ye sigie kagie wanabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ye Yagl ta yobuglo podo paugwa nono ere inabedi dedugwa. Yagl ta nono ere inabedi dedugwa i, King Devit, God nigl kogonmo yagl okna moglkwa i, gawamo ta moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />God okna ibo ye kamo kep yobama di togo, ye bogl atne ede noro, Devit gawamo yegl ta unabiwe di, yegl beglmiwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Ana erme we, God Nono Ere Inabuka Yagle dedenagle dugwa i, kaima dedugwa pre ye nono kudano ikne ya yoba nono kide kanigwa i kubun ere noro, nono ere inabiwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:71">dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ana Sekaraia ye ka kep ere, yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">God okna nono kowano awano mitno goglsre, ake ple dinagledi yene ka kaima di te paduglkwa i, ye pre moglsre, ye dumere erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Ye nono kowano awano Abraham promismo i, <verse eid="LUK 1:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />nono kudano ikne mina kubun ere inan, nono taragl swara ta kuduglno gogl tekre, ye niglmo kogonmo ere tenamga pre dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Didre, nono ama ye gumuglo mina mabuno wakai ya du keme boraiglmedi prumiwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:75">di, Sekarai yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ana Sekaraia ka yegl didre, ama ye wam kebra Jon ka ta yegl di togwa, Te, ene na wana kebra motnga i we, yoba ene God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa i, ka kep yobamo ta motniwe dinaiglkwa. Ye yegl dinaiglkwa i, siragl pre ene Yagl Kade unabara ede okna pi konbomo ere wakai eratnga. <verse eid="LUK 1:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Te, ene God yobama, Israel yoba i di te, God siragl mere ye ere idre, ye tadaglmeno gugl edenabuka i, ene ye di tenatniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />God nono yoba ere inabuka i, ye nono mitno goglsre, dem muduo norukwa pre nono ere inabuka. Te, nono Ere Inabuka Yagle unabuka i, ye kamun tagugo, ade si yoba meglmara edumere mere yegl, heven ibo kide kodo, nono munara ede atne unabiwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Nono Ere Inabuka Yagl i, yoba mim erumara mogl, goramga pamedi kudugl gogl meglkwa i, abuglage si tenagledi unabuka. Te, nono konbauna ta duglo boglsre, deno mudno wida di inamga i, obuno di norabiwe di, Sekaraia yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Ana gak kebra i yakugo, ye kiamo ama yobuglo yugo, erukwa. Ye kade moglkwa igne, ye ede pi dumo wau yomara pidre, kipai moglkwa. Ye dumo wau yomara kipai moglsre, okuo ede nogugl u Israel yoba mabuno bogl ka mabuno beke togwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Maria dumo Betlehem mogl, Jisas kuglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matyu 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ana igne i Rom King, Sisar Ogastus we digwa i ere mogl, lo ta padiglsre, yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, kagno inamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Rom gavman ege i, keremoknayene yoba kagno yegl mere igwa. Te, igne i yagl ta kagie Kwirinius we digwa i, provins Siria gavana moglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom yoba dumo kane kane sugl moglsre, ere i provins edigwa i, dumo Israel provins ta Siria we dimara suna i yogwa.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Ana Rom king lo yegl mere paduglkwa pre yoba mudu ede yugunomugl pidre, gavman yoba kagno tenamnedi ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yegl pre Josep ama ye distrik Galili, dumo kebra Nasaret moglmara i kide kodo, ede distrik Judia pi dumo kebra ta Betlehem we dimara i ogwa. I siragl pre dumo i, okna King Devit yugomugl yogo, Josep Devit gawamo ta moglkwa pre dumo Betlehem ye yugomugl yogwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Te, ye ogwa igne, Maria dane paugo, ye Josep bogl akie ede ebrika. I siragl pre Maria ye Josep moglmara enabedi di padigl kodigwa pre gavman yoba ye kagno suo akie tenabugledi ede ebrika.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ana Josep ya Maria ede dumo Betlehem pidre, dumo i miurko, Maria ye gak kurabuka egemo ugo, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />ye wam komono kuglsre, lap mina were, agl bugla kugl neigwa boks i mina atne ugl paduglkwa. I siragl pre haus pasindia kau sugwa pre ye agl bugla paimara akie paigwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria Jisas kuglko, angelo sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba di teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Shepherds at night" file="FM 128 Angel Brings News to Shepherds_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="2.8" />Ana dumo igle sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba ama meglkwa. Ye taun meda sipsipno meglmara eduer suglno meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Suglno meglko, Yagl Kade angelomo ta ye meglmara tabre plau dugo, God abuglagemo ama si ye meglmara edugwa pre ye kudugl podo geglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kudugl geglkwa ba angelo i ye di tedre, Ene kudugl goglkrio! dugwa. Ene prio. Na ka wakai ta di tebo, ene gun podo yenaiglmiwa. Ka wakai i ene pribi, yoba mudu pra pra ama praiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ka wakai i yegl pre diga, Erme Devit taunmo dumo Betlehem i mina, abu ta gak kuglmiwa. Gak i ene Ere Inabuka Yagl moglkwa. Ye Yagl Kade moglsre, God Kere Yugwa yagl ama moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Te, ene taragl ta kandre, gak i moglmedi kanaiglkwa. Gak i ye lap mina wersre, agl bugla kugl neimara boksmo ta yomara ugl padiglkwa pre ene kandre, gak i moglmedi kanaiglmiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ana angelo i yegl dugo, angelo mere kide, ye heven amimo meglkwa i, tabre angelo swara ta moglmara i plau digwa. Ye plau didre, God kagie kade te, yegl digwa, <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />God ye mogl mitna kaima edugwa i, debie sinamniwa. Te, God ye wakai kanugwa yoba ta makandigle meglkwa i, deno muduno wida dinabiwe di, angelo wagle i, yegl digwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba pi, gak kebra Jisas kanigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ana angelo wagle i, ka yegl didre, ede ikne heven ibo eigwa igne, sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba yene di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Nono ede dumo Betlehem omno! digwa. Yagl Kade ye no di norsre, taragl ta plau dume dugwa i, nono pi kanamniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Ye yegl didre, tabre pi Maria ya Josep doko kandre, gak kebra ikra agl bugla kugl neigwa boks i mina ugl pai moglko, kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Kandre, ede meda eigwa igne, angelo ye gak i pre ka siragl mere dugwa i, ye di wai digwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Di wai di eigo, yoba ta prikwa i, mudu nagino keglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ye nagino keglkwa ba Maria ye taragl plau dugwa i pre kina gudu aimadi pre moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ana sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba i, ye ede ikne sipsipno meglmara pidre, taragl tau prisre, kandre, erikwa i pre God debie sidre, kagie kade teigwa. I siragl pre angelo ye ka di tomere mere kuno yegl plau dugo, kanigwa pre ye God kagie kade teigwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep, Maria bogl Jisas agre i ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara ebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ana Maria Jisas kuglko, wakan swara ta ede ogo, ye nagie puduo nagie boraiglkwa igne, Maria ya Josep ye kagie Jisas yei tebrika. Kagie i ye mam dane wagle moglkrukwa igne, angelo ye kagie yegl yeiro dumere ikra, yei tebrika.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ana Moses okna lo boglmara suna i, ye abu ta gak kuran, ege tau sugl moglsre, okuo tawa tenabe dugwa. Tawa yegl tebi, gak i God gumuglo mina deglbi yeikrabedi tawa tenaiglkwa pre paugwa. Moses lo pamere ege i dumere plau dugo, Josep ya Maria ye Jisas i pi Yagl Kade tenabugledi ede ebrika. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />I siragl pre Yagl Kade lomo mina ama yegl dugwa, Yagl gak komono ta morabuka i, ye Yagl Kade taraglmo mere yegl morabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 13.2</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Yegl pre ye Jisas i pi Yagl Kade tedre, ye lomo dumere mere ama tawa tenabugledi ede ebrika. Yagl Kade lomo dugwa i, abu ta gak kuran, ye okuo kua tobu suo mo kua yumugl gagigle suo idre, tawa narabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa Yoba 5.11</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ana igne i yagl ta dumo Jerusalem moglkwa, ye kagie Simeon we digwa. Yagl i ye yagl du moglsre, God we di pre wan moglkwa. Te, ye ama God Kere Yugwa yagl u no Israel yoba ake ple di norabedi sugl moglko, Mudu Murubuglo ye moglmara si kau si togwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ana okna, Mudu Murubuglo yagl i yegl di te kodugwa, Yagl Kade ye Kere Yugwa Yagl dedenan, ene gumugln mina kandre, okuo goratniwe di, togwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Ana igne i Mudu Murubuglo ye yagl Simeon auro yu tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna edugo, moglkwa. Moglko, Jisas nem mam ye God lomo dumere gak kebra Jisas yu Yagl Kade tenabugledi ama ede togl suna ubrika. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Ye ede togl suna ubriko, Simeon ye kandre, pi Jisas ake yu kugro moglsre, God kagie kade te, yegl dugwa,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />Yagl Kade yo, na ene niglnen kogonen yoba moglka i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">ene okna na di natnere mere yegl ere kodinga pre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">erme dena muduna wida dugo, na goraglka pra we di prika.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ene dinere yegl, no Ere Yugwa Yagl gumuglna mina kaniga.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Ene ye yoba mudu ere inabedi kere idre, ye dedingo, ugwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ye yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i konbauna kanaiglmedi ere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">abuglage mere yegl si tedre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">ene yobanma, Israel yoba munga i, ama ake mitna edenan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">yoba mudu kanaiglmiwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 2:32">di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ana yagl Simeon gak kebra Jisas pre ka yegl dugo, ye nem mam prisre, nagino kiurka. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Nagino kiurko, Simeon ere mogl, ye suo akie di wakai yei tedre, Jisas mam Maria ama yegl di togwa, Ene kano! Gak i pre God ka ta di padigl, Israel yoba tau mere ye mokono tedre, yage sibi, te tau mere ye pre mediglsre, adiglbi, erabiwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Te, yegl eran, yoba nomano teke paugwa i, ama ede nogugl unabuka. Te, ene giugl prisre, yoba ta bainet mina na dena muduna sumedi pratniwe di, Simeon yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ana igne i abu kidagl ta God kamo kep ere dugwa abu moglkwa, ye kagie Anna we digwa. Ye Israel yoba yugobuno kebra kebra meglmara suna i yugobuno ta Aser we dimara suna i moglsre, yagl ta kagie Fanuel we digwa i, abuglo moglkwa. Abu i ye okna wie bogl bugla yugu 7-pela miurko, ye wie goglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Wie goglko, ye abu werai mogl padre, igne i bugla yugu 84 ne kodugwa. Ye yegl mere kidagl moglsre, tawa teigwa yugu yomara keme mogl, ede meda pikrukwa. Ye dumo i keme moglsre, God kagie kade te, ege mere kaya mokna mawagl ersre, kamage keme erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ana yagl Simeon ye Josep ya Maria bogl ka di meglko, abu kidagl Anna i, ama ede magigl udre, ka digwa prisre, God di wakai yei togwa. Tedre, Anna pidre, God Jerusalem ere inabedi sugl meglkwa yobamo i, mudu Jisas pre di te moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep, Maria ye Jisas bogl ede ikne Nasaret eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Boy Jesus in temple" file="FM 136 Boy Jesus in the Temple_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="2.39" />Ana Josep ya Maria ye Yagl Kade lomo dumere mere ere kodidre, Jisas auro i ede ikne pi distrik Galili pidre, yene yugunomugl, dumo kebra Nasaret we dimara i, ebrika. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Ana Yagl Gak Jisas we, ye yakidre, yobuglo idre, ere moglkwa. Yegl ere moglsre, ye ama nomane podo yugo, God ye ere wakai ere te pai moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Gak Jisas dumo Jerusalem mogl pai moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41-42" />Ana bugla yugu yomere yomere ege swarade Israel yoba ere mogl, okna ibo God no oglo sidre, Isip yoba si goglkra we di prisre, kaya mokna podo ne ne erikwa. Ana Jisas nem mam ama ege ege pi ne mogl ebriko, Jisas bugla yugu 12-pela ne kodugwa igne, ye ama akie ege kade i kanamnedi ede Jerusalem eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ye pi Jerusalem suna wan mogl eigo, ege i dudugo, aglke ede ikne yugunomugl enamnedi wigwa. Ana ye ede wigwa igne i ye nem mam ede ubrika ba Jisas Jerusalem mogl pai moglkwa i, nem mam ta kiribrika. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Ye pribrika i, yoba mere kide wimara suna i, ye ama uda umedi prisre, ye ede ubrika. Ba ye pi konbo bage pi miurko, mim eruko, Jisas pre dokibrika. Ye neno agroma ya kabaglema meglmara suna i dokibrika. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ye dokibrika kankrisre, aglke kor ede ikne dumo Jerusalem ebrika. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ye ede ikne Jerusalem pi dokibriko, ege suota ede ogo, ye tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna moglko, kanibrika. Ye kanibrika i, yagl tau yoba God kamo beke teigwa i ame di meglmara suna mogl, ye ka di teigwa i prisre, ka kira pogl pre, erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Ye yegl eruko, yoba pre meglkwa i, Aya! di, Yagl gak i nomane podo paugo, yoba ye ka kira pogl teigwa i di ikne ede, ka wakai dumiwedi prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Te, ye yegl ere moglko, ye nem mam ama kandre, nagino kiurka. Nagino kiurko, ye mam ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Wana yo, ene siragl pre mabuno yegl ere notne? dugwa. Ene aglo mere motnga i, na ene nen bogl kankrubuglka pre nomano sidre, ene dokubugle dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye nem mam di te, yegl dugwa, Siragl eruko, ene na dokibre? Na Nina yugumo moraglka paugwa i, ene ta prikribro? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ye ka yegl dugwa ba ye nem mam ka dugwa i, mabuno pre pogl sikribrika.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ana Jisas nem mam bogl aglke ede ikne dumo Nasaret eigo, ye nem mam kano duglo bogl moglkwa. Duglo bogl moglko, ye mam Maria taragl tau Jisas mina dumo Jerusalem plau dugwa ikra aimadi kina gudu prukwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Te, Jisas we, ye yakidre, nomane kor kor idre, erukwa. Yegl eruko, God ye wakai kanugo, yoba ama ye wakai kanigwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Jon ka mabuno didre, yoba nigl bugl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matyu 3.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:2-8">Mak 1.2-8</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ana Rom king, ye kagie Sisar Taiberius we digwa i, bugla yugu 15-pela king moglkwa igne, Jon ye kogon mabuno bogl ersre, yoba ka mabuno di togwa. Ege i yoba kade tau yegl mere meglkwa, Pontius Pailat ye distrik Judia gavana moglko, Herot ye distrik Galili sugl moglko, Herot agigle Filip ye distrik suo Ituria ya Trakonitis sugl moglkwa. Te, igne i Lisanias ye distrik Abilene sugl moglko, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anas ya Kaiafas ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno miurka. Igne i Jon, Sekaraia wam moglkwa ikra, dumo wau yomara moglko, God kamo i, Jon moglmara ugwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Ugo, Jon ye dumo tau nigl Jordan omara magigl yeigwa i mudu wan pidre, yoba ka mabuno di togwa. Ye ka mabuno dugwa i, yoba ta nomano yake tenaiglkwa i, ye i nogugl edinamnedi nigl buraiglme dugwa. Te, ye yegl eribi, God ye tadaglmeno gugl edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ana Jon kogon yegl erukwa i, ka tau okna ka kep yagl Aisaia buk ta boglmara suna paugwa i, plau dugwa. Ye yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Yagl ta dumo wau yomara mogl, ka podo di, yoba yegl di tenabiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Yagl Kade unabuka pre ene ye konbomo ake kun ersre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">ye unabara ake du di edenaiglkwa pamiwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Dumo ta guglo yenabuka i, ere wakai ersre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Muglo meglbi podo ya kebra pra, wake, i atne edibi, auduno yenabiwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Te, konbo ta gekenabara i, ene ake du edidre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">konbo kide erabara ere wakai eraiglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Ene yegl eribi, God ye yoba siragl mere ere inabuka i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">yoba mudu kanaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 40.3-5</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:6">di, yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Ana yoba mere Jon nigl bugl norabedi wigwa ba Jon ye yegl di togwa, Ene toki kide nagiglema meglmiwe dugwa. God dem kubrisre, ka tage norabuka igne i ene teke panaiglmedi ira dume? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ene ka kaima nomano ta yake teigwa panan, ene mabuno boraiglmara i mina i nogugl edenaiglkwa pamiwe dugwa. Te, ene ere mogl, Abraham gawama munga pre God no ta sikrabe digwa i, yegl ta dikrio! Kobuglo magigl paigwa i Abraham gawama koglo edidre, ye swara ere wakai ere tenagledi pran, ye erabuka kuno erabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ene prio! Ede tau mogo koraiglkwa paugwa ba mogo wakai ta koglkribi, yoba di maima idre, wei atne ede, gudu i pi, pia si doga mina edimere mere yegl, God ene yegl ere tenarume di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ana Jon yegl dugo, yoba mere makai si meglkwa i, ye di pre, Ana no siragl eramne? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yegl digo, Jon ye di ikne ede tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene gaglnen suna suo ta yenan, ene agitn ta gaglmo suna yekrabuka i, ta to! dugwa. Te, ene kaya moknanen mere ta yenan, ene ama kuno yegl mere eratniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Jon ka yegl mere di kodugo, taks igwa yagl tau nigl buramnedi wigwa i, Jon di pre, No siragl eramne? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yegl digo, Jon ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene Gavman ta io dinabere i keme io! Tau ama i tebe edinamnedi erekrio dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Yegl dugo, kibr nem tau ama Jon yegl di prikwa, No kibr nem munga i, siragl eramne? digwa. Yegl digo, Jon ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene yoba migeno gudu i nekre, te ye taraglno inamnedi ama kot kibi ere tekrio! Ba gavman ene fotnait ta teigwa i, pra norimedi praiglkwa pamiwe di, Jon yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ana yoba mudu God Kere Yugwa Yagl unabedi kwie ere meglkwa i, Jon u ka dugwa i, prisre, Aiya, yagl i ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl ta unabe digwa ikra moglmo mo di, kinano gudu meglko, <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Jon mane di prisre, ye mudu yegl di togwa, Na ene nigl mina nigl bugl teiga ba yagl ta unabuka i, ye yobuglomo podo padre, na egre atne edumiwa. Te, na ama ye nigl kogonmo yoba mere yegl moglsre, ye kagle towo kan i na poko edenaglka kuno erekriwa. Te, yagl i udre, na nigl bugl teimere mere ene tau God Murubuglomo si kau si tedre, te tau si doga mina edidre, erabiwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Yoba wit mogo si yu makai sidre, ugla pogl, mogo yugugl makai sidre, nagie gagl tege erimere mere yegl, yagl i udre, kuno yegl erabuka. Te, ye garabara i, doga gogokre, aimadi de pai morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ana Jon ka yegl mere didre, ye God kamo wakai i, yoba di nogugl ede tenagledi ama ka gigledi tau mere yoba i di togwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herot Jon si kane sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ana Jon ere mogl, yagl Herot, ye gavman sugl moglkwa yagl ka togwa. Ka tedre, Ene agitn ebie Herodias inga i, aglau etniwe didre, Herot mabuno kide mere erumara pre ama ka togwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ka togo, Herot ere mogl, Jon si kane sugwa. Herot tadaglme mere erukwa ba Jon si kane sugwa i, tadaglme ta ama akie ere i tebe edugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon Jisas ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matyu 3.13-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mak 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ana okna, Herot ye Jon si kane sikrukwa igne, Jon ye yoba tau mere kide nigl bugl tedre, Jisas ama nigl bugl togwa. Ana igne i Jisas nigl bugl kodidre, kamage ere moglko, kamun mitna ibo ede u koglo koglo ogo, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Mudu Murubuglo u kua yumugl mere yegl pidre, pru di ede atne u Jisas moglmara ugwa. Ugo, God heven ibo ka ta di atne edidre, yegl dugwa, Ene na Wana motniwa. Na dena muduna ene tedre, ene wakai kaima kaniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas kowanemo kagno epigl paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matyu 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Ana Jisas kogon mabuno bogl erukwa igne, ye bugla yugu 30 mere yegl ne kodugwa. Ana yoba prikwa i, Jisas ye Josep wam moglmedi prikwa. Te, Josep ye yagl Heli wam moglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoba tau prikwa i, Heli ye Maria nem kagie paugwa. Te, tau prikwa i, Josep nem kagie paugwa, ba Matyu 1.16 mina, Josep nem i, kagie Jekop pame dugwa. Yegl pre, Heli ye Maria nem moglkwa paugwa.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli ye Matat wam moglkwa. Te, Matat ye Livai wam moglkwa. Te, Livai ye Melki wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:24">Te, Melki ye Janai wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:24">Te, Janai ye Josep wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Ana Josep ye Matatias wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:25">Te, Matatias ye Amos wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:25">Te, Amos ye Nahum wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:25">Te, Nahum ye Esli wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:25">Te, Esli ye Nagai wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Ana Nagai ye Mat wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:26">Te, Mat ye Matatias wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:26">Te, Matatias ye Semen wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:26">Te, Semen ye Josek wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:26">Te, Josek ye Joda wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Ana Joda ye Joanan wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:27">Te, Joanan ye Resa wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:27">Te, Resa ye Serubabel wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:27">Te, Serubabel ye Sealtiel wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:27">Te, Sealtiel ye Neri wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Ana Neri ye Melki wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:28">Te, Melki ye Adi wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:28">Te, Ade ye Kosam wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:28">Te, Kosam ye Elmadam wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:28">Te, Elmadam ye Er wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ana Er ye Josua wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:29">Te, Josua ye Elieser wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:29">Te, Elieser ye Jorim wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:29">Te, Jorim ye Matat wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:29">Te, Matat ye Livai wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Ana Livai ye Simeon wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:30">Te, Simeon ye Juda wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:30">Te, Juda ye Josep wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:30">Te, Josep ye Jonam wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:30">Te, Jonam ye Eliakim wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Ana Eliakim ye Melea wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:31">Te, Melea ye Mena wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:31">Te, Mena ye Matata wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:31">Te, Matata ye Natan wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:31">Te, Natan ye Devit wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Ana Devit ye Jesi wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:32">Te, Jesi ye Obet wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:32">Te, Obet ye Boas wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:32">Te, Boas ye Salmon wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:32">Te, Salmon ye Nason wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Ana Nason ye Aminadap wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:33">Te, Aminadap ye Atmin wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:33">Te, Atmin ye Arni wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:33">Te, Arni ye Hesron wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:33">Te, Hesron ye Peres wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:33">Te, Peres ye Juda wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Ana Juda ye Jekop wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:34">Te, Jekop ye Aisak wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:34">Te, Aisak ye Abraham wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:34">Te, Abraham ye Tera wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:34">Te, Tera ye Nahor wam moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Ana Nahor ye Seruk wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:35">Te, Seruk ye Reu wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:35">Te, Reu ye Pelek wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:35">Te, Pelek ye Eber wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:35">Te, Eber ye Sela wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Ana Sela ye Kainan wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:36">Te, Kainan ye Arpaksat wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:36">Te, Arpaksat ye Siem wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:36">Te, Siem ye Noa wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:36">Te, Noa ye Lamek wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Ana Lamek ye Metusela wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:37">Te, Metusela ye Enok wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:37">Te, Enok ye Jaret wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:37">Te, Jaret ye Mahalalel wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:37">Te, Mahalalel ye Kenan wam moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Ana Kenan ye Enos wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:38">Te, Enos ye Set wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:38">Te, Set ye Adam wam moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:38">Te, Adam, ye God wam moglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Satan Jisas kina sugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matyu 4.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mak 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Ana Mudu Murubuglo ye Jisas moglmara si kau si togo, Jisas ye nigl Jordan omara kide kodidre, ede ikne ogwa. Ogo, Mudu Murubuglo ere mogl, ye auro i pi dumo wau yomara suna edugo, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />ye dumo wau yomara suna i, ege 40-pela de moglko, Satan ye eran, kanagledi kina sugwa. Jisas ye ege 40-pela de i, kaya mokna mawagl erukwa pre ege i dudugo, ye kidan podo goglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ye kidan podo goglko, Satan ye yegl di togwa, Ene God Wam kaima motn, ene kobuglo magigl paigwa i di tedre, u bret koglo eo do! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne edidre, yegl dugwa, God kamo mina yoba ta yegl boglkwa, Yoba bret keme idre, kor moglkrabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 8.3</char></note> di, yegl boglme dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Satan ye agre i pi dumo mitna kaima ibo ta edidre, king dumo uglo koglo koglo sugl meglkwa i, Jisas kanabedi tabre kaima yu magigl edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6-7" />Yu magigl ede tedre, yegl dugwa, Dumo uglo koglo koglo wakai kaima yogwa kanga i, na ogona mina yogo, yoba ira ta sugl moraiglmedi prika i, nana teiga. Yegl pre ene goglkon bodugl narsre, kagna kade natn, taragl kanga i, mudu ene tebo, ene kagn wanabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" /><figure style="fig" alt="Pinnacle of Temple" file="FM 142 Tempation on Pinnacle of Temple_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="4.8" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, God kamo mina yoba ta yegl boglkwa, God, ene Yaglnen Kade moglkwa i, ye swara goglkon bodugl tedre, kagie kade tenatniwe di, yegl boglme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 6.13-14, 10.20</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, Satan ye auro i pi Jerusalem suna pidre, tawa teigwa yugu yomara tebe kaima ibo edidre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene God Wam kaima motn, ene puglo di, yage atne suo. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />I siragl pre God kamo yegl dugwa, God angeloma dedenan, ene sugln moraiglmiwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Te, ene kagln kobuglo bogl dinatga pre ye angeloma ene ake i mitna edinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 91.11-12</char></note> di, yegl beglkwa pame dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Satan yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, God kamo bage ta ama yegl dugwa, God, ene Yaglnen Kade moglkwa i, ene ye eran kanagledi erekro!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 6.16</char></note> dumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ana Satan ye yegl mere Jisas kina si kodidre, ye ege ta ikne unagledi Jisas kide kodo, ede ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede dumo Nasaret ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matyu 4.12-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mak 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Ana God Murubuglo Jisas yobuglo te moglko, Jisas ede ikne distrik Galili ogwa. Ogo, distrik Galili suna i, ye kamo wai dugo, yoba mudu prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Priko, ka mabuno yugu bage bage ta kei yeimara Jisas wan pi yoba ka beke togo, yoba mudu wakai prisre, ye debie sigwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasaret yoba Jisas mokono teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matyu 13.53-58</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mak 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Ana Jisas wan ede pi dumo Nasaret, ye gak kebra mogl, yakumara i ogwa. Pidre, wakan kade ege ye ege ege erumere mere yegl, ye ede ka mabuno yugu yugugl pidre, God kamo kere tenagledi yoba gumanomugl adigl moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Adigl moglko, ka kep yagl ta kagie Aisaia ka okna bogl atne edugo, pepa mina paugwa i, Jisas kerenabedi yoba ta yu togwa. Togo, Jisas ake pigla didre, bage ta doko idre, yoba kere togwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />Kere te yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade Murubuglomo we, na moglmara mogl narumiwa. I siragl pre yoba ka wakai di tenatnedi God na kere i pere edidre, goduglme yoba meglkwa i ka wakai di to dumiwa. Te, yoba kane paigwa i, ene i meda ede, yoba gumuglno kin yeigwa i, kanaiglmiwe di to. Te, yoba tau yubun kane kane teigo, atne meglkwa i, na ye i eglke edibo, wakai moraiglme didre, <verse eid="LUK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />te God yoba ere inabuka egemo i, ama u kodumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 61.1-2, 58.6</char></note> di, na ka yegl di to! dumiwe di, Jisas yegl kere togwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Jisas kere te kodo, pepa ake suna ede, i pi, yagl ta pepa sugl moglkwa i tedre, ame dugwa. Ye ame dugo, yoba mudu ka mabuno yugu yugugl meglkwa i ye toro kan meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ye toro kan meglko, Jisas ere mogl, yoba yegl di togwa, Na God kamo ene kere teigo, prikwa i, erme magigl i plau dumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, yoba ye kamo pre meglkwa i, ye ka wakai kaima dumedi prisre, nagino kogl, debie sigwa. Komno kana debie sigwa ba okuo ye ere mogl, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye nono bogl kuno mungo, ye Josep wam kra moglmiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ana yoba i yegl digo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yoba niga nigadi ka yegl digwa, Ene dokta kaima ta motn, enene kidenen ere wakai etn, kanamniwe di, ege ege yegl digwa i, na di bogl, di naramnedi erikwa. Ene yegl di naramnedi erikwa i, Ene kimagl dumo Kapernaum etnga i, enene yugunomugl magigl i ama ta etn, pre medramniwe di, ene yegl di primiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ene ka yegl di naraiglkwa ba ene kaima di teiga. God kamo kep yoba ta morabuka i, yoba dumo pere pere moraiglkwa i, ye kamo praiglkwa ba yene yugomugl yoba meglkwa i, ye eran, kaima ta prikraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ana Jisas ye di tedre, Na ene ka kaima di teie dugwa. Okna kaima ibo Elaija moglkwa igne i bugla yugu suota ba 6-pela mere kamun sikruko, Israel kamin kidan podo kide yogwa. Yogwa igne i abu werai mere kide suna Israel kamin meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Meglkwa ba God ye Elaija dedidre, abu werai wagle i ere wakai ere to ta dikrukwa. Ye abu werai ta Israel abu moglkrukwa ta taun kebra Sarefat we digwa, taun kade Saidon bina ta yomara kipai moglmara i dedugo, ede ome dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Te, ka kep yagl Elisa moglkwa igne, Israel yoba tau mere kide leprosi paugwa ba God ye ta ere wakai ere tekrukwa. Ba yagl Naman Israel yoba moglkrukwa, ye kantri Siria nem moglkwa ikra keme ere wakai ere tomiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and cliff" file="CN01680B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="4.28" />Ana God yoba pere ere wakai ere togwa i pre dugo, yoba mere kide ka mabuno yugu yugugl pre meglkwa i, deno boglko, <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />adiglsre, Jisas taun yomara si meda edinamnedi auro ede meda wigwa. Ye tauno i muglo ta kei yeigwa. Guglo kogl koglo yogo, suna kei yeigwa pre Jisas si ake nu si atne edinamnedi auro ede guglo yomara magigl wigwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Wigwa ba Jisas ye eimara suna i konbauno pidre, ede pi ede ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas murubuglo kide ta di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mak 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ana Jisas ede taun Kaperneam ogwa. Kaperneam i distrik Galili suna i yogwa. Ana ye pi igle moglsre, wakan kade ege, ege ege ede ka mabuno yugu yugugl pidre, God kamo beke togo, <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />yoba prisre, nagino keglkwa. I siragl pre ye God kamo beke togwa i, ye yene kagie kade paugwa mere yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />God kamo beke togo, yagl ta murubuglo kide moglkwa ta ama moglkwa. Moglkwa i, ye Jisas kandre, ka podo didre, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />Aya, Jisas ene Nasaret nem motnga i, no siragl ere nora une? No ere kide ere nora uno mo? Te, ene ira motnga i, na pre kan erie dugwa. Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl ikra motniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Murubuglo kide i, yegl dugo, Jisas ka gigledi yegl di togwa, Ene dran si kegl didre, yagl i moglmara kide kodo ede meda wo dugwa. Dugo, murubuglo kide i, yoba meglmara suna yagl i ere edugo, yage sugo, ede meda ogwa ba murubuglo kide yagl i ta ere kide ere tekre, yoko ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Ede ogo, yoba mudu yugugl meglkwa i nagino kogl, di ikne ikne ede yegl digwa, Aya, yagl i ka kor ta yu di norumiwe digwa. Didre, Ye ama yagl kade mere yegl ta moglsre, ka yobuglo bogl dugo, murubuglo kide ama ye kamo duglo boglsre, yoba meglmara kide kodo ede meda wime digwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ye yegl didre, ede meda wigwa igne, Jisas kamo di wai digo, yoba distrik Galili suna i, mudu prikwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita abu imakie kide sugo, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-15">Matyu 8.14-15</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:29-31">Mak 1.29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Ana Jisas ka mabuno yugu kide kodo, ede pi Saimon Pita kipamara ogwa. Ogo, Saimon ebie mam nagie niga podo dugo, yugugl i pai moglkwa. Pai moglko, yoba tau Jisas ye ere wakai ere tenabedi di prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Di priko, Jisas pi pai moglmara adigl moglsre, kidemo i ka gigledi di togwa. Di togo, ye kidemo bu yogo, abumo i tabre adigl, ye kaya mokna nenaiglmedi ere wakai ere gaglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba mere kaima kideno ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">Matyu 8.16-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:32-39">Mak 1.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ana ade ede prak ogwa igne, yoba tau kide kane kane sigwa i, Jisas ye ere wakai ere tenabedi auro yuigwa. Yuigo, Jisas ye pi swara swarade akugo, kideno aragan eruko, <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />te, murubuglo kide yoba mere meglmara atne meglkwa i, ama ede meda udre, ka podo di, Ene God Wam motniwe digwa. Yegl digwa ba Jisas ene ka yegl dikrio di mane di togwa. Jisas God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmedi ye pre kan ersre, digwa pre Jisas mane di togwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ana tagna ta i, Jisas adigl ede pi dumo wau yomara ta ogo, yoba ye pre dokigwa. Doko pi kanigo, moglko, ye dumono kide kodo ede pi dinabedi si kegl dinamnedi erikwa <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />ba Jisas ere mogl, yegl di togwa, Na ede dumo tau ama pidre, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i pre dinaglka pamiwa. I siragl pre God na yegl ero dedugo, wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Jisas yegl didre, ye adigl ede pi distrik Judia suna ka mabuno yugu ta kei yeimara i swara swarade God kamo yoba beke te ede ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jisas Saimon Pita di togo, ye buglo bagle tau mere ere sugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matyu 4.18-22</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mak 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Man fishing" file="lb00210b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="5.1" />Ana ege ta Jisas nigl nubun Genesaret bina adigl moglsre, God kamo yoba beke te moglko, yoba mere ka dinan, pramnedi u kau si, gagno bolamugl kaima moglsre, ka dugwa pre meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ana Jisas ka beke te mogl kan iro ede kanugwa i, baglkugl suo nigle bina pai miurko, kanugwa. Baglkugl suo i, buglo bagle ere sigwa yoba yu padiglsre, degigl gaglno was ere meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Jisas ye baglkugl suo i kandre, swara ta puglo di ede tebe ogwa. Baglkugl i, Saimon pre yogwa. Ye puglo di ede tebe pi moglsre, Saimon agle didre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene u baglkugl kuri ta ake nu si nigle suna edo! dugwa. Yegl dugo, Saimon ye dumere eruko, Jisas baglkugl tebe ame di moglsre, yoba nigle bina meglkwa i, God kamo beke togwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ana Jisas ka mabuno di kodidre, Saimon di tedre, Ene agiglnma bogl bakugl i pi nigl mur yomara suna iro pidre, degigl gaglno ede nigl atne edio! Edidre, buglo bagle ere sinaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Yegl dugo, Saimon ere mogl, Yagl Kade yo, ene dinga ba no kogon i ere mungo, kamun tagugwa buglo bagle swara kaima ta sikrumga ba ene dinga pre pra, no i pi edinamniwe didre, i pi suna edigwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Suna iro edigwa i, buglo bagle mabuno ta kaimane ede u atne pidre, degigl gagl si argla dinamnedi eriko, <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />ye kabaglema tau bakugl ta mina wan meglkwa i, arie ere wio digwa. Ake ple di noraiglmedi wio digo, wigo, buglo bagle mere i bakugl mina ede meglko, bakugl suo akie kau sidre, ede nigl atne enabugledi eribrika.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugo, Saimon Pita kandre, kudugl podo gogl, u Jisas gumamugl yage kobragai pai, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na tadaglme yoba moliwa. Ene na moglmara magigl ukre, ede eglke po! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Ye ka yegl dugwa i, i siragl pre ye kabaglema bogl fis mabuno ta sedigwa meglkwa i kandre, kudugl podo geglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ye kabaglemo meglmara suna i, yagl suo ta Pita bogl akie kogon babun erikwa i, Sebedi wam suo, Jems ya Jon ama moglsre, kudugl giurka. Mudu kudugl geglkwa ba Jisas ere mogl, Saimon Pita di tedre, Kudugl goglkro dugwa. Ene buglo bagle ere si yunere yegl yoba ama ere yu suna edinatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Yegl dugo, Pita ye kabaglemo bogl baglkugl suo i aware si, yu meda edidre, taraglno mudu kide kodo, Jisas duglo bogl ede eigwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl ta leprosi erukwa ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matyu 8.1-4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mak 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ana aglke ta Jisas taun ta suna moglko, yagl ta leprosi ogo nagie mina mudu paugwa ta Jisas kandre, u ye gumamugl yage kobragai padre, kamage yei, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene na ere wakai ere naragledi pitn, ene eratnga kuno erumedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yegl dugo Jisas ye ogo i pi yagl i akidre, yegl dugwa, Kaima na ene ere wakai ere tenagledi priwa. Ene kidenen aragan erabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i ogo nagie tabre kaima u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yegl eruko, Jisas ye ka gigledi yegl di togwa, Na erika i, ene yoba swara ta di tekro! Ene yoba ta di tekre, tawa teigwa yoba kogon erimara ogon nagn obuno didre, Moses okna dumere mere tawa ta tenatnga. Ten, ye ene kidenen aragan erukwa pamedi kanaiglme dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Yegl dugwa ba ka i wai dugo, yoba mere kide ede Jisas moglmara wigwa. Ye ka dinan, prisre, te kideno ama ere wakai ere norabedi wigwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Yegl wigwa ba Jisas ege tau mere ye kide kodo ede pi dumo wau yomara pidre, kamage erukwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl ta ogo kagle mawa sugwa ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matyu 9.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mak 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Paralytic being let down through roof" file="lb00305b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="5.17" />Ana Yagl Kade Jisas yobuglo bogl togo, yoba kide sigwa i, ere wakai erabuka kuno erukwa. Kuno eruko, ege swara ta Jisas yugugl moglsre, yoba ka beke te moglko, Farisi yeigo, ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba ama suna i akie ame di mogl, ka dugwa i pre meglkwa. Ye dumo Jerusalem mogl wigo, tau dumo Galili mogl wigo, te dumo Judia koglo koglo i, ama mogl wigo, erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Ka pre meglko, yoba tau ere mogl, yagl ta ogo kagle goglkwa ye gagle ersre, boglo ere yu Jisas moglmara ede yugugl enamnedi wigwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Wigwa ba ye yugugl enaiglkwa i, yugugl ime yoba mere kide kau si, ogono gagno bolamugl meglko, enaiglkwa kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa pre ye pra we di, ede u idaule pidre, idaule taragl tau terke i eglke edidre, yagl i gagle bogl ede atne edigwa. Yoba mere kide meglmara yagl i yage Jisas gumamugl paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Paugo, yagl wagle pre mediglkwa i, Jisas kandre, yagl kagle goglkwa i di te, Kumula, ene tadaglmenen gugl ede teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba suna meglkwa i, ye prisre, Yagl i ira moglsre, God agaimo inagledi ka kide yegl dume? God swara yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede tenan, kuno erabiwe di, yegl prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yegl priko, ye deno muduno mina prikwa i, Jisas kwande kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre nomano mina yegl di pre meglme? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Na siragl ka dibo yuwaglke panabedi prime? Yagl i di tedre, tadaglmenen gugl ede teie dibo, yuwaglke panabo mo yagl i di tedre, adigl, konbauna ede po dibo, yuwaglke panabedi prime? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Na ene yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede tekrabedi prikwa ba na Yoba Wam moglka i, yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede tenaglka i, kagna paugwa pre erme taragl ta eribo, kan pogl sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl didre, yagl ta ogo kagle goglkwa i yegl di togwa, Na ene di teiga, ene adigl, kuguglnen akidre, ede kipanara po! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Yegl dugo, yagl i tabre kaima yoba gumuglno mina adigl, kuguglmo akidre, God kagie kade tedre, tedre, konbauna ede kipamara ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ede meda ogo, yoba mudu kandre, kudugl podo gogl, God kagie kade tedre, yegl digwa, Nono okna taragl yegl ta kankunere mere erme kamniwe digwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Livai agle didre, Na duglo boglo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matyu 9.9-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mak 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ana okuo Jisas konbauna pidre, taks yugwa yagl ta taks imara ame di moglko, kanugwa. Yagl i kagie Livai we digwa. Ana Jisas yagl i kandre, ye di te, Na duglo boglo dugo, <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Livai adiglsre, taraglmo mudu kide kodo, Jisas omara duglo bogl ede ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ana okuo Livai ere mogl, Jisas unan, na kana kaya mokna podo nenamnedi kaya mokna podo kaima gagl yogwa. Gagl yogo, taks igwa yoba yeigo, te yoba mere kaima ama eigo, kaya mokna akie ne meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ne meglko, Farisi tau yeigo, Farisi yoba God lomo beke teigwa i, i ama u ne meglkwa kandre, ka kane kane di, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di prikwa, Siragl pre ene taks igwa yoba ya tadaglme yoba bogl kaya mokna podo akie neime? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yegl digo, Jisas prisre, di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Yoba kide sikrukwa i, ye dokta moglmara enaiglkwa kuno erekrumiwa. Ba yoba kide sigwa i keme dokta moglmara enaiglkwa kuno erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Kuno yegl mere na yoba du munedi prikwa i, na agle dinagledi ukrika ba na tadaglme yoba agle dibo, ye nomano yake tenaiglmedi pre wie dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba kaya mokna mawagl erikwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matyu 9.14-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mak 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Ana okuo yoba tau Jisas moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Jon duglo beglkwa yagl ege mere kaya mokna mawagl ersre, kamage erikwa. Te, Farisi duglo beglkwa yoba ama yegl erikwa ba ene duglo beglkwa yoba kaya mokna nedre, nigl nedre, erimiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yegl digo, Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, Yagl abu ta bogl ibr, yagl kabaglemo ye bogl akie gun yei moraiglkwa igne i ene ye di tedre, Kaya mokna mawagl erio! dinaiglmo? Ta dikraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ba abu yugwa yagl i auro i ede enaiglkwa igne i, ege i ye kabaglemo kaya mokna mawagl eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Ana Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, Yoba kuguglmo gaglmo goglo ta argla dinan, ye lap kor ta bogl i pi si boglkrabuka. I siragl pre yoba lap kor si argla di kankrikwa te, goglo i bogl u kuno ta pikrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Te, yoba nigl wain kor ta morabuka i, ta i pi toide nigl mige goglo mina atne edekrabuka. Toide atne edenan, nigl wain kor i poia didre, nigl mige goglo i si bla dinabuka. Yegl eran, nigl wain toide ede meda enan, nigl mige i ama ere kide erabuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Yegl pre nigl wain kor ta morabuka i, yoba i pi toide nigl mige kor mina atne edenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Te, yoba ta nigl wain kanana yogwa i nedre, wain kor ta nenagledi prikrabuka. I siragl pre ye nigl wain kanana yogwa i, i swara wakai erumedi prabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Wakan kade ege i, Jisas sugl mole dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matyu 12.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mak 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ana wakan kade ege ta, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl wan ede pi yoba kugl mogo ere yaiglmara suna eigwa. Ye ede suna eigo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ere mogl, kugl mogo tau ursre, ogono mina ugla pogl, nedre, nedre, ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ne ede eigo, Farisi yoba tau kandre, ye di te, yegl digwa, Ene siragl pre Wakan Kade ege mawagl pamara kugl mogl si yuime? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Okna ibo, Devit ya yoba tau ye bogl akie meglkwa i, kidan geglko, Devit siragl mere erukwa i, ene kerimo mo kerekrime? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ye God yugumo yomara ede yugugl pidre, bret tau God gumuglo mina yeigwa i tau i nedre, yoba ye bogl akie meglkwa i ama tau togo, neigwa. Lo dugwa i, tawa teigwa yoba keme bret i nenaiglme dugwa ba Devit kidan goglkwa pre yegl erumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, wakan kade ege i, na nem yagl moliwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakan kade ege Jisas yagl ogo mawa sugwa ta ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matyu 12.9-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mak 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ana wakan kade ege ta, Jisas ede ka mabuno yugu yomara yugugl pidre, yoba God kamo beke te moglkwa. Te, yugugl i, yagl ta ogo wo kra mawa sugwa ama yugugl moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Ana Jisas yoba ka beke te moglko, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba ye wakai ere kan moglsre, Jisas wakan kade ege i, yagl i ta ere wakai ere tenan, ene mawagl pamara etniwedi didre, kot ere tenamnedi kan meglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Yegl kan meglkwa ba ye nomano siragl mere paugwa i Jisas pre kan ere kodidre, yagl ta ogo mawa sugwa i di tedre, Ene u yoba meglmara suna wom adigl moglo dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i u suna adigl moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Adigl moglko, Jisas ye yoba makai si meglkwa i yegl di togwa, Na kira ta poragledi priwe dugwa. Wakan kade ege i, nono God lomo duglo boglsre, siragl eramne? Mabuno wakai eramno mo mabuno kide eramne? Te, wakan kade ege nono yoba ere inamno mo si goramne? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Jisas yegl didre, yoba makai si meglkwa i mudu kan winabo didre, yagl ta ogo mawa sugwa i yegl di togwa, Ene ogon ake duglo suo! dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i ye Jisas dumere eruko, ye ogo u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ye ogo u wakai ogo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba ikra deno podo kubrisre, yene pi makai si mogl, Jisas siragl mere ere kide ere tenaiglmere ka di keglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl 12-pela dedenagledi kere yugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matyu 10.1-4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mak 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ana igne i Jisas God kamage ere tenagledi ede muglo ta pidre, eduer God kamage ere te mogl ogo, kamun tagugwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ana taganamogl ye duglo beglkwa yoba agle dugo, wigo, ye yagl 12-pela kere idre, yoba i, Jisas kere iga yoba meglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Ye yoba kere yugwa i, swara ta Saimon moglkwa. Te, Jisas ye kagie kor ta yei tedre, Pita we dugwa. Te, ye ama Saimon agigle Andru kere yugwa. Te, ye Jems ya Jon ya Filip ya Bartolomyu kere idre, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matyu ya Tomas ya Jems ta, Alfius wam moglkwa i kere idre, Saimon ta, ye Selot yoba ta moglkwa i,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Selot yoba i, ye pati mere yegl ta meglkwa ba ye Rom yoba kuda bogl tedre, Israel yoba mogl pere edinamnedi prikwa yoba meglkwa. Saimon ye okna yugobuno i mina suna moglsre, erme Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta moglkwa.</char></note> kere idre, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Judas, yagl ta kagie Jems we digwa i wam kere idre, Judas Iskariot, ye okuo Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yogwa i, ama kere yugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba tau mere kide sigwa i, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">Matyu 4.24-25</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:7-12">Mak 3.7-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Ana Jisas ye kere yugwa yagl bogl muglo ibo kide kodo, ede atne u dumo auduno ta yomara adigl meglko, Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba tau mere ama u makai si meglkwa. Te, yoba tau mere distrik Judia suna i, bage bage mogl wigo, dumo Jerusalem mogl wigo, mudi nigl bina taun suo Tair ya Saidon mogl wigo, erikwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Yoba mere kide wigwa i, ye Jisas ka dinan, prisre, kideno ama ere wakai ere norabedi wigwa. Wimara i, yoba murubuglo kide ye ere kide ere teigwa meglkwa i, Jisas murubuglo kide i di meda edugo, ede meda eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Te, yoba mere kide ye Jisas ake pramnedi erikwa. I siragl pre Jisas yobuglomo tau ede meda pi yoba kide sigwa i, mudu ere wakai ere togwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goduglme yoba gun yenaiglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matyu 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Ana Jisas kan ye duglo beglkwa yoba meglmara edidre, ye yegl di togwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Ene goduglme yoba meglkwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:20">I siragl pre God yoba kingno morabara dumo i, ene inaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Te, ene erme kidan geglkwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">I siragl pre ene okuo nebi, dano erabiwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:21">Te, ene erme kai erikwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">I siragl pre ene okuo gaugl eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, na duglo boraiglkwa pre yoba ene kide kandre, ene si meda edenaglkwa mo, ka tenaiglkwa mo, ene yoba kide meglmedi kagno ta ere kide ere tebi, <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />ene heven ibo topo podo ta inaiglkwa pre ene gun yedre, kaglno egrio. Te, ene ama praiglkwa i, ene ere kide ere tenaiglkwa i, okna ibo ye kowano awano ama kuno yegl ersre, God kamo kep yoba ere kide ere teimiwe we di praiglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">Ene tau gun yenaiglkwa ba ene tau mige moni podo kan neigwa i, ene kan kun erio!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">I siragl pre erme deno muduno wida dugwa ba okuo yegl ta paikrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Te, ene erme kaya mokna neigo, dano erukwa i, kan kun erio!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">I siragl pre ene okuo kidan goraiglmiwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Te, ene erme gaugl erikwa i, kan kun erio!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">I siragl pre ene okuo kide prisre, kai eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Okna ibo ka kep yoba kibi meglkwa i, ene kowano awano kagno ake i mitna edigwa pre yoba ene erme kagno ake mitna edibi, kan kun erio dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba di te, Ene kudano ikne eribi, ere ikne ede tekrio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matyu 5.38-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene na kana pre meglkwa yoba i, na ene ama yegl di teiga, ene kudano ikne deno muduno teo! Te, yoba ta ene kide kanaiglkwa i, ene ere wakai ere teo. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Te, ye ka kide di tenaiglkwa ba ene ka wakai di ikne ede teo. Te, ene ta ere kide ere tebi, kamage ere teo. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Yoba ta ene sinan, paunan koglo bogln, ene kan ake tedre, koglo ama suo do. Te, yoba ta ene ir gaglnen gudo inan, gaglna suna i ama inabedi kanige ero. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Yoba ta ene taraglnen ta naratnba dinabuka i, ene tedre, yoba ta ene taraglnen gudu inabuka i, ene ama ikne ede naro dikro. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Yoba pere ene siragl mere ta ere naraiglmedi pitnere i, ye kuno yegl mere ere to! di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene ere mogl, yoba ene wakai kanigwa i keme wakai kanibi, ira ene debino sinabe? Tadaglme yoba ama ye wakai kanigwa yoba i keme wakai kan meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Mo, yoba ene ere wakai ere tenaiglkwa i keme ere wakai ere te meglbi, ira debino sinbabe? Tadaglme yoba ama kuno yegl erikwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Te, ene yana ta dibi, te ikne edenaiglkwa moraiglkwa keme ta te motn, ira kra ene debin sinabe? Tadaglme yoba ama mabuno swara i tadaglme yoba ere tedre, teimara ikne edinamnedi prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ba ene kudano ikne deno muduno tedre, ere wakai ere teo! dugwa. Te, ye dina ere tedre, noro ikne edinaiglmedi prikrio! Ene yegl eribi, okuo ene topo podo ta idre, ama Neno heven ibo moglmere mere yegl gak wakai moraiglmiwa. I siragl pre God mabunomo ama yegl paugo, tadaglme yoba moglsre, tenk yu di kankrikwa i, ye ere wakai ere te pai moglmiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Ene Neno Kade yoba mudu mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere tomere yegl, ene ama kuno yegl erio! di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ene yoba pere kan yubu sikrio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matyu 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene jas mere yegl moglsre, yoba pere kan yubu sikrio. Ene yoba pere kan yubu sikribi, God ene ama ta kan yubu sikrabuka. Te, ene God di tedre, yoba ta ka tage to! dikrio. Ene yegl ta dikribi, God ene ama ka tage tekrabuka. Ene yoba pere aglauno kide kodo tebi, God ene aglauno ama kide kodo tenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ene taraglno yoba pere tebi, siragl mere tenaiglmere yegl God kuno ere enene te ikne edenabuka. Edidre, konbauna kane kane mina siragl mere kide ake ple di tenabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ka ebrie swara ta ama yegl dugwa, Yoba gumuglo kin yenabuka ta ere mogl, ye agigle gumuglo kin yogwa ta i ogo akidre, konbauna ede enan, kuno erabo? Ta manabuka. Ye suo akie pi guglo sinabriwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kuno yegl mere skul gak ta ere mogl, ye tisamo egre atne edekrabuka ba ye skul mere dinan, ye tisamo moglmere kuno yegl morabuka pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Siragl eruko, ene agitn gumuglo mina ede dekne kebra ta paugwa ibo kandre, ede mudu ta enene gumugln mina paugwa i, kankre dine? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ede podo ta ene gumugln mina pai moglko, ene kanige ere, agitn moglmara pi di te, Agra, na ede dekne kebra ta gumugln mina paugwa i, i meda edinaluwe dinga i, kuno ta erekrume dugwa. Ene mabuno kibi etnga. Ede podo ta gumugln mina paugwa i komono kana i meda edin, ene kan pogl sidre, ede dekne kebra ta agitn gumuglo mina paugwa i, i meda edinatnga kuno erabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ka padum ta didre, ede kide mogo kide korabe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matyu 7.16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ede wakai ta mogo kide ta koglkrabuka. Te, ede kide ta mogo wakai ta koglkrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Yegl pre yoba ede swara swarade mogo siragl mere keglkwa i kandre, ede wakai paimo mo kide paimo mo i, kan pogl sigwa. Yoba fik mogo mo wain mogo ta uramnedi pribi, kewan kagigle edie i mina koran, i ta pi urokraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Kuno yegl mere yoba wakai ta morabuka i, ye nomane ya dem muduo wakai paugwa pre ebrie mabunomo ama wakai panabuka. Ba yoba kide ta morabuka i, ye nomanemo ya dem muduo kide paugwa pre ye ebrie mabunomo ama kide panabuka. Yoba deno muduno mina siragl yogwa i, ka dinaiglmara i mina di meda edinaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba yugu keigwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matyu 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene na pre Yagl Kade yo di moglsre, na kana duglo boglkrikwa i, na kide priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Yoba ta na moglmara udre, ka diga i prisre, duglo boglkwa i, na ye siragl mere moglkwa i di boglsre, ka ebrie ta dinariwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Yoba ta nomane wakai paugo, yugu wakai ta keigwa mere yegl ye moglkwa. Yoba i, makan wake ede atne pidre, kobuglo pamara yugu guglo boglkwa. Okuo kamun podo sugo, nigl podo u yugu i sugwa ba yugu i piga dikrukwa. I siragl pre yugu keigwa yaglmo i, yugu gigledi keigwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ba yoba ta na kana sedinan, ye yugu kide ta keigwa mere yegl morabuka. Yoba i, makan wakekre, yugu guglo yoko bodiglsre, yugu keigwa. Yegl pre okuo kamun podo ta sinan, nigl podo udre, yugu i si piga dinan, yugu i tabre kaima yage sidre, u kide pi kodinabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Ami kepten ta niglmo kogonmo yoba kide sugo, Jisas ye ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matyu 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ana Jisas ka mudu i, yoba di te kodidre, ede Kaperneam ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ede Kaperneam ogwa igne, yagl ta Rom soldia 100 mere bitno moglkwa i, niglmo kogonmo yagl ta kide sugo, goragledi erukwa. Te, soldia bitno yagl i, ye niglmo kogonmo yagl i, wakai kanugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Ana yoba ye Jisas ede Kaperneam ume digo, soldia bitno yagl i prisre, Juda yoba kade tau dede, ye Jisas moglmara pi di tebi, Jisas udre, nigl kogon yagl i ere wakai ere tenabedi pre dedugo, ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ye pi Jisas moglmara plau didre, Jisas ye nigl kogon yagl i ere wakai ere tenabedi kamage yei, yegl digwa, Soldia bitno yagl i, ye yagl wakai ta moglkwa pre ene ye niglmo kogonmo yagl i ere wakai ere tenatnga i, kuno erume digwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Yagl i, ye nono Israel yoba wakai kandre, no ka mabuno yugu makai sumnara i, ama kei norukwa pre yagl wakai ta moglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ana Juda yoba kade i, u Jisas yegl di teigo, Jisas ye bogl akie ede eigwa. Ye bogl akie ede pi soldia kipamara ede magigl eigo, soldia bitno yagl i, kabaglemo tau dedidre, pi Jisas ka yegl di teo dugo, ye Jisas moglmara udre, yegl dume digwa, Yagl Kade yo, ede yugugl unatnga i, ere yenaba! Na yagl wakai ta moglbo, ene na kipaimara ede yugugl unatnga i, kuno ta erekrumiwe di, yegl dume digwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Te, na yagl wakai ta moglbo, ene motnara unaglka i, ama ta kuno erekrumedi prisre, na kabaglena tau dediga. Yegl pre ene yugugl ukre, ka keme din, na niglna kogona yagl i, aragan erabedi priwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />I siragl pre na moglka i, yoba ta na bitna moglko, te na soldia tau mere ama bitno moliwa. Na soldia ta di tedre, Ede po! digo, ye ede ogo, te ta Ede wo! digo, ye ama ede umiwa. Te, na niglna kogona yoba ta Kogon yegl ero! diga i, ye erukwa. Yegl pre ene ka keme din, niglna kogona aragan erabedi prie di, yegl dumiwe digwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ana yoba ka yegl digwa i, Jisas nagie podo koglsre, kan ake te, yoba ye duglo bogl wigwa i, yegl di togwa, yagl i pre meduglmere yegl Israel yoba swarano yegl ta pre mediglkrime dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Yegl dugo, soldia bitno yagl yoba dedugwa i, ye ede ikne yugugl pi kanigwa i, yagl kide sugwa ikra aragan eruko, kanigwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumugl gak ta dumo Nain goglko, Jisas ye ere i kor edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ana tagna ta i, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede dumo ta Nain we dimara eigo, yoba mere kide ye eimere sika si ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ye ede pi dumo Nain kobuglo togl dra mina wigo, kumugl gak ta goglko, yoba boglo ere i wigo, kanigwa. Kumugl gak i ye mam abu werai ta moglko, agiglema abaugloma ama ta moglkrikwa. Kumugl mam i ugo, yoba dumo suna i kipaigwa tau mere ama ye wimara akie kai ere wigwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ana Yagl Kade Jisas ye gak goglkwa i mam kandre, mirie gogl, Ene kai erekro dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Didre, ede magigl pi gak i gagle bogl akugo, yoba boglo ere yuigwa i adigl meglko, Jisas yegl dugwa, Kumugl ya, adiglo dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yegl dugo, gak goglkwa ikra adigl, ka dugo, Jisas ye auro i pi mam togwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Ana Jisas yegl eruko, yoba kan meglkwa i, kudugl podo goglsre, God kagie kade te, yegl digwa, God kamo kep yoba kade ta no munara umiwe didre, God no ye yobama munga i, ake ple di noragledi erukwa pamiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Ana Jisas kimagl erukwa i ka di wai di eigo, distrik Judia suna i, mudu priko, te dumo tau distrik Judia magigl yeigwa ama prikwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon Baptais duglo biurka yagl suo Jisas moglmara dedugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matyu 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Ana Jisas kogon kane kane erukwa i, Jon duglo beglkwa yagl kandre, pi Jon boglo kugl teigo, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />prisre, ye duglo biurka yagl suo Wiro dugo, ede ubrika. Ubriko, ye Jisas moglmara pidre, yegl di priro dugwa, Yagl ta unabuka ikra ene uno mo, no yoba ta pre sugl moramne? di priro dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Jon yegl dugo, yagl suo i wan ede pi Jisas moglmara pi plau didre, ye yegl di tebrika, Jon, ye yoba nigl bugl togwa yagle moglkwa i, no ene motnara enabredi no dedidre, ene yegl di priro dugwa, Yagl ta unabuka ikra ene motno mo, no yoba ta pre sugl moramno? di, Jon no yegl di priro dugo, no ubuluwe di, yagl suo i yegl dibrika.<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ana Jisas yoba kide kane kane sigwa ya murubuglo kide ye ere kide ere teigwa i ere wakai ere tedre, yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, aglke kor kanaiglmedi ere moglko, yagl suo u kanibrika. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yagl suo i, udre, Jon ye di tomere ikra di kodibriko, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ede ikne pi ene siragl taragl kandre, prisre, eribrika i, Jon di tero dugwa. Yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, aglke kor kanigo, kaglno kide erukwa i konbauna ede eigo, yoba leprosi erikwa i, ogono nagino u wakai omiwe di tero. Te, yoba kinano gi dugwa i, aglke kor priko, yoba gogl kodigwa i, u kor eigo, te, goduglme yoba ye God kamo wakai i, priko, no kabugledi, Jon yegl di tero. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Te, ka ta ama yegl di tero. Yoba na erabedi primere erekrika ba na pre medigl mogl pai moraiglkwa i, gun yenaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ana yagl suo ede ikne ebriko, Jisas yoba mere makai si meglkwa i, Jon pre ka tau yegl di togwa, Ene okna yagl Jon kanamnedi dumo wau yomara eigwa i, ene siragl taragl kanamnedi ede eime? dugwa. Jon yobuglo paikruko, ir u sugo, egre ya kugl kan piga dumere yegl mere moglko, kanamnedi eimo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ta manugwa. Mo, Jon kugugl gagl wakai kaima ta edugwa i kanamnedi eimo? Ta manugwa. Yoba ta kugugl gagl wakai kan nedre, taragl wakai wakai ere neigwa i, ye king yuguno toglno suna i keme meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Mo, ene God kamo kep yoba ta kanamnedi ede eime? Kaima, Jon kaima God kamo kep yagl ta moglkwa ba ye ka kep yagl yoko ta moglkrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />God kamo okna yagl ta unabe dugwa i, Jon moglme dugwa. God kamo yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">Ene pro! Na yagl ta kana kep ero dibo, ye ene enatnara ede okna enabiwa. Ye ene enatnara ede okna pi yoba konbauna ake kun erimere yegl erabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malakai 3.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 7:27">dugwa i, Jon yoba i moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Na ene di teiga, Jon yagl kade mogl, yoba mudu makandigle meglkwa i egre togwa. Ba God yoba kingno morabuka igne i yoba yoko kaima ta morabuka i, ye Jon erme makadigle moglmere moglkre, mogl mitna edenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Ana Jisas ye Jon debie sugwa pre ka yegl dugwa igne, taks igwa yobamo i ya te, yoba mudu i wakai prisre, God mabuno du keme erumiwe digwa. Ye okna Jon moglmara eigo, Jon ye mudu nigl bugl togwa pre Jisas kamo wakai prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ba Farisi yoba ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba i, Jon nigl bugl norokrabe digwa pre God konbo ta ama si togwa i, mane didre, Jisas kamo kide pre teigwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene yoba erme paigwa i, na Jon bogl kenaglno sigwa i, na ka ebrie siragl we di boragle? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Gak tau ere mogl, gak tau di te, No ene suglno muniwa. Ene daragl yegl erio! dimere yegl ene yegl meglmiwa. No pu migi sidre, ene kaglno egrio dumga i, kaglno egrekrikwa. Te, no kai giglage sidre, kai erio dumga i, ene kai erekrimiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ka ebrie i mina ene Jon erukwa i kide kandre, na erika i ama kide kandre, erikwa. Jon, yoba nigl bugl togwa yagle moglkwa i, ede nogugl ugwa igne, ye bret nekre, nigl wain nekre, eruko, ene ere mogl, Murubuglo kide ta ye moglmara suna moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Te, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ede nogugl wiga igne, na bret ya nigl wain akie neiga pre ene ama kenaglna sidre, Yagl i kaya mokna podo nedre, spak erukwa yagle moglsre, tadaglme ya taks igwa yoba bogl begane yei wan moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ba yoba ta God nomanemo wakai pre igwa meglkwa i, ye kogon erimara i mina ye nomaneno wakai pamedi i nogugl edime di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abu ta kugo nuglo i pi, toide Jisas kagle mina edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ana Farisi yagl ta Jisas bogl akie kaya mokna nenabugledi agle dugo, Jisas yagl i kipamara ede yugugl pidre, kaya mokna nenagledi ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ana taun suna i, tadaglme abu ta moglmedi kanigwa i moglkwa. Abu i Jisas u Farisi yagl kipamara kaya mokna ne moglme digo, prisre, kugo demene erukwa ta mige podo boglkwa migie mina moglkwa idre, ugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ana abu i, ede yugugl u Jisas kagle mina goglko bodugl moglsre, kai eruko, kai nuglo yage Jisas kagle mina sugo, ye bre yugu mina kai nuglo i koko edidre, kugo nuglo ikra toide Jisas kagle mina edugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ana abu i yegl ere moglko, Farisi yagl ta Jisas agle dugwa ikra ere mogl, yene nomane mina yegl di prukwa, Yagl i ka kaima God kamo kep yoba ta moran, tadaglme abu ta ye akugwa i, ye pre pogl sidre, mane di tenabiwe di, yegl prukwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Ana Farisi yagl i, nomane mina yegl di pruko, Jisas pre kan ersre, yagl i di te, yegl dugwa, Saimon yo, na ka ta ene di tenagledi priwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Farisi yagl Saimon i, di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Tisa yo, ene do dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ka ta yegl dugwa, Yagl swara ta ere mogl, yagl suo ta miurka i, dina pere pere ere togwa. Yagl swara ta dina erukwa i, mige 500 mere dina eruko, ta dina erukwa i, mige 50 mere dina erume dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ana okuo yagl suo i, mige te ikne edenabrika i ta yeikruko, yagl ta dina ere togwa ikra ere mogl, dina suo akie i, kide kodo togwa. Ana ene siragl we di pitne? Yagl suo miurara i, ira gun podo yagl i tomedi pitne? dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, yagl Saimon i, di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta dina podo erukwa i, gun podo yei, ta tomedi priwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, Ene kuno diniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, kan ake te, abu ikra kan moglsre, Saimon yegl di prukwa, Ene abu i kano. Na ene kipanara ede yugugl wigo, ene kagln nigl koglo didre, nigl kogl narekitnga ba abu i kaimo nuglo mina kaglna nigl edidre, bre yugo mina kokugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Te, na yugugl wiga i, ene paunana si nekitnga ba abu i ede yugugl udre, kaglna ege tau mere si ne moglmiwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ene oliv nuglo toide bitna mina edekitnga ba abu i, kugo nuglo toide kaglna mina edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Yegl pre na ene di teiga, nono abu i kandre, kan pogl sinamga. Na ye tadaglmemo mere kide paugwa i, gugl ede teiga pre ye dem muduo podo narukwa ba yoba ta tadaglmemo kebra panan, na gugl ede tebo, yoba i dem muduo kuri ta narabuka mere yegl pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, abu ikra yegl di togwa, Na ene tadaglmenen gugl ede te kodiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Yegl dugo, yoba kaya mokna akie nenamnedi ame di meglkwa i ere mogl, yene nomano mina yegl di prikwa, Yagl i ye yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede teiwe dugwa pre ye ira moglme? di, yegl di prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yegl di priko,Jisas abu ikra ama yegl di togwa, Ene na pre mediglnga pre na ene ere iga. Ene den mudun wida dinan, ede enatniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Abu tau Jisas duglo bogl meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ana okuo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela bogl wan ede pi taun ya dumo kebra pere pere eigo, Jisas ye God kamo yoba beke tedre, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka kamo wakai i, yoba di te wan moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Te, ye wan ede eimara i, abu tau, Jisas okna murubuglo kide ye meglmara meglkwa i di meda edidre, kideno ere wakai ere togwa meglkwa i, ama duglo bogl wigwa. Ta Maria, dumo Makdala mam moglkwa. Okna murubuglo kide 7-pela ye moglmara suna meglko, Jisas di meda edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Te, abu ta ugwa i, kagie Joana we digwa. Abu i, wie kagie Kusa we digo, ye Herot yugumo toglmo sugl moglkwa yagl ta moglkwa. Te, abu ta kagie Susana we digwa i ya abu tau mere ama Jisas duglo boglsre, yene mige monino mina Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ake ple di teigwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl ta kaya mokna yubo suduglkwa pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matyu 13.1-9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mak 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="sower" file="LB00094b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="8.4" />Ana yoba tau mere Jisas moglmara u makai sigo, te yoba taun pere pere kipaigwa i, ede Jisas moglmara wigo, Jisas ere mogl, yoba magigl meglkwa i, ka ebrie ta yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />Yagl ta kugl mogo i pi sudragledi i ede ogwa. Kugl mogo i pi, sudugl ake pia sugo, kugl mogo tau yage konbauna sigwa. Kugl mogo i, yoba egriko, kua ama pru di u, neigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Te, kugl mogo tau, yage makan gaba kuri ta kobuglo bolamugl moglmara yage sigwa. Kugl mogo i, parikwa ba nigl mere ikrikwa pre tabre ade de, yaminugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Te, kugl mogo tau, yage kan kagigle yaglkwa bogl moglmara sigwa. Kugl mogo i pare wi sigwa ba kan kagigle yaglkwa i ama akie pare ede mitna pi, kugl i atne edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage makan wakai yomara sigwa. Kugl mogo i, pare ede mitna pi, mogo 100 mere yegl keglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba na kana ta pramnedi praiglkwa i, na ka diga i wakai ere kinano gudu prio! dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ka ebrie dugwa ikra, mem di poglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-23">Matyu 13.10-23</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mak 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ana okuo Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ye ka ebrie dugwa i, mabunomo pramnedi kira pogl prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Kira pogl priko, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno morabuka kamo paugwa i, teke paugwa ba erme nogugl dibo, ene pre pogl sinaiglmedi na Nina pra we dugwa. Pra we dugwa ba yoba tau meglkwa i we, ka ebrie keme dibo, praiglkwa. I siragl pre God kamo yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">Ye kan, kan eraiglkwa ba kan pogl sikraiglmiwa. Te, ye pre, pre eraiglkwa ba pre pogl sikraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 6.9</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 8:10">dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ka ebrie diga i, mem yegl mere paugwa. Kugl mogo i, God kamo yogwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Kugl mogo tau yage konbauna bina sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa ba yagl kide ye pre mediglbi, God ye ere i dinabedi prisre, u ye ka prikwa i nomano mina i eglke edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage kobuglo moglmara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa igne, gun yeigwa. Ba kugl mogo tau duglane ede atne pikrumere mere yegl meglkwa pre ye ege sugunagle keme pre mediglsre, yubun ta ugwa igne, ye yage sigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage kan kagigle yaglkwa boglmara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa ba ye erme mogl pai eraiglkwa i ya mige moni inaiglkwa i we di prisre, erme gun yenaiglkwa i pre i mitna edigwa pre kan kagigle yaglkwa i, kugl i atne edumere mere yegl, taragl i ye nomano mina kau sugo, ye mogo wakai ta koglkrikwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage makan wakai yomara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa i, ye nomano wakai paugo, God kamo kaima duglo boramnedi prikwa pre ye God kamo ake mogl, yage sikre, mogo wakai keglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ken gaglsre, degigl gagl mina atne yeikraiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mak 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ken gagl yu bogl atne yeimo? dugwa. Mo, ken gagl yu yei, sin ta yu ken bolamugl yei, si bi dimo? dugwa. Yegl ta erekraiglkwa. Yoba ede yugugl unaiglkwa i, abuglage sinan, kanaiglmedi pre bogl mina yenaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kuno yegl mere ka siragl mere ta teke paugwa mo yoba pre pogl sikrikwa i, okuo ede nogugl unan, yoba pre pogl sinaiglkwa keme pre pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Jisas ama yegl dugwa, Ene nomano siragl mere paugo, ene na kana pre meglkwa i, enene pre yubu sio! dugwa. I siragl pre yoba tau na kana wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa i, God ye nomane tau te tebe edenabuka. Ba yoba tau na kana wakai ere kinano gudu prikraiglkwa i, ye nomane kebra ta imnedi prikwa i, God ama i eglke edenabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas mam ya agiglema ye moglmara wigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matyu 12.46-50</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mak 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ana igne i Jisas mam ya agiglema ye moglmara wigwa ba ye Jisas yugugl moglmara unaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. I siragl pre yugugl i, yoba mere kau kaima sigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Yegl pre ye meda meglko, yoba tau Jisas di te, yegl digwa, Ene man ya agiglnma meda mogl, ene kanamnedi primiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba ira ta God kamo prisre, duglo boraiglkwa i, ye keme na mana moglsre, agrama moglsre, erimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ka dugo, ir waga kudu ta ugwa i, bu yogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matyu 8.23-27</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mak 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calms the storm" file="FM 158 Jesus Calms the Storm_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="8.22" />Ana ege swara ta Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede bakugl kuglo eigo, Jisas ye di te, Nono ede nigl nubun koglo ibo omno dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye bakugl mina ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ye bakugl mina pi meglko, Jisas ugl paugwa. Ye ugl pai moglko, nigl nubun suna eimara i, ir waga kudu podo ta ugo, nigl si pepigl di u bakugl mina suna ugo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kanigwa i, No nigl nedre, goramga mere yegl pamedi kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ye yegl mere kanigwa pre ye Jisas moglmara pi uglo yokidre, ye yegl di teigwa, Yagl Kade yo, nono goramga pamiwe digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas adiglsre, ir podo ugwa ya nigl si pepigl dugwa i, ka togo, ir ugwa i dudugo, nigl ama kiede moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yegl eruko, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di prukwa, Ene na pre mediglmo mo pre mediglkrime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye kudugl goglsre, nagino kogl, di ikne ikne yegl digwa, Yagl i irane? Ye ir ya nigl akie ka togo, pribriwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murubuglo kide tau yagl ta moglmara suna meglko, Jisas ye di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matyu 8.28-34</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mak 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl baglkugl mina ede pi Gerasa yoba meglmara eigwa. Dumo i nigl nubun Galili koglo ibo kra yogwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ye pi dumo i plau digo, Jisas baglkugl kide kodo ede meda ugwa igne, dumo i makan nem yagl ta ye moglmara ugwa. Yagl i murubuglo kide tau ye moglmara suna meglko, ye ege olto kugugl gagl edekre, yugu kipaikre, yoba geglkwa padiglmara pai wan moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ana yagl i Jisas kanugwa igne, ye grigle didre, yage kobragai pai, Jisas ka podo yegl di togwa, Jisas yo, ene God mogl mitna kaima edugwa Wam motnga i, ene siragl mere ere naragledi une? Na ene di prika i, ene giugl narekratnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ye yegl dugwa i, siragl pre Jisas ye murubuglo kide i di tedre, Ene yagl i moglmara kide kodo, ede meda wio! di, yegl di te kodugwa. Murubuglo kide i yagl i ege mere ere kide ere teigwa. Yoba ege mere ye sen mina ogo kagle kan sidre, ye suglmo meglkwa ba ye ege ege sen si biglke dugo, murubuglo kide i, ye si i pi dumo wau yomara, yoba ta moglkrimara edigwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Ana Jisas yagl i di te, Kagn dagl naro dugwa. Dugo, yagl i di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Na kagna Ami we dugwa. Ye yegl dugwa i siragl pre murubuglo kide tau mere ye meglmara suna pi meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Te, murubuglo kide i, kamage yei, Jisas yegl di prikwa, No makan mur ta yei ede atne kaima ime omara i, ede pio dikro digwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ana dumo i muglo meglbi ta yogo, muglo meglbi i mina bugla mere kide yumun ne meglkwa. Ana Jisas ye murubuglo kide ede meda wio dugwa igne, murubuglo kide i Jisas di prisre, Ene no kanige etn, ede bugla meglmara suna enamniwe digo, Jisas pra we dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Pra we dugo, murubuglo kide i, yagl i moglmara kide kodo ede meda udre, bugla mere kide meglmara pidre, deno muduno mina ede atne eigwa. Eigo, bugla mere kide i, guglo ta yomara muku di ede atne pi, nigl nubun suna pidre, nigl ne geglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ana yoba ta ye bugla ikra sugl meglkwa i, ye taragl ta plau dugwa i kandre, muku di pi yoba taun suna kipaigwa ya meda kipaigwa i di teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Di teigo, yoba tau mere pi taragl ta plau dugwa i kanamnedi ede eigwa. Ye pi Jisas moglmara plau didre, yagl ta murubuglo kide ye moglmara ede meda eigwa i, Jisas kagle mina ame di moglko, kanigwa. Te, yagl i kugugl gagl edugo, nomanemo ama u wakai ogo, ye kandre, kudugl geglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Ye kudugl gogl meglko, yoba tau ye siragl taragl plau dugwa kanigwa ikra ye boglo kugl tedre, Jisas ye yagl ta murubuglo kide moglmara atne meglkwa i siragl mere ake ple di togwa i, ye di teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Di teigo, yoba distrik Geresa suna kipai meglkwa, ye mere u makai si meglkwa i mudu kudugl podo goglsre, Jisas ye dumono moglkre, ede bage ta enabedi di prikwa. Yegl di priko, Jisas ede bage ta enagledi baglkugl mina ede kuglo ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Ana Jisas baglkugl kuglo moglko, yagl ta murubuglo kide ye moglmara ede meda wigwa i, kamage yei, Jisas bogl akie wanabugle dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Jisas ye ede ikne dumomo enabedi dedidre, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />Ene ede ikne pi yugun kaminen pidre, God ene siragl mere ere togwa i, yoba boglo kugl to dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i ede ikne dumomo pidre, Jisas ye siragl mere ake ple podo di tomere yoba mudu taun suna meglkwa i, di togwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abai gak ta goglko, Jisas ye ere i kor edidre, te, abu ta Jisas gaglmo akugo, kidemo aragan erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matyu 9.18-26</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mak 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ana Jisas nigl nubun Galili mina ede ikne koglo ya ugo, yoba tau mere ye kandre, ye di igwa. I siragl pre ye mudu Jisas ede ikne unabedi sugl meglko, ye ugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ana Jisas ugo, yagl ta kagie Jairus we digwa i, ede Jisas moglmara udre, Jisas kagle mina yage kobragai paugwa. Yagl i, ye Juda yoba ka mabuno yuguno ta sugl moglkwa yagle moglkwa. Ana ye Jisas kagle mina yage kobragai padre, kamage yei, Jisas ene na kipaimara unatniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Ye yegl dugwa i, siragl pre ye abuglo swara kaima ta moglsre, bugla yugu 12-pela mere yegl nogwa i, kide sugo, goragledi erukwa pre Jisas ye ere wakai ere tenabedi pre yegl dugwa. Ana yagl i yegl dugo, Jisas ye bogl akie ede ebriko, yoba tau mere ye ebrara mogl winabo didre, akie ede eigwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ana yoba eimara suna i, abu ta ogwa. Abu i kide ta sugo, abu ba kanimere yegl, bugla yugu 12-pela bu yeikruko, aimadi kan pai moglkwa. Te, dokta mere meglmara pi kanugo, migemo dudugwa ba yoba swara ta ye ake ple di tenaiglkwa i, kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ana abu i, yoba mere eimara suna pidre, Jisas mokomugl u ye kuguglmo gaglmo puduo yomara akugo, bormai ugwa i, oglade bu yogwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Ana abu i kidemo bu yogo, Jisas ere mogl, Ira na akume? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yoba magigl meglkwa i mudu Na ta manume di, yegl di meglko, Pita ere mogl, Jisas yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade, yoba mere bogl akie umga i, ene unara mogl winabo didre, nagn bai, ede wimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Pita yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Yoba ta na akugo, na priwa. I siragl pre yobuglna tau ede meda ogo, na priwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Jisas yegl dugo, abu i prukwa, na ye akiga i, pre kan erukwa pamedi prisre, ye kudugl gogl, nagie nuglo didre, u Jisas moglmara yage kobragai paugwa. Ye yage kobragai padre, mem siragl mere paugwa pre ye Jisas akugwa ya ye kidemo siragl mere tabre bu yogwa i, ye yoba mudu gumuglno mina di nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Di nogugl edugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Abra yo, ene na pre mediglnga pre kidenen bu yomiwa. Ene den mudun wida dinan, ede enatniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di moglko, yoba ta ka mabuno yugu sugl moglkwa yagl ikra kipamara mogl ugwa. Ye udre, yagl i yegl di togwa, Ene abutn goglmiwe dugwa. Ene Tisa kogon tau tenatnga i, ta paikrume dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yegl dugo, Jisas prisre, Jairus yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglkre, na yobuglna pre mediglo. Ene pre medigln, abutn u kor enabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="girl raised" file="cn01713B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="8.51" />Ana Jisas ede pi Jairus kipamara pidre, ye yoba suom keme ede yugugl enamne dugwa. Ye Pita ya Jon ya Jems, abai i nem mam bogl ede yugugl omun, yoba tau wigwa i, mudu meda moraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Ana yoba i ede yugugl eigo, yoba tau mere yugugl i, abai i kaimo ere meglko, kanigwa. Kanigo, Jisas ere mogl, yoba kai ere meglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Ene kai erekrio. Abai i goglkrukwa ba ugl keme pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Jisas yegl dugo, yoba kai erikwa i, gauglmo ersre, Abai i goglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas ede pi abai i moglmara pidre, ogo ake, ka podo yegl dugwa, Abai yo, ene adiglo! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Yegl dugo, abai i kiamo ede ikne ugo, ye tabre aduglkwa. Aduglko, Jisas yegl dugwa, Ye kaya mokna tau nenabiwa, ene teo! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ana abai nem mam i, ye taragl ta plau dugwa i kandre, nagino kiurka ba Jisas ye yoba swara ta di te dinabredi, mane dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela di bage bage edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matyu 10.5-15</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mak 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1-2" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela agle dugo, ye ede magigl wigo, ye yobuglo ya namba togwa. Togwa i, ye murubuglo kide ya kide kane kane yoba sinaiglkwa i ere wakai ere tedre, te God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ka i di pene ede tenaiglmedi pre dedugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Te, Jisas ye ama yegl di togwa, Ene konbauna wan enaiglmara i, ene taragl ta idre, pikraiglkwa. Ene muglbo mo hanbek mo kaya mokna mo mige moni ta idre, pikrio. Te, gagl suna suo idre, pikraiglmiwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ene yoko ede pidre, ene dumo ta ede suna enaiglmara i, yoba ta ene di inabuka yugumo swara i pai mogl, okuo dumo i kide kodo ede dumo kor ta enaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ebi, yoba ene kano prikre, ta di ikribi, ene dumo i kide kodio. Te, ede enaiglkwa igne, ye aglauno nogugl panabedi pre kaglno kugane tama bagl, ede meda pio di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ede bage bage pidre, God kamo wakai i, yoba di nogugl ede tedre, yoba kide sigwa i ama bage bage ere wakai ere teigwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herot Jisas ye Jon moglmedi prukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Matyu 14.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Mak 6.14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Ana Herot gavman mogl, dumo i sugl moglkwa ege, Jisas kogon ere wan moglkwa i, yoba di teigwa pre Herot nomane sidre, kina podo yogwa. I siragl pre yoba digwa i, Jon baptais si geglkwa u kor ogwa, moglmedi tau yegl digwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Digo, tau Elaija ikra moglme digwa. Tau ka kep yagl okna mogl geglkwa i, swarano ta u kor ogwa, moglme digo, <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />ana Herot Jon Baptais i nana nugu gariko, goglkrawa. Yoba ta kimagl kane kane erume digwa i, kaima ira moglmada di, yene kanagledi pre dokugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye bret ya buglo bagle ake buko didre, yoba 5,000 mere yegl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matyu 14.13-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6.30-44</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Jon 6.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bage bage wan mogl, ede ikne wigwa igne, ye kogon kane kane ta erikwa i, Jisas boglo kugl teigwa. Boglo kugl teigo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl i bogl yene moramnedi pre ye auro i ede ogo, ede dumo ta Betsaida we dimara eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Eigwa ba yoba mere pre kan erikwa pre ye eimara i sika sigo, Jisas yoba i di idre, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i pre ka didre, yoba kide ta sigwa i, ama ere wakai ere togwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ana Jisas yegl ere moglko, min panagledi eruko, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela i ede magigl pidre, yegl digwa, Yoba i dedin, ede enaiglmiwa. Dumo magigl i, yugu togl ta yeikrukwa. Ye magigl i kidan gogl, kaya mokna ya yugu dokinaiglkwa pre dedin, ye ede taun ya yugu togl yomara enaiglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Enene kaya mokna ta nenaiglmere teo dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede, No bret 5-pela ya buglo bagle suo yomga i, yoba i ta tomin, kuno erekrabiwa. No aglke kor pi kaya mokna topo sidre, yu tomin, mudu nenaiglmo? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Yoba dumo i makai si meglkwa i, yagl 5,000 mere yegl meglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Ana Jisas di ikne ede ye duglo beglkwa yagl di tedre, Ene yoba i ye 50-de kere bage swarade makai si, ame di moraiglmedi edio dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Yegl dugo, ye dumere eriko, yoba mudu i ame di meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Ame di meglko, Jisas ye bret 5-pela ya buglo bagle suo ikra idre, kan heven ibo ede, God di wakai yei togwa. Di wakai yei tedre, ake buko didre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yoba i pi tenaiglmedi te moglko, ye i pi teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />I pi teigo, yoba mudu neigwa, dano eruko, ye bret ya buglo bagle kawa te yogwa i, gade makai sidre, degigl gagl 12-pela gre kau sigwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Jisas di tedre, Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl motniwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matyu 16.13-20</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mak 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ana ege ta Jisas yene kamage ere moglko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl tau magigl dagl meglkwa. Ana Jisas kamage ere kodidre, u kira pogl, Yoba mere nono munara wigwa i, na ira moglme dime? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede yegl digwa, Ene Jon yoba nigl bugl togwa yagle ikra, adigl u kor enga, motniwe digwa. Te, tau digwa i, ene Elaija motniwe digwa. Te, tau digwa i, ka kep yoba okna ibo meglkwa i, swarano ta u kor enga, motniwe di, yegl dime digwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yegl di kodigo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Ana ene we? Ene na ira moglme di prime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Pita di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl motniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor enabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matyu 16.20-28</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mak 8.30–9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Ana Jisas ye ka gigledi di tedre, Na ira moglka i, yoba ta di tekrio dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, yubun podo tau inaglka paugwa. Israel yobano kade meglkwa i, ya te tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ya te God lomo beke teigwa yoba i, mudu mokono narsre, na si geglbi, na ege suota mogl, adigl u kor enaglka pamiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye yoba mudu yegl di togwa, Yoba ta na duglo boragledi prabuka i, yoba ede prak kake ede eigo, si geglmere mere yegl, ye ege ege gorabuka i pre gun yedre, te ye yene nomanemo si goglsre, na duglo borabuka paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />I siragl pre yoba ta na pre gorabuka i pra we dinan, ye kor kaima morabuka. Ba yoba erme keme kor mogl, wakai moragledi pran, ye u kide enabuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Yoba ta makandigle taragl mudu nem yagl morabuka ba ye yene u kide pidre, wau boran, wakai panabo? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ana yoba swara ta na Yoba Wam moglka i, againa goglsre, na kana pre ama agai goran, okuo yobamo i ama agaimo goraglka. Na nana abuglagena mina ya Nina abuglagemo mina ya te, God angeloma abuglageno mina unaglka igne, na yoba i agaimo goraglka pre diwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga. Ene yoba tau magigl adigl meglkwa i, goglkre, yoko meglbi, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ege i plau dinan, ene kanaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ogo nagie u pere ta ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matyu 17.1-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mak 9.2-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, ege 8-pela de mere ede ogo, ye Pita ya Jon ya Jems auro idre, kamage eragledi ede muglo ibo ta ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Kamage ere moglko, ye guma dra u pere ta ogo, kuguglmo gaglmo pe kaima sidre, pogl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30-31" />Taragl yegl plau dugo, yagl suo ta ye moglmara tabre abuglage bogl plau dibriko, Jisas bogl ka di meglkwa. Yagl suo i, Moses ya Elaija miurka. Ye Jisas bogl ka di meglkwa i, Jisas kuri ta mogl dumo Jerusalem gorabuka i pre digwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Di meglko, Pita yagl suo bogl ugl guko si mogl pine di kanigwa i, Jisas ogo nagie abuglage sugwa i kandre, yagl suo ye bogl akie adigl meglkwa ama kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ye kan meglko, yagl suo i Jisas moglmara kide kodo, ede enabugledi eribriko, Pita ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, no magigl munga i, wakai pamiwa. No yugu teka suota tabre sumun, swara ta ene pre yenan, swara ta Moses pre yenan, swara ta Elaija pre yenabiwe dugwa. Pita yegl dugwa ba ye ka siragl mere dugwa i, pre pogl sikre, dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ana Pita ka yegl di moglko, kamun kua ta winabo di ye adigl meglmara i, si bi dugo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i kudugl podo geglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Ye kudugl geglko, ka ta kamun kua mina ede meda ugwa i, yegl dugwa, Yoba i na Wana moglko, kere i pere ediga moglmiwa. Ye kamo prio! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ana ka i udre, dudugo, kanigwa i, Jisas yene adigl moglko, kanigwa. Ana igne i siragl taragl plau dugo, kanigwa i, ye ta dikrikwa. Ba okuo di nogugl edigwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murubuglo kide yagl gak ta moglmara suna moglko, Jisas di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matyu 17.14-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mak 9.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ana ege ta ede ogo, ye muglo ibo kide kodidre, ede atne wigwa. Wigo, yoba mere kide Jisas umara eigo, tegigl yeigwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ana yoba mere wimara suna i, yagl ta ka podo didre, yegl dugwa, Tisa yo, na wana swara ta moglkwa ene kanatnedi priwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Murubuglo kide ege mere ye moglmara suna ogwa igne, tabre grigle didre, ake piga dugo, dra eurie sumiwa. Te, murubuglo kide ye kodinagledi kiurkwa pre ye ere kide kaima erabuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Na wana yu ene duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara edidre, ye murubuglo kide di meda edinaiglmedi ka gigledi diga ba ye di meda edinamnedi eriko, manumiwe di, yagl i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Ana yagl i yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Ene yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i, u kide pidre, na pre mediglkrime dugwa. Nono akie ege olto munga i, na pre medraiglmo mo pre mediglkraiglme? Ene wan pra auro yu magigl ya edo! dugo, <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />ye auro yumara murubuglo kide aglke kor pia si makadigle edidre, ake piga dugwa. Yegl erukwa ba Jisas ye murubuglo kide i ka tedre, gak i ere wakai ere te, ye nem moglmara te ikne edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Yegl eruko, yoba kan meglkwa i, God yobuglomo podo kide kaima pamedi nagino keglkwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jisas gorabuka pre aglke kor dugwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matyu 17.22-23</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mak 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ana yoba mere ye Jisas kogon kane kane erumara i pre nagino koglsre, kinano gudu meglko, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />Na ka erme dinaglka i, ene wakai ere kinano gudu prio! Na Yoba Wam moglka i, yoba ta na i pi kudana ikne meglkwa i, ogono mina yenabuka magigl erumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Jisas yegl dugwa ba ye ka dugwa i, ye duglo beglkwa yagl pre pogl sikrikwa. Ka i mem atne teke paugwa pre ye pre inaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Te, ye ka i pre Jisas di praiglkwa i, kudugl geglkwa pre dikrikwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i, ira kra mogl mitna edibedi pre ka drano digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matyu 18.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mak 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Ana igne i Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara suna i, ira mogl mitna ede, tau egre tenabuka i pre ka drano digwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ba ye nomane mina siragl mere prikwa i, Jisas pre kan ersre, gak kebra ta auro yu ye moglmara edidre, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Na kagna mina gak kebra magigl moglkwa i di inatnga i, na di inga paugwa. Te, na di inatnga i, ene God, na dedugo, wiga i, ama di inga mere yegl paugwa. Te, yoba ira ta ene meglmara kagno paikrukwa i, God ye kagno pamedi kanugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta nono ere kide ere norokrabuka i, ye nono mina moglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mak 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Jon ye di te yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, no kamga, yagl ta ene kagn daglsre, murubuglo kide di meda edenagledi eruko, kamniwa. Kandre, ye no duglo bunga yoba munara suna ta moglkrukwa pre ye mane di tomne dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Jon yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ye mane di tekrio. Yoba ta nono ere kide ere norokran, ye nono mina moglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dumo Samaria mogl dinabedi mane digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ana Jisas ede mitna pi heven ibo enabuka ede magigl ugo, ye nomane mina ede dumo Jerusalem enagledi pre kodidre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Te, ye enabara i, Jisas yoba tau dedugo, ye ede okna pidre, Jisas unabuka pre ere wakai ersre, ye ede pi dumo swara ta Samaria suna yogwa i, Jisas unabedi ake kun eramnedi ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ba Samaria yoba ye Jisas di ikramnedi mane digwa. I siragl pre Jisas ede Jerusalem enagledi ugwa i, ye kide prikwa pre mane digwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Ana Samaria yoba ka yegl digo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl suo Jems ya Jon kide prisre, ede Jisas moglmara pi ye yegl dibrika, Yagl Kade yo, ene siragl we di pitne? No God agle di prubugl, ye doga bauglo heven ibo yei, yage atne si, yoba i gagl tege erabedi di prabuglo? dibrika. <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yegl dibrika ba Jisas kan ake te, yagl suo i kandre, ka togwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ka togo, ye konbauna ta mina ede dumo pere ta eigwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba siragl mere ersre, Jisas duglo boraiglkwa i pre Jisas dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matyu 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ana ege ta Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl konbauna pi meglko, yagl ta u Jisas moglmara udre, yegl di togwa, Ene aglo mere ta enatnga i, na ene duglo boraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Agl are meglkwa i, ye makan mur mina atne paigo, te kua ama yene yuguno bagl paigwa ba na Yoba Wam moglka i, na dumo ta panaglka i ta yekrumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Te, Jisas yagl pere ta di tedre, Na duglo boglo! dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene pra we din, na ede ikne yugunamugl pidre, nina goran, ye maugl sidre, okuo ene duglo boragliwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba geglkwa yugobunomo mina atne meglkwa i, ta geglbi, yene maugl sibi, kuno erabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Ana yagl ta ama Jisas yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade yo, na ene duglo boraglka ba ene pra we din, na aglke ede ikne pi nina agrama di wakai yei tedre, ede unagledi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te yegl dugwa, Yoba ta konbauna pi moglsre, kan ikne ede, ede enan, kuno erekrabuka. Kuno yegl mere God yoba kingno morabuka kamo i, ene yoba di tenagledi prisre, kan ikne ede nen agiglnma meglmara enagledi pitn, ene God kogonmo eratnga i, kuno ta erekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl 72 dedugo, ye kogonmo erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ana okuo, Yagl Kade ere mogl, ye yagl 12-pela okna dedumere mere yegl, ye yagl 72 aglke kor dedugwa. Ye dedugwa i, Jisas okuo taun ya dumo swara swarade wan enabara i, ye suode ede okna pi, di tenaiglmedi dedugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Ye dedidre, ka ebrie ta ama di togwa, Kaya mokna mere kide de kodugwa ba kogon yoba kunabe meglmiwa. Kunabe meglkwa pre ene kaya mokna ere yaglkwa Yobamo di pribi, ye kogon yoba mere dedenan, kaya mokna si yunaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Ana Jisas yagl wagle i ama yegl di togwa, Ene ede pere pere pio. Na ene dediga i, ene sipsip nagigle mere yegl moglsre, agl are meglmara suna enaiglkwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Te, ene enaiglmara taragl swara idre, pikrio. Ene mige gagl mo gagl kaban mo, kaglno towo ama ake idre, pikraiglkwa. Te, ene konbo bage enaiglmara i, yoba ta tegigl yebi, ene ye wakai we di teikre, konbauna pi pai molo. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Ana ene ede pi yugu ta yugugl panaiglmara i, ene yoba deno muduno wida dinabedi di teo. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ye deno muduno wida di inaiglkwa ta meglbi, kaima inaiglme dugwa. Ba ta manan, ta ikraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Te, ene ede yugu ta pi padre, ta padre, erekrio. Ene yugu swara i moglsre, ye kaya mokna ya nigl siragl mere tenaiglkwa i, pra neo. I siragl pre kogon yoba topono i nedre, kogon eraiglkwa i, kuno erumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene dumo ta ede suna ebi, dumo i nem mam ene di ibi, ene kaya mokna siragl mere ta tenaiglkwa i, ene gua i neo. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Te, dumo i yoba kide ta sinabuka i ene ere wakai ere tedre, yoba dumo i yegl di teo, God ene kingno morabuka igne i ede magigl umiwe dio. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ba ene dumo ta ede suna ebi, dumo i nem mam ene ta di ikribi, ene ye dumono suna i adigl mogl, yegl dinaiglkwa, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />God ene ka tage tenabuka i, nogugl panabedi pre no erme ogono nigl kuniwa. Nigl kunga ba ene pre kan eraiglkwa i, God yoba kingno morabuka igne i ka kaima ede magigl u kodumiwe di, yegl dinaiglme dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Te, na ene di teiga, Yoba i ene kano sedigwa pre God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, Sodom yoba ka tage tenabuka i, kebra panabuka ba yoba i, ka podo tage tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba nomano yake tekrikwa i, ka tage inaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matyu 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene Korasin ya Betsaida yoba meglkwa i, yubun podo inaiglmiwa. Na ene gumuglnomugl kimagl mere erika ba nomane yake tekrikwa. Taun suo Tair ya Saidon kimagl yegl eria, taun suo i, kamun kuade nomano yake tedre, lap gagle yaglkwa pre, yugum pere edimara bolamugl ame digo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ba God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, Tair yoba ya Saidon yoba yubun tau kebra dagl inaiglkwa ba ene yubun podo kaima inaiglmiwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Te, ene Kapernaum yoba meglkwa i, ene mogl mitna edidre, heven ibo enamnedi primo? Ta pikraiglkwa. Ene ede atne kaima pidre, yoba geglkwa pai meglmara enaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Jisas yegl didre, ye yagl tau dedugwa i ama yegl di togwa, Yoba ene kano pribi, na kana ama prikwa. Ba yoba ta ene kano sedibi, ye na kana ama sede, God na dedugwa i ama kamo sedimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl 72 dedugwa i, kogon ere wan mogl, ede ikne wigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ana Jisas yagl 72 dedugwa ikra, ye wan mogl, ede ikne udre, gun podo yei, Jisas yegl di teigwa, Yagl Kade yo, No ene kagn mina kogon erumnara i, murubuglo kide ama kano duglo beglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Na okna kan moglko, kamun tai tabre sumere yegl Satan heven ibo mogl, yage makandigle sugo, na kaniga. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Ana erme we, ene na kogona eraiglmedi yobuglo teiga pre ene toki kide ya toki giabade egraiglkwa ba ene ere kide ere tekraiglkwa. Te, Yagl kide kudano ikne moglkwa ikra, pra yobuglomo egre atne edenaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ba murubuglo kide ene kano duglo beglkwa i pre gun kaima yekrio. God ene kagno heven ibo bogl kodugwa swara i pre gun yeio dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas gun yedre, God di wakai yogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matyu 11.25-27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ana igne i Mudu Murubuglo ye Jisas gun podo yenabedi eruko, Jisas gun podo yedre, yegl dugwa, Nina, ene kamun mitna ya makan gaba Nem Yagl motnga i, na ene kagn kade teiwa. Ene yoba tau mogl mitna edidre, bitno podo pamedi prikwa i pre pogl si dinaiglmedi ersre, yoba gak kebra nomano pamere mere igwa i, pre pogl sinaiglmedi etniwa. Nina, ka kaima ene yegl etnga i, siragl pre enene wakai pitnere etniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Nina ere mogl, taragl mudu yu na ogona mina edugwa. Te, na God Wam kaima siragl mere moglka i, yoba ta pre kan erekrikwa ba na Nina swara pre kan erukwa. Te, na Nina siragl mere kaima moglkwa i, yoba ta pre kan erekrikwa ba na ye Wam moglka i pre kan erika. Te, na yoba ta i nogugl ede tenagledi prika i keme na Nina pre kan eraiglme dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, kan ake te, ye duglo beglkwa yoba kandre, ye keme yegl di togwa, Na kogon tau mere ene meglmara eriko, ene gumuglno mina kanigwa pre ene gun yeio dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga, ene taragl tau kanigwa i, ka kep yoba ya king okna meglkwa i, tau mere kanamnedi prikwa ba kankre, geglkwa. Te, ene ka prikwa i, ye ama pramnedi prikwa ba prikre, geglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yagl ta yubun yumara Samaria yagl ta ake ple di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Samaritan helping victim on donkey" file="CN01749B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="10.25" />Ana ege ta, God lomo beke togwa yagl ta adigl mogl, Jisas ka ta aglau ere dinabo mo di, pragledi yegl dugwa, Tisa yo, na siragl mere ersre, aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa ikra kaima inagle? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, God lomo mina siragl mere beglkwa i do. Te, ene ama kersre, siragl mere dumedi pitne? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede yegl dugwa, God lomo yegl dugwa, Ene den mudun bogl mudu Yaglnen Kade God tedre, ene nomanen ya yobugln bogl mudu te ene mudu motnere God to<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 6.5</char></note> dumiwa, te ene enene wakai kanere mere yegl, yoba ta magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, ama yegl mere wakai kano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa Yoba 19.18</char></note> di, God lomo yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yagl i yegl dugo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ene kuno ere dinga. Ene dinere yegl etn, kor moratniwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, God lomo beke togwa yagl i aglaumo nogugl pai dinabedi Jisas yegl di prukwa, God lomo suna, yoba ta yobanma we dugwa i, ira pre dume? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne edidre, ka ebrie ta yegl dugwa, Yagl ta dumo Jerusalem kide kodo, ede dumo Jeriko enagledi konbo bage ugo, kunogl gogl yoba u ere sidre, kuguglmo gaglmo ya taraglmo mudu kunogl idre, ede eigo, yagl i gorabuka magigl eruko, pai moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ana igne i tawa togwa yagl ta ere mogl, konbo swara i mina udre, yagl i pai moglko, kandre, ede bina pi, kan kor erekre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mokomugl i, Livai yagl ta ama yagl i pai moglmara u kandre, yagl ta erumere mere ama ede bina pi, kan kor erekre, ede omiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ana yagl suo i yegl ere ede ebrika ba Samaria yagl ta konbauna ede pi yagl i pai moglmara u kandre, mirie gogl, ye ta erekrabere mere ye ersre, <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />ye pai moglmara pi ye sigwa boglmara i wain nuglo ya oliv nuglo toide edidre, tu si togwa. Tu si tedre, yagl i yene donkimo bolamugl edidre, auro i pi haus pasindia ta yomara pidre, suglmo moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ana taganamogl Samaria yagl i ere mogl, mige silva suo i meda ede, haus pasindia nem yagl moglkwa i tedre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene yagl i suglmo moglsre, taragl tau inabuka mere yegl panabuka i te moglo. Mige suo i dudinan, okuo siragl ta eratnga i, na wan ikne wibo, dina mere yegl panan, ene te ikne edinaluwe di, yagl i yegl dumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, God lomo beke togwa yagl i yegl di prukwa, Ana yagl suota konbauna wimara i, yagl ira ta kunogl gogl yoba ere sigwa i ye yobamo mere yegl moglmedi ake ple di tome? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta ye mirie goglkwa i, ye yobamo moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ana ene pi yagl i erumere yegl ero! dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede pi Marta ya Maria kipabrara ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl konbauna pi mogl, ege swara ta dumo ta ede suna wigwa. Ede suna wigo, abu ta ye kagie Marta we digwa i, ye di idre, yugugl edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ana abu Marta i, ye abauglo ta moglkwa, kagie Maria we digwa. Maria i, Jisas kagle mina ame di moglsre, ye ka dugwa i pre moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Maria ye Jisas kamo pre moglko, Marta kaya mokna podo siragl mere gaglsre, ere wakai erabere pre kina gudu prukwa. Prisre, Jisas moglmara u yegl di prukwa, Yagl Kade yo, na abara ere mogl, na swara kogon mudu erabedi kanige erukwa i, ene kano? dugwa. Ene ye di ten, ye na ake ple di narabedi prie dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Marta yegl dugo, Yagl Kade di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Marta yo, ene taragl kane kane pre nomane sidre, kinan gudu pitnga <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />ba taragl swara keme pre i mitna edinatnga paugwa. Taragl wakai swara i, Maria inagledi prukwa pre ye i dinabedi si kegl dikramga pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kamage eraiglmere beke togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-15">Matyu 6.9-15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ana Jisas dumo swara ta moglsre, kamage ere moglkwa. Ye kamage ere kodugo, ye duglo boglkwa yagl ta ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, Jon ye duglo beglkwa yoba kamage eraiglmedi beke tomere yegl, ene ama no kamage eraiglmedi beke noratnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Ene kamage eraiglkwa igne, ene yegl eraiglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Neno Kade yo, ene kagn pere kaima padre, mina kaima panabedi prumga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Te, ene king moratnga igne i tabre plau dinabedi prumniwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />No kaya mokna ege swara swarade ta nenamnere mere noro.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Te, no tadaglmeno kide kodo noro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Siragl pre yoba aglau ere norikwa igne, no ama aglauno kide kodo tomniwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Te, yagl kide no kinano si dinabedi eratnedi prumniwe di,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 11:4">ene kamage yegl eraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5-6" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene ta moraiglmara yoba ye neigwa bage ta wan mogl, eduer suna ta ene meglmara wibi, kaya mokna tenaiglkwa ta manan, ene siragl eratne? Ene pi yoba kabagleno magigl kipainaiglmara pidre, dua sidre, Agra yo, na ibuna ta paugwa pre bret suota naratnedi wiwe di, kira pogln, <verse eid="LUK 11:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />ye yugugl mogl, di ikne ede, Na uglna yokinga kodo, dua si gi di kodo, gagrama bogl ugl pamga pre dinere ta ere tekragle di, yegl dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Yegl dinabuka ba ene prio. Yagl i ene dinere ere tenabuka i, ene kabaglenen moglkwa pre ake ple di tekrabuka ba ene agai goglkre, yugu dua aimadi si motnga pre ene dinere ere tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Yegl pre na ene di teiga, Ene taragl tau pre God agle di pribi, ene tenabuka. Ene taragl ta dokibi, ene kanaiglkwa. Te, ene dua mina sibi, God dua yauro tenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />I siragl pre yoba mudu God agle di prikwa i, ye dimere igwa. Te, yoba taragl ta doko meglkwa i, ye taragl i kanigwa. Te, yoba dua mina sigwa i, God ye dua yauro tomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ene gak nenoma meglkwa i, ene wano ta ere mogl, buglo bagle ta nenagledi prie dinan, ene ye toki ta tenatno? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" /><figure style="fig" file="bk00058b.tif" size="col" copy="Bass/Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="11.12">Toki gaibade</figure>Mo, ye kodowagle muglo pre dinan, ene ere mogl, buglage kide ta no sugwa i, tenaiglmo? Ta tekraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ene prio, ene yoba kide meglkwa ba ene gagroma taragl wakai te kanimiwa. Yegl pre Neno Kade heven ibo moglkwa i, yoba ta ye di prabuka i, ye ka kaima Mudu Murubuglo yoba i tenabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisi yoba Jisas Satan yobuglo togo, kogon erume digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matyu 12.22-30</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mak 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Ana aglke ta murubuglo kide yagl ta moglmara suna moglsre, ka dikrabedi eruko, Jisas murubuglo kide i, di meda edugwa. Ye di meda edugo, yagl i ka dugwa pre yoba mere kide kandre, nagino keglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ba yoba tau yegl digwa, Ye murubuglo kide di meda edugwa i, Belsebul murubuglo kide bitno moglkwa ikra, yobuglo togo, murubuglo kide di meda edumiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Yegl digo, te tau Jisas eran, kanamnedi yegl digwa, Ene God yobuglomo idre, kimagl ta etn, pre medramniwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ana Jisas ye nomano siragl mere paugwa i kan kodidre, ye yegl di togwa, Yoba ta dumo swara ta moraiglkwa i, yene si buno di ede suo pidre, kuda beglbi, dumono u kide pi kodinabuka. Mo, yoba bormai swara meglkwa i, yene ikne ikne kuda beglbi, ye ama u kide enaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Kuno yegl mere Satan yugobunomo mina yene kuda beglbi, ye yugobunomo i dudunabuka pre ene Belsebul yobuglo naruko, murubuglo kide di meda edume digwa i, kuno erekrumiwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Te, ene kogono yoba ama murubuglo kide di meda edime digwa i, ye Belsebul yobuglo togo, di meda edime ta dikrikwa. Yegl dibi, ene ka tage tenaiglkwa. Ene na pre Belsebul yobuglo naruko, murubuglo kide di meda edume digwa i, ta kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ba ene prio! Na murubuglo kide di meda ediga i, God yobuglomo mina erika pre God ene kingno mogl, suglno morabuka igne i ene meglmara u kodumedi prio! di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Didre, Yagl Kide yobuglo podo paugwa i, ye kuda gaglsre, yugumo sugl moran, ye taraglmo mudu kuno ere yenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ba yagl ta yobuglomo podo pai, ye egre atne edugwa i ta unan, ye yagl i yobuglo ere tedre, kuda taraglmo i eglke edidre, ye taragl tau kan nogwa i, mudu i pi yoba pere tenabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Yoba ta na bogl akie moglkrumga i, ye na kudana ikne ta moglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, yoba ta na ake ple di narekrukwa i, ye yoba si pere pere edugwa mere yegl pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Murubuglo kide ta yoba ta moglmara kide kodidre, ede meda enan, ye dumo ta wau yei, kugla di yomara suna wan mogl, dumo wakai ta ye wakan morabuka i dokinabuka ba ye ta kankrabuka. Yegl pre ye ere mogl, yegl dinabuka, Na yugu ta okna kipaimara ikra, ede ikne enaluwe dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Yegl didre, ede ikne enan, ye kanabuka i, yugu nem yugu i brum didre, ere wakai ere kodugwa mere yegl pamedi kanabuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ye yegl kandre, pi murubuglo kide 7-pela mabuno kide mina ede okna eigwa i, ama doko inan, ye akie ede ikne unaiglkwa. Ye ede ikne u yoba ta murubuglo kide ye moglmara kide kodo ede ogwa i, moglmara suna moraiglkwa. Yegl eribi, yoba i u kide kaima enabuka. Ye okna kide moglkwa ba okuo kide kaima morabuka mere yegl pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di moglko, yoba mere kide ye kamo pre meglmara suna i, abu swara ta ka podo yegl dugwa, Abu ta ene kuglsre, am togwa i, God ye ere wakai ere tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ye yegl dugwa ba Jisas tabre di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Ta manga ba yoba ta God kamo prisre, duglo beglkwa i, God ye ere wakai ere tenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba tau Jisas kimagl eran, kanamnedi prikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matyu 12.38-42</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mak 8.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Ana yoba mere kide ede Jisas moglmara enamnedi ere meglko, Jisas ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i, u kide pi kodimiwa. Na kimagl ya diu ta etn, kanamnedi prikwa ba na ta erekraglka. Na taragl swara ta eribo, kanaiglkwa i, Jona okna erumere yegl eribo, kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Taragl ta Jona moglmara plau dugo, Ninive yoba kandre, nomane imere yegl, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ama yegl eribo, yugobuno erme meglkwa i kanaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Te, God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, abu dumo Shiba kwin moglkwa ikra, ama adiglsre ene yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i mabunono kide pamedi i nogugl edenabuka. I siragl pre king Solomon nomanemo wakai pame digwa pre abu kwin i, ye dumo eglke kaima moglsre, u Solomon ka dinan, pragledi ugwa. Ba na kade mogl, king Solomon nomanemo egre teiga moglka i, magigl akie munga ba na kana prakirikwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Te, ege i plau dinan, Ninive yoba ama adiglsre, ene yoba erme meglkwa i mabunono kide yomedi i nogugl edenaiglkwa. I siragl pre Jona ye Ninive yoba meglmara pi God kamo di togwa igne, ye mudu nomano yake teigwa ba na erme yagl kade mogl, Jona egre teiga i, ene nomano yake tenakrimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba gumuglno i, ken lam mere yegl paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matyu 5.15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ken gagl yu bogl atne yeimo? Mo, degigl gagl ta yu ken bolamugl yei, si bi dimo? Ta manugwa ba bogl mina padigl, nogugl yeigo, yoba ede yugugl wigwa i, abuglagemo kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ana ene gumuglno paugwa i, ken lam mere yegl padre, ene ogono nagino mudu abuglage si tenabuka paugwa. Ene gumuglno wakai panan, ene ogono nagino mudu panabuka i, abuglage sinabuka. Ba ene gumuglno kide eran, ene ogono nagino mudu mim erabuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Yegl pre ene kan kun erio. Kowai ene kaima mim mina moglsre, no munara abuglage sumedi praiglkwa i, i kide panabuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ba ene ogono nagino pamara i, ikne ta mim erekre, mudu abuglage sinan, i wakai panabuka. Ken lam ta abuglage si, ene meglmara edumere mere yegl, ene ogono nagino mudu abuglage si panabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye Farisi yoba ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba yubun inaiglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matyu 23.1-36</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mak 12.38-40</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Ana Jisas ka di moglko, Farisi yagl ta ere mogl, Na kipaimara un, kaya mokna akie nenabugledi priwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas ye kipamara pidre, kaya mokna nenagledi ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Jisas ame di moglko, Farisi yagl i ye ogo nigl koglkre, kaya mokna nenagledi erumedi kandre, nagie koglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ye nagie koglko, Yagl Kade Jisas ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Ene Farisi yoba meglkwa i, kap ya dis meda nigl keglkwa ba deglbi suna yogwa i, nigl kogl koko edekrikwa. Na diga i, ene ogono nagino meda yogwa i, yoba wakai yomedi kanigwa ba ene deno muduno atne i, mabuno kide kau sugo, ene taragl kane kane bubuno geglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Ene du erikwa paugwa. Yoba ta ene ogono nagino beke yogwa i, ye ene deno muduno ama beke yogwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ba ene deno muduno atne i, deglbi yeikrabedi pribi, ene goduglme yoba ake ple di tenamendi taraglno i pi teo. Ene yegl eribi, ene meglmere mudu pe sinabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene Farisi yoba meglkwa i, yubun podo inaiglkwa. Ene siragl kebra kide kaima ede yaudo demene erukwa gaden mina paugwa i, br boglsre, swara ta i pi God teigwa wakai ersre, lo duglo bunedi prikwa ba ene yoba mabuno du ere tenaiglkwa ya God wakai kanaiglkwa i, i taragl podo paugwa ba erekrikwa. Ene taragl podo eraiglkwa paugwa i ersre, taragl kebra eraiglkwa ama eribi, i wakai panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ene Farisi yoba meglkwa i, yubun podo inaiglkwa. I siragl pre ene ka mabuno yugu makai simara i, sia wakai yoba gumuglnomugl yeigwa i mina ame dinamnedi prisre, maket wan meglkwa igne, yoba ene di wakai yei teigo, ene gun yeimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ene Farisi yoba meglkwa i, yubun podo inaiglkwa. Yoba ta goglko, ye ogo nagie i pi maugl sidre, padiglmara i bro pamedi kankrimere mere yegl meglkwa. Yoba gigl pene yomedi kankre, tebe egrimere mere yegl, ene deno muduno deglbi kau sugwa i, yoba ama kankrikwa pre diwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, God lomo beke togwa yagl ta di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Tisa, ene Farisi yoba ka tenara i, no ama kenaglno siniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba meglkwa i, ene ama yubun podo inaiglkwa. I siragl pre ene God lomo mudu duglo bolo dimara i mina yoba yubun podo kaima kakenaiglmedi teigwa ba ene kuri kaima ta ikne ake ple di tekrimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ene yubun podo inaiglmiwa. I siragl pre ene God kamo kep yoba maugl simara yugu kor kei teigwa i, enene kowano awano yoba i si geglkwa pre kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Ye gigl peneno kor kei teimara i mina ene kowano awano bogl deno muduno swara yei, akie ye si geglkwa mere yegl i nogugl edimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ene mabunono kide i pre God yene nomanemo du pamara i mina yegl dugwa, Na ka kep yoba ya dediga yoba akie Israel yoba meglmara enaiglmedi dedibo, Israel yoba tau ere kide ere tedre, tau si goraiglmiwe di, God yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Oknayene ibo God dumo makan ere yogwa igne ede u ege erme pra, God kamo kep yoba siramna ta si gogl wimara i, ene yugobuno erme meglkwa i, u kide kaima pidre, mabuno kaima moraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />God kamo kep yoba ta komono kana si geglkwa i, Abel si geglkwa. Yoba Abel si goglsre, God kamo kep yoba tau mere si gogl wimara i, okuo kaima yagl Sekaraia, ye tawa bogl yomara ya God yugumo yomara suna i moglko, yoba ye si geglkwa. Na ene ka kaima di teiga, God kamo kep yoba mudu i si geglmara i, ene yugobuno erme meglkwa i, God topo kide tenan, inaiglkwa pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba meglkwa i, yubun podo inaiglmiwe dugwa. I siragl pre ene nomane wakai inamnedi erekre, yoba tau ama i dinaiglmedi dua yogugl tedre, dua kimo ama i eglke edimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, dumo i kide kodo, ede ogwa. Ede ogo, mokomugl i God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba ye deno podo kubro tedre, ka kane kane mina Jisas kira pogl prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Jisas ka dinabara i, ka ta aglau ere dinan, kot ere tenamnedi ka di koglsre, kira mere kide peglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ene Farisi mabuno ere dinamnedi kan kun erio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matyu 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ana yoba tausen mere kide u makai sidre, nagino bolamugl kaima meglko, Jisas komono kana ye duglo beglkwa yoba yegl di togwa, Farisi yoba yisno pre ene kan kun erio. Na Farisi yoba yisno we diga i, ye yoba gumuglno mina yoba wakai munedi ersre, teke atne mabuno kide erikwa i pre diga. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ba ene prio, taragl kane kane ta atne teke yogwa i, mudu u nogugl enan, yoba pre pogl sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ene ka siragl mere teke atne digwa i, yoba mudu praiglkwa. Te, ene yugugl mogl, yoba ka nunu ta di tenga i, nogugl kaima poran, yoba praiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">God swara kuduglmo goramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matyu 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na kabaglena meglkwa i, ka ta dibo, praiglmiwa. Yoba ene ogono nagino keme si goraiglkwa i pre kuduglno goglkrio. Ye ogono nagino mina si goraiglkwa ba kiano ta ere kide erekraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Yoba kuduglno goglkrisre, God swara kuduglmo golo. Ye swara yoba si goglsre, kiano ama akie pia si doga kade mina edenabuka yagl moglkwa pre yoba kuduglno goglkrisre, ye swara kuduglmo goraiglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Kua idada kebra kide kaima meglmedi kanumga ba God swara swarade sugl wakai moglmiwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ye kua kebra sugl wakai moglkwa pre ene yoba meglkwa i, taragl kade munedi prisre, God no bitno yugo swara swarade wakai ere, kere kan kodidre, no suglno wakai moglmedi prisre, yoba swara ta kuduglmo goglkrio! dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas agaimo goglkramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Matyu 10.19-20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">10.32-33</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ere mogl, yoba gumuglno mina Na Jisas duglo boliwe dinabuka i, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ama God angeloma moraiglmara di nogugl edidre, Yoba i na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglmiwe dinaglka. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ba yoba ta yoba gumuglno mina Na Jisas duglo boglkrie dinabuka i, na God angeloma moraiglmara ama di nogugl edidre, Yoba i na duglo boglkwa ta moglkrume dinaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Ana yoba ta na Yoba Wam moglka i ka kide di naran, God ye tadaglmemo i, gugl edenabuka. Ba yoba ta Mudu Murubuglo di kide yei tenan, God ye tadaglmemo i ta gugl ede tekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ene kot ere tenamnedi auro i pi Hibru ka mabuno yuguno yugugl edenaiglkwa mo gavman yoba ya yoba kade gumuglno mina ta edibi, ene ka siragl mere kot mina di ikne ede tenaiglkwa i pre, pre yubun dekrio. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />I siragl pre ene ka siragl mere dibi, wakai panabuka i, Mudu Murubuglo yene ege i ene beke tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas taragl kane kane bubuno goglkrio! dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Ana yoba mere kide Jisas kamo pre meglmara suna i, yagl swara ta ere mogl, Jisas yegl di togwa, Tisa yo, na nina goglko, na agra ye taraglmo mudu yumiwa. Ene ye di ten, no neno taraglmo ikne yubu si narebedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre yegl dine? Yoba ta ene jasno moglsre, ene bonaganano sugl moratnedi na dedumedi pitno? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Jisas yegl di tedre, yoba mudu magigl meglkwa i, ama yegl dugwa, Ene kan kun erio! Taragl kane kane bubuno gogl dinaiglmiwa! Yoba ta kor mogl, gun yenabuka i, ye taragl mere kide bona sinabuka i pre ta gun yekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Jisas yegl didre, ye yoba ka ebrie ta di te yegl dugwa, Yagl ta mige moni podo kan nogwa. Ye makanmo nuglo podo moglkwa pre wit ere yaglkwa i, mere kide boglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17-18" />Mere kide boglmedi kandre, yagl i yegl prukwa, Na yugu ta keiga i, wit mogo si yugugl edibo, kuno erekrabiwa. Yegl pre yugu i terke, tau podo dagl kedre, wit mogo mudu si yugugl edibo, kau sinabiwe di prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Yegl di prisre, Na wit mogo si i pi yebo, kau sinan, na yoko wakan mogl, ege olto wit topo bogl i nedre, ama kaya mokna kane kane ya wain nuglo ki kogl nedre, gun yenaluwe di, kina gudo prume dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Kina gudo pruko, God u yagl i yegl di togwa, Ene du etno? Ene erme eduer gogln, ene taragl mere makai singa i, yoba si pedigl padigl eraiglmiwe di, God yegl dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba taragl kane kane i makai sigwa ba God gumuglo wagle yobamo i, goduglme kaima meglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makandigle taragl pre nomane sikramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matyu 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba yegl di togwa, Ana na ene ka ebrie di teiga i, ene pre epigl ersre, erme makandigle siragl mere mogl pai eraiglkwa i, pre yubun dekrio. Ene kaya mokna siragl mere nenaiglmere mo kuguglno gaglno siragl mere edinaiglmere kaima nomane sikrio. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />I siragl pre kugugl gagl edinaiglmara mo kaya mokna nenaiglmara i mina u yoba kaima pikraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Kua kotkot meglkwa i, ene prio. Yene kaya mokna ere yagl, si nenaiglkwa i pre nomane sikrikwa. Ba God kua wakai moraiglmedi suglno moglkwa i, no yoba munga i, siragl podo pamedi prisre, no wakai kaima suglno morabedi praiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ene siragl mere wakai mogl pai eraiglkwa pre ege ege nomane sibi, ene bugla yuguno ere i olto edinaiglmo? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ana bugla yugu olto kuri moraiglkwa ta kuno erekran, siragl eruko ene taragl kane kane pre nomane sidre, pre yubun deme? di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Kugl siragl mere pare pi kwie sumere yegl prio. Ye nomane sidre, kogon podo eriko, kwieno u wakai pikrukwa ba God yene ekino wakai kaima togwa. Te, King Solomon king kuguglmo gaglmo edugwa i win paugwa ba kugl kwie ekino wakai kaima padre, Solomon ekinmo togwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Kugl ege sugunagle paigo, yoba kugl kuba sidre, ere gaiglkwa ba yoba taragl kade paugwa. Yegl pre God kugl ekino togwa panan, ene siragl pre God kugugl gagl norokrabedi prime? Ene God pre mediglkwa i, gigle dikrume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Te, ene kaya mokna siragl mere nenaiglkwa mo nigl siragl mere nenaiglkwa i pre yubun dedre, dokokraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ye makandigle taragl yegl mere inamnedi nomano mina kau sugwa ba ene Neno moglkwa i, ene siragl taragl inaiglkwa pamere i kwande pre kodugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ba ene God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, ake gumano kagle edibi, God makandigle taragl ta inaiglkwa panabere mere tenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taragl wakai wakai okuo inamnedi eramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matyu 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene na sipsipna yugobuno kebra meglkwa i, kudugl goglkrio. I siragl pre ene Neno moglkwa i, ye king mogl, yoba suglno morabara ene tebo, inatnedi wakai prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Ene taraglno i pi mige boglsre, mige i pi goduglme yoba teo. Ene yegl eribi, ene mige moni i pi heven ibo bona sigwa mere yegl panan, taragl wakai wakai okuo inaiglkwa i, ta dudukrabuka. Kunogl gogl yoba ta u i pikribi, gunage ama ere kide erekraiglkwa ba aimadi kamun yenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ene dumo aglo mere ta bona sinaiglkwa i, dumo i keme ene nomano mina kau sinabuka pre heven ibo keme bona sinamnedi erio di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ede ikne unabedi sugl moramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:42-44">Matyu 24.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene ake kun ersre, kogon mina enamnedi kwie ere molo. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Kogon yoba bitno yagl ta ede pi yagl abu suo ta bogl inabrara pidre, eduer ede ikne u dua sinan, tabre yauro tenamnedi sugl meglmere yegl, ene sugl moraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Yagl kade ede ikne udre, ye kogonmo yoba sugl kan meglmedi kandre, ye gun podo yenaiglmedi erabuka. Ye kogon yobamo i, ame dio didre, kaya mokna podo gagl yu tenan, nenaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Ye yaglno kade i eduer suna unabo mo tagna kide mogl unabo mo aunake unabedi sugl wakai meglmedi kanan, kogon yoba i gun podo yenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ene kaima pre pogl sinaiglkwa i, yugu nem yagl ta kunogl gogl yoba aunake ta u yugugl kunogl nenaiglmedi pre kan eran, ye kwie ere, kan morabuka. Ye kanige erekrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Kuno yegl mere ene aimadi sugl kan molo. I siragl pre na Yoba Wam moglka i, aunake unaglka i, ene ta pre kan erekrimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas nigl kogon yoba wakai ya kide pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matyu 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Pita ye yegl di prukwa, Yagl Kade, ene kogon yoba pre ka ebrie dinga i, no ene duglo bunga yoba munga i pre dino mo yoba mudu pre dine? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Yegl dugo, Yagl Kade di ikne ede, ka ebrie ta dugwa, Yagl kade ta ere mogl, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba meglmara suna i ta kaya mokna sugl morabedi pran, ye yoba ta kamo duglo boglsre, nomanemo wakai panabuka i kere inabuka. Kere inan, yobamo i, kaya mokna sugl moglsre, pamere yubu si tedre, erabuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ana nigl kogon yagl i, ye yaglmo kade kogon dedumere ere moran, ye wakai erumedi kandre, gun podo yenabedi ere wakai ere tenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Te, ye ka kaima taraglmo mudu sugl morabedi edenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ba nigl kogon yoba i nomane kide idre, na yaglna kade tabre ukrukwa pre na gua gua eragledi pran, kide panabuka. Ye yoba tau suglno moglkwa i, ere sidre, yene kaya mokna podo nedre, spak eran, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />ye yaglmo kade ye ta ukrabedi prabuka igne unabuka. Udre, ye duglnai ere sidre, nagie si baka didre, Ene ede pi yoba tau na kana pre mediglkrikwa meglmara i po! dinabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Nigl kogon yoba i, ege mere duglnai borabuka. I siragl pre ye kogonmo wakai siragl mere erabuka paugwa i, pre kan erukwa ba ye erekrisre, ama ake kun ere moglkrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ba kogon yoba ye mabuno kide pre kan erekre, eran, ye yaglmo kade duglnai ege suom ta ere sinabuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:48">Yoba ta taragl mere i pi yoba ta tebi, ye kwia mere i tebe ede noraiglmedi praiglkwa. Kuno yegl mere God ene taragl tau mere tenan, ene ye kogonmo mere ama eraiglkwa pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba si buno di, yugobuno pere pere edenagledi wiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matyu 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Na doga ta makandigle ere garagledi pre wiga. Doga i tabre denan, na wakai praluwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Te, na ama nigl kide kaima ta buraglka pai moglkwa pre na dena mudna ibun podo kaima dogwa. Ba nigl kide i buglbo, yubun i dudunabuka.<verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Ana ene siragl we di prime? Na makandigle wiga i, yoba deno muduno swara yenaiglmedi umedi primo? Ta manugwa. Na yoba si buno di, ere i pere pere edenagledi wiga. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Na wimara i, yoba bormai swara meglkwa i, na pre ede u pere pere enaiglkwa. Yugu swara mina yoba 5-pela meglbi, suota pere meglbi, suo pere meglbr, erabuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Yagl ye wam kudamo ikne moran, ye wam i ama nem kudamo ikne morabuka. Te, abu ye abuglo kudamo ikne moran, abuglo i ama mam kudamo ikne morabuka. Te, abu ta ye ebiamo kudamo ikne moran, ye ebiamo i ama ye kudamo ikne morabuka mere yegl pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taragl erme plau dugwa i, kan pogl sinamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matyu 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, yoba mere meglmara kan ake tedre ka yegl di togwa, Kamun kua tau ade beimara ir mage yugo, ene kandre, kamun sinabiwe digo, kaima, kamun sugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Te, ir ta nigl beye mage yugo, Erme niga podo dinabiwe digo, kaima niga dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Ene ka didre, mabuno erikwa i, u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa. Taragl tau makan mina ya kamun mina plau dugwa i, ene kandre, mem yegl yegl pame digwa ba siragl eruko, God ene gumuglno mina taragl podo erukwa i, pre pogl sikrime? dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ege erme God bogl ere kun eramga pre Jisas kot ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matyu 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene mabuno siragl mere wakai panabuka i, pre yubu sinaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Kuno yegl mere yoba ta ene kot ere tenagledi eran, tabre ere wakai eriro. Kowai ye ene gudu i pi jas moglmara edenan, jas ene kibr nem ogo mina yenan, ye ene i pi kane yugu ede dinabuka pre diga. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Taragl yegl plau dinan, na ene kaima di teiga, ene kane yugu kodokratnga. Mige mogo swara keme ta tenatnga pai moran, ene ede meda ukratniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yoba nomano yake tenaiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ana igne i Galili yoba tau ede Jerusalem pidre, tawa tenamnedi ere meglko, Pailat ye si gogl, bormaino suru tawa bogl mina edumiwe di Jisas yegl boglo kugl teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Boglo kugl teigo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Ene siragl we di prime? Galili yoba mudu meglmara ye swara tadaglme yoba kaima meglkwa pre Pailat ye si goglmedi primo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ta manugwa. Ene mudu tadaglme yoba meglkwa pre nomano yake tekribi, ene mudu ama ye geglmere yegl goraiglme dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Te, dumo Siloam yugu olto kuri ta keigwa yage sidre, yoba 18-pela si goglkwa ikra, ye tadaglme podo ersre, Jerusalem yoba tau egre teigwa pre geglmedi primo? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ta manugwa. Ene mudu tadaglme yoba meglkwa pre ene nomano yake tekribi, ene ama geglmere yegl goraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ana Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, Yagl ta ye ede wain ere yaglmara ede fik ta ama akie yaglkwa. Ye ege mere fik mogomo dokinagledi ugwa ba ye mogomo ta kogl paugwa kankrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Yegl pre ye ede wain sugl moglkwa yagl di tedre, Na bugla yugu suota ede omara i, ege swara ta koglkwa kankrika pre ede i wei edo! Ede i makan nuglo yoko ne moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Yegl dugo, ede wain sugl moglkwa yagl i ere mogl, yegl di togwa, Ene we, erme bugla yugu swara ta ama kanige eratne dugwa. Na duglane mina makan si teruwa yedre, kau de make edibo, kanatniwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Bugla yugu ta moglsre, kan, ta koran, wakai. Ba ta manan, wei atne edinatniwe di, yegl dume di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakan kade ege Jisas abu kide sugwa ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ana wakan kade ege ta yogo, Jisas ka mabuno yugu yugugl moglsre, yoba God kamo beke te moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Te, yugugl i, abu ta bugla yugu 18-pela mere murubuglo kide ta ye moglmara moglsre, abu i kide sinabedi eruko, ye moko buko dugo, adigl diglki di morabuka mere manugwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ana Jisas abu i kandre, ede wo dugo, ugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Abu yo, ene kidenen bu yomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yegl didre, abu i akugo, ye kidemo tabre kaima bu yogo, adigl, diglki di mogl, ye God debie si, kagie kade togwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ba yagl ta ka mabuno yugu sugl moglkwa i, Jisas ye wakan kade ege taragl yegl eruko, kandre, dem kubrisre, yoba yegl di togwa, 6-pela de mina kogon eraiglkwa paugwa pre ene kideno bu yenabedi pribi, 6-pela de yomara suna i ye moglmara unaiglkwa ba wakan kade ege yogwa i, ene ukrio! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Yegl dugo, Yagl Kade Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ka didre, mabuno erikwa i, u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa. Wakan kade ege ene ama kogon erikwa yoba meglkwa. Ene kau ya donki kiglkwa i, kane poko ede, nigl nenaiglmedi auro i ede eimo mo pikrime? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Abu i Abraham gawamo ta moglkwa ba ye bugla yugu 18-pela Satan si kane sugwa. Sumara i, na wakan kade ege ye kanemo pokenaglka i, ene mane di primo? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye kudamo ikne meglkwa i, agai podo geglkwa. Agai geglko, yoba mudu ye Jisas taragl wakai wakai erukwa i kandre, gun yeigwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ede mastet mogomo ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matyu 13.31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mak 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ana Jisas ka swara ta yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, siragl mere panabe dinamne? Mo, Ka ebrie siragl mere di boramne? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />I, ede mastet mogo kebra kaima yomere yegl ta pame dinaglka. Yagl ta mastet mogo ta i pi kaya mokna ere yaglmara suna yaglko, mastet pare ede mitna pidre, ede mere yegl paugo, kua tau mere u yogagle mina yugo bagl paimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yis ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matyu 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, siragl mere panabe dinagle? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Dinaglka i, yis mere yegl pame dinaglka. Abu ta flaua mere yomara i, yis kunabe kaima ta i atne edugwa i, flaua mudu ake poia di, ede u podo ome dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba yugu dua kebra yomara i mina ede suna unaiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matyu 7.13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">7.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ana Jisas ede Jerusalem enagledi konbauna omara i, dumo kebra ya taun kade bage yeimara i, yoba God kamo beke tedre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Ana ka beke te omara i, yagl swara ta ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, God yoba ere inabuka i, mere ere inabo mo suom keme ere inabe? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas yoba magigl meglkwa i, yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Ene yobuglo ere, yugu dua kebra yomara i, ede suna enamnedi eraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre na ene kaima di teiga, yoba mere konbauna ta mina ede yugugl enamnedi eraiglkwa ba i kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Te, yugu nem adigl ede u dua lok sinan, ene meda adigl mogl, yugu dua sidre, Yagl Kade yo, ene dua yauro noro! dinaiglkwa ba ye ene yegl di tenabuka, Ene aglo mere mogl wigwa i, na ta kankrie dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Yegl dinan, ene di ikne edidre, Nono nigl ya kaya mokna akie nomgo, no dumono suna i, moglsre, ka beke notngrawa dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Yegl dibi, ye ene yegl di tenabuka, Ene aglonde yoba meglkwa i, na ta kankrika. Ene mabuno kide erikwa yoba meglkwa i, na moglmara kide kodo, ede pio dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Dinan, God yoba kingno morabara suna pi dinaiglmedi ene si meda edibi, Abraham ya Aisak ya Jekop ya God kamo kep yoba mudu suna meglbi, ene kandre, kai podo ere, signo gikr eraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ene meda meglbi, yoba mere kide uglo kogl koglo mogl u God yoba kingno morabara suna i, kaya mokna nenamnedi ame dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Te, ene prio. Yoba ta okuo kaima meglkwa i, ede okna enaiglkwa. Te, yoba erme ede okna eigwa i, okuo kaima unaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Jerusalem yoba mitno goglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matyu 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ana igne i Farisi yoba udre, Jisas yegl di teigwa, Ene dumo magigl i kide kodo, ede po! Herot ene si gorarimiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene ede pi agl are Herot i, yegl di teo. Na erme ya tagna murubuglo kide di meda edidre, yoba kideno ere wakai ersre, batna na kogona ere kodinaglka pamiwe di teo. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Dinaiglkwa ba na erme ya tagna ya barma pra, kaima ede Jerusalem u pai moraglka. I siragl pre God kamo kep yoba mudu dumo Jerusalem si goraiglkwa paugwa. Dumo pere ta si geglbi, kuno ta erekrabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Aiya, ene Jerusalem yoba meglkwa i prio, God kamo kep yoba God ene meglmara dedugwa i, ene si goglsre, tau kobuglo mina si geglmiwa. Te, na ege mere kaima ene suglno moragledi prisre, koduagle mam ye nagiglema kugl bogl tedre, suglno wakai moglmere mere eragledi erika ba ene mane di narikwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Prio, ene erme dumono wau yenabuka. Te, na ta kankre ebi, ege ta plau dinan, ene God di tedre, Yoba ta Yagl Kade dedugo, ugwa i, God ye ere wakai ere tenabiwe!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.26</char></note> dinaiglkwa ege i mina aglke kor dagl na kanaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yagl ta ogo kagle yakugwa i, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1-2" />Ana ege swara ta, wakan kade ege yogo, Jisas Farisi yoba akie kaya mokna nenamnedi ede Farisi bitno yagl ta kipamara ogwa. Ana Jisas yugugl ame di moglko, yagl ta ogo nagie yakugwa i, Jisas gumamugl adigl moglko, Farisi yoba Jisas aglau ta erabo mo di, kan meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Kan meglko, Jisas ye God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Fairisi yoba yugugl meglkwa i, yegl di prukwa, God lomo mina wakan kade ege kimagl ere, yoba ere wakai ere tomun, kuno erabo? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Jisas yegl dugo, yoba ka ta di ikne edekrikwa. Di ikne edekriko, Jisas ye yagl ta kide sugwa i akidre, kidemo ere wakai ere te, dedugo, ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ede ogo, Jisas kira pogl, yegl di togwa, Ene wan mo ene kau kuglnga i ta yage sidre, maugl nigl atne moran, wakan kade ege yogwa pre ene kanige eratno? Ta manugwa. Ene tabre ye ake i meda edinatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye di ikne edenaiglkwa i, ibun dogwa pre ka swara ta dikrikwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba mogl atne edinaiglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Ana Farisi yagl kaya mokna nenamnedi yoba di gaglko, wigwa i, ye gu bogl, sia gumamugl keme ame dinamnedi eriko, Jisas kandre, ye ka ebrie ta yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />Yagl abu ta bogl inabredi kaya mokna podo ere, ene ta di gaiglbi, en, ene gu bogl, sia gumamugl wakai ta yogwa i, ame dinagledi erekro dugwa. Kowai sia gumamugl yogwa i, yoba ta kagie podo paugwa ta morabedi sia yeigwa panan, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />yagl kade i unan, yoba di gaglkwa i, Ene we, sia yagl i tedre, bage ta ame do dinan, ene agai goglsre, pi yoba mokonomugl ame dinatnga paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ba ene ede yugugl pidre, mokonomugl ame di motn, yoba ta ene di gaglkwa i udre, ene yegl di tenabuka, Agra yo, ene u sia gumamugl ame do dinan, pra yoba mere gumuglnomugl i, ene kandre, yagl kade ta motnedi kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />I siragl pre yoba ta yene mogl mitna edenabuka i, God ye ake atne edenabuka. Ba yoba ta yene mogl atne edenabuka i, God ye ake mitna edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta ere wakai ere norokraiglkwa meglkwa i, ere wakai ere tenamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, Farisi yagl ta ye di gaglkwa ikra yegl di togwa, Ene kaya mokna kebra mo kade ta gaglsre, yoba akie nenamnedi di garagledi etn, Yoba kabaglenen ya agiglnma ya yoba bormai swara meglkwa ya yoba mige moni podo ere neigwa magigl kipanaiglkwa i, di gaglkro. Aglau eran, ege swara ta ene etnere i, ere te ikne edibi, topo makandigle pra inga mere yegl panabuka. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ba ene kaya mokna podo kenatnga igne, yoba goduglme meglkwa ya yoba kide sigwa ya ogono kaglno kide erukwa ya gumuglno kin yogwa ya ki di gaglo. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ye ta te ikne edekraiglkwa meglkwa pre God gumuglo mina yoba du meglkwa adraiglkwa igne, God yene topo tenan, ene gun podo yenatnga pre diwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaya mokna podo ta keigwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matyu 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ana Jisas ka ebrie yegl dugo, yoba kaya mokna ne meglmara suna i, yagl swara ta Jisas yegl di togwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ege i, yoba ta akie mogl, kaya mokna nenaiglkwa i, gun podo yenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Yagl swara ta kaya mokna podo garagledi ersre, yoba tau mere akie nenamnedi di gaglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Di gaglsre, kaya mokna gaglkwa, dogo, nigl kogon yagl i dedidre, pi yoba i di yunabedi dedugo, ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ye niglmo kogonmo yagl pi yoba di togwa ba ye mudu kaima ukramnedi konbauna dokigwa. Komono ta di prukwa i, yegl di togwa, Na we, erme makan kor ta topo siga pre makan i pi kanaglka pre ta ukraglka pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Te, yagl ta ama yegl dugwa, Na erme kau kumugl 10-pela topo erika pre kogon eraiglmara i, nana sugl moglbo, kogon eraiglkwa pre ta ukraglka pame dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Te, yagl ta ama yegl dugwa, Na erme keme abu ta iga pre na unaglka i, kuno ta erekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Ana nigl kogon yagl ede ikne u ye dimere mere ye yaglmo kade boglo kugl togo, yagl kade i dem boglko, ye yegl di togwa, Ene we, kogon yoba tau idre, tabre ede pi taun suna wan mogl, konbo kade ya kebra mina goduglme yoba ta moraiglkwa i ya te, yoba kide sigwa mo ogono kaglno kide erukwa mo gumuglno kin yogwa i, mudu auro yuio! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Yegl dugo, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba ikra ye dumere ersre, ede ikne u yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, no ene dinere erumga ba agai mudu yoko yome dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Yegl dugo, yagl kade ye niglmo kogonmo yagl i yegl di togwa, Ana ene ede ikne pidre, taun meda konbo kade ya togl bina bina di gagl yuo! Na yuguna kau sinabedi yoba mudu pra pra kanaiglkwa i, auro yunamnedi ka gigledi di teo dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Na ka kaima dinaglka i, yoba okna di gaglka i, swara kaima ta u na kaya mokna erme ere yeiga i, kebra kaima ta ne prikrabiwe di, yagl kade i yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba wakai ere kinano gudu prisre, Jisas duglo boraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matyu 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Ana Jisas konbauna ede ogo, yoba mere kidine ye mokomugl sika sigo, Jisas kan ake tedre, ye yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />Yoba ta na moglmara udre, na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moragledi pran, ye nem mam morabrika mo, ebie gagiglma moraiglkwa mo, agiglema abaugloma moraiglkwa i, ye mudu wakai kankre, na swara wakai kanaiglkwa paugwa. Te, yene ama kor wakai moragledi pran, ye na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglkrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Te, yoba ta na pre gorakiure, ye ede prak ta tebi, kakekragledi mane di pran, ye ama na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglkrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yagl ta yugu podo kide kaima ta kenagledi pran, ye komono kana wakai ere kina gudu prisre, yugu siragl mere kei kodinabere mere mige moni kuno yomo mo di, pre yubu sinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29-30" />Kowai na ta kei kodokre, ikne keme ta keibo, Yoba i kogon ere kodinabuka kere dikrumiwe di, na gauglna ere dinaiglmedi pre epigl sinabuka paugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, King ta soldia 20,000 kugl nogwa idre, king ta kuda bogl tenagledi konbo bage u moran, king solida 10,000 kugl nogwa i, ka sigie dibi, prisre, ye siragl mere kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erabere mere komono kana kina gudu prisre, pre yubu sinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ye kuda yobuglo erekrabuka mere panan, ye ka sigie edidre, kuda i ta paikrabedi yoba ta di edenan, pi king eglke u pai moglmere pi di tenaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Kuno yegl mere yoba ta ye taraglmo mudu moko tenabuka i keme na duglo borabuka kuno erabuka pre ene ama wakai ere kinano gudu prisre, na duglo bolo di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mudi u kide ogwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matyu 5.13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mak 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Ana Jisas ta ama yegl dugwa, Mudi yogwa i, taragl wakai yogwa. Ba mudi kuglomo ta dudinan, ene siragl mere kuglomo ere ikne edinaiglme? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Mudi yegl mere kogonmo okuo ta paikrabuka pre yoba idre, kau de bogl i swara edidre, makan nuglo tenamnedi eraiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrabuka. Ye pia si meda edenaiglkwa keme paugwa. Yoba ta nomane inagledi pran, na ka diga i, ye wakai ere kina gudu prabuka pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Sipsip ta wau boglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matyu 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lost sheep" file="BK00005b.tif" size="col" copy="Bass/Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="15.1" />Ana taks igwa yoba ya tadaglme yoba ege mere Jisas ka dugwa pramnedi ede magigl wigwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Wigo, Farisi ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba kandre, ka kane kane di, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye ege mere tadaglme yoba bogl begane yei, akie kaya mokna neimiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ye ka yegl digwa pre Jisas ka ebrie ta yegl dugwa, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />Yagl ta sipsip 100 kurabuka ba sipsip swara ta wau boran, ye siragl erabe? dugwa. Ye sipsip 99-pela yoko moraiglkwa i kanige ersre, swara ta wau boglkwa i, dokinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Doko kanabuka igne, ye gun yedre, sipsip i kugro i pi <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />yugugl edidre, kabaglemo ya yoba magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, agle di, yegl di tenabuka, Nono akie gun yenamniwa. Na sipsipna swara ta wau boglkwa ba na doko kan iwe di, yegl dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Kuno yegl mere tadaglme yoba swara ta nomane yake tenan, God ye angeloma bogl gun podo yenaiglkwa. Ye yoba 99-pela ta yoba du mogl kodigwa i pre gun kebra yenaiglkwa ba tadaglme yoba swara ta nomane yake tenan, gun podo kide yenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mige mogo swara ta wau boglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Abu ta mige mogo 10-pela yenabuka ba swara ta wau boran, ye siragl erabe? dugwa. Ye ken ere gaglsre, wakai ere doko mogl, yugugl brum di, mige mogo swara i, doko kanabuka. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Doko kandre, ye kabeglemo ya yoba magigl akie kipaigwa i agle didre, yegl dinabuka, Nono akie gun yenamga pamiwa. I siragl pre na mige mogo swara ta yeiga i, wau boglkwa ba na doko kaniwe dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Kuno yegl mere tadaglme yoba swara ta nomane yake tenabuka igne, God ye angeloma bogl gun podo yenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta wam wau bogl, ede ikne yugomugl ugwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di pai moglsre, ta ama yegl dugwa, Aglke ta yagl ta moglkwa, ye wam suo miuriwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Ye wam suo miurka ba wam okuo ye pi nem di te, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, ene gogln, na ene makanen ya taraglnen inaglka panabere i, erme yubu si naro! di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i kanige ere, taraglmo mudu yubu si, wam suo i tomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Feeding pigs" file="cn01759B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="15.13" />Ana yubu si togo, ye wam okuo ege sugunagle keme mogl, ye nem makanmo ya taraglmo togwa ikra, mudu topo bogl idre, ede kantri eglke ta enagledi ede ogwa. Ye kantri eglke ta omara i, ye migemo mabuno gua gua mina ere ede ogwa, dudugwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ye migemo dudugwa igne, ye kantri ta moglmara i, ama kidan podo yogwa. Kidan podo yogo, ye migemo ta yoko yenan, ye kaya mokna i nenabuka ta manugo, kidan podo goglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ye kidan goglsre, ede pi makan nem ta moglmara pidre, kogon eragledi di pruko, makan nem i ye bugla ere kuglmara buglamo kaya mokna tenabedi dedugwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ye dedugo, pi kaya mokna kie bugla te moglsre, kidan podo goglkwa pre ye ama kie i nenagledi prukwa. Prukwa ba makan nem swara ta ye kaya mokna nenabedi ta tekrime dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ana wam okuo i kidan yegl goglsre, kogon ere moglmara i, nomane kor ta yugwa. Nomane kor ta idre, yegl kina gudu prukwa, Na nina niglmo kogonmo yoba i, ege ege kaya mokna podo nedre, dano eruko, ikne moglade yei, yegl erikwa ba na po pai, goraglka pamiwe di, yegl di kina gudu prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Yegl prisre, ye, Na ede ikne nina moglmara pidre, na yegl dinaluwedi prukwa, Nina yo, erme God gumuglo mina ya ene gumugln mina na tadaglme eriwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ene erme na wana we dinatnga i, kuno ta erekrukwa pre ene na wana we dikitn, na nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl moraluwe di, yegl dinagledi kina gudu prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Yegl prisre, ye ede ikne nem moglmara enagledi ede ome dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Prodigal returns" file="CN01761B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="15.20" />Ana wam ikra ede ikne nem moglmara enagledi ede ogwa. Ye nem kipamara ede magigl ogo, nem kan eglke iro ede, wam i ugo, kandre, mirie gogl, muku di ede pi ye wam umara pidre, kogl kare di, nugu kugro, pauna si nogwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Yegl eruko, wam ye nem di tedre, Nina yo, na God gumuglo mina ya ene gumugln mina tadaglme erika pre ene erme Na wana we dinatnga i, kuno ta erekrumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Wam yegl dugwa ba nem mirie goglkwa pre ye niglmo kogonmo yoba meglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Ene tabre pidre, ir gagl olto wakai kaima ta yenabuka i, yu na wana ede tedre, ogo ring ya kagle towo ta yenabuka i yu ede teo dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Yegl didre, ama yegl di togwa, Ene pi kau nagigle gumamugl ta kuglka moglkwa i, yu si kebi, nono pra pra nedre, gun yenamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />I siragl pre na wana i, goglmedi prika ba adigl u kor ogwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, ye wau boglkwa ba erme aglke ede ikne umiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, niglmo kogonmo yoba bogl akie makai si, kaya mokna kei, gun yemiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Ana kaya mokna ne, gun yei meglko, yagl i wam komono kaya mokna ere yaiglmara wan moglkwa. Ye kogon ere wan ede ikne kipamara magigl udre, prukwa i, ye gigagle di, katno egre meglkwa prisre, <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />ye nigl kogon yoba ta magigl moglkwa i ye di pre, siragl taragl plau dugwa i pragledi kira pogl prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Kira pogl pruko, nigl kogon yagl i ere mogl, agigle komono i di te, Ene agitn okuo ikra we, kor mogl, ede ikne umiwa. Yegl pre ene nen, gun yei, kau nagigle gumamugl ta kuglkwa ikra si keigo, nedre, gun yeimiwe di, nigl kogon yoba yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba i kaya mokna ne, gun yei ere meglkwa ba ye wam komono dem kubro, ede yugugl enakiurukwa. Yegl erukwa pre ye nem ede meda u, wam komono dem muduo aragan erabedi ka wakai di togwa <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />ba ye wam komono nem di te, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, ene pro! Na bugla yugu tau mere ene kogonen ere tedre, ege swara ta kanen sedekriwa. Yegl erika ba ene ege swara ta taragl kebra, meme nagigle mere yegl ta na kabaglena bogl si kei ne, gun yenaiglmedi pre ta narekitnga. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ba ene wan okuo ene migenen mudu i pi, konbauna abu te ede ogo, dudugo, ye aglke ede ikne ugwa ba ene kau nagigle gumamugl ta kuglnga ikra si kei teniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Yegl dugo, ye nem wam komono di te, yegl dugwa, Wana yo, ene ege ege akie mugliwa. Te, na taraglnana ta yogwa i, mudu ene pre yomiwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Yogwa ba erme we, nono kaya mokna kedre, gun yenabuglka pamiwe dugwa. I siragl pre agitn okuo wau bogl, gorabuka ba erme ede ikne ugwa i, adigl u kor ogwa mere yegl pamiwe di, yagl i wam komono yegl di tomiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kogon yagl ta yaglmo kade migemo kunogl nogwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl ka ebrie ta di togwa, Yagl ta mige podo kan nogwa ta moglko, ye nigl kogonmo yagl swara ta ye taraglmo mudu sugl moglkwa. Ana ege swara ta yoba u, Ene nigl kogonen yagl i, ene taraglnen kunogl ne moglmiwe di, nem yagl yegl di teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Yegl digo, yagl i prisre, ye kogonmo yagl i agle dugo, ugo, yegl di togwa, Ene na taraglna kunogl ne motne digo, prika pre ene si meda edinariwa. Yegl pre taragl mudu sugl motnere siragl mere yogwa i, di naratnga pre yuo dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ana yagl i yegl dugo, ye niglmo kogonmo yagl i ede meda pidre, yegl prukwa, Aya, na siragl eragledi prukwa. Bitna yagl i, na si meda edenan, Na savol akidre, yoba kogono ere tedre, mige inaglka i, yobra ta paikruko, te, na ogona kugl, mige pre yana di moraglka i, ama agai goliwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Goglka ba erme na siragl mere eribo, na bitna yagl na si meda edenabuka igne yoba okuo na i yugugl edidre, suglna moraiglkwa i, na nomane ta iga. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Nigl kogon yagl i nomane yegl idre, ye yaglmo kade yoba tau dina ere togwa yobamo i, mudu agle dugo, wigwa. Wigo, ye swara ta yegl di prukwa, Ene dinanen siramna pame? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Yegl dugo, yagl ta dina erukwa i, yegl dugwa, na oliv nuglo dram 100 dina erika, pai moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, nigl kogon yagl i yegl dugwa, Ene dinanen pepa mina bogl atne edigwa i, idre, tabre magigl ame di mogl, dram 50-pela keme pai moglmedi boglo dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ye yegl didre, yagl ta ama di pre, Ene dinanen siramna pame? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, Wit 100 bek dina erika pai moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, nigl kogon yagl i, ye yegl di togwa, Ene dinanen pepa mina bogl atne edigwa i idre, bek 80-pela keme pai moglmedi boglo dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Ana okuo, mige podo kan nogwa yagl i, ye kogonmo yagl yegl mere erumiwe digo, prukwa igne, ye kogonmo yagl mabunomo kide paugwa ba nomanemo olto pamiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Makadigle yoba we, erme wakai moramnedi konbauna mere pre kan ere, yoba abuglage mina meglkwa i, egre atne edimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, Na ene yegl di teiwe dugwa, Ene mige moninen yoba mere ake ple di ten, okuo yoba i ene kabeglenen mere yegl moglsre, kogl kare di idre, ene yugu ta aimadi kipanatnara auro i suna edinaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Yoba ta taragl kebra ta sugl wakai moran, ye taragl podo ama sugl wakai morabuka. Ba yoba ta taragl kebra ta sugl wakai moglkran, ye ama taragl podo ta sugl wakai moglkrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Yegl pre ene mige moni erme kan nenga i mina wakai erekitn, heven ibo taragl ta yenabuka i, God ene ogon mina yekrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Te, ene yoba pere kogonmo wakai ere tekitn, God taragl tau enene pre yenabedi tekrabuka.<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Nigl kogon yoba ta yoba suo kogono ere tenabuka, kuno ta erekrabuka. Ye yaglmo kade ta wakai kandre, ta wakai kankrabuka. Te, ye yagl swara ta bogl si dakagl miur, ta moko tenabuka. Kuno yegl mere ene God kogonmo ersre, mige moni ama pre i mitna edinamnedi eribi, kuno ta erekrabuka.<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Ana Farisi yoba Jisas mige moni pre ka dugwa i, prisre, gaugl podo erikwa. Ye mige moni wakai kanigwa pre gaugl erikwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Gauglmo eriko, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Ene meglkwa i, yoba gumuglno mina no yoba du muniwedi erikwa ba ene deno muduno mina siragl mere paugwa i, God pre kan erukwa. Yoba taragl tau wakai yomedi pre, pre i mitna edigwa i, God kide kaima yomedi kanugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye God lomo ya God yoba kingno morabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />God lomo ya ye kamo kep yoba ka okna beglkwa i, kep ere di wigo, ene ama pre ede wigwa. Ba God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ka i, na Jon bogl dubuglko, yoba mere kide yobuglo ere, God ye kingno morabara ede suna enamnedi erimiwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Dumo makan ya kamun mitna ibo dudibr, kuno erabuka ba God lomo bage swara kaima ta dudukrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl abu si bugl dinaiglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">Matyu 5.31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19.9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mak 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Yagl ta ye ebie sedidre, abu kor ta yunan, ye abu i kunogl nogwa. Te, yagl ta ye ebie sedinan, yagl pere ta ere mogl, ye abu sedugwa i inan, ye ama abu i kunogl nomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta mige mere kan nogwa ya yagl ta goduglme moglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Ana Jisas ka ta yegl dugwa, Mige moni mere kan nogwa yagl ta okna moglme dugwa. Ye mige moni mere kan nedre, kugugl gagl gogl ya kruo wakai kaima ersre, kaya mokna wakai kaima keme nei, gun yei moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ye yegl ere moglko, yagl goduglme ta ama moglkwa, kagie Lasarus we digwa. Yoba ege ege yagl Lasarus i boglo ere i pi ye ogo kugl, mige ki yana dinabedi mige moni mere kan nogwa yagl ikra kipamara togl pgla meda kra edigo, pai moglkwa. Lasarus ogo nagie mina num mere kide dogwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Ana Lasarus togl pgla meda kra pai moglsre, kidan gogl, yagl mige mere kan nogwa i kaya mokna nogwa tau yage maginagle sugwa i nenagledi prukwa. Te, ye ogo nagie num domara we, agl ege ege u bare neime dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Rich man and Lazarus" file="C079 bw NT.tif" size="span" copy="New Tribes Mission" ref="16.22">Dumo Kidile ya Wakaile pere pere yomere</figure>Ana okuo yagl goduglme moglkwa ikra goglko, angelo tau u, ye boglo ere i pi Abraham moglmara edigwa. Te, mige mere kan nogwa yagl ikra ye ama goglko, yoba ye maugl sigwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ye maugl sigo, ye ede dumo kidile pi giugl podo prisre, kan eglke iro ede, Abraham ya Lasarus akie miurko, kanugwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ye kandre, agle di, yegl dugwa, Nina Abraham yo, ene na mitna goglo! dugwa. Na doga domara mogl, giugl podo kide prika. Ene Lasarus di ten, ye ogo mogo nigl kor mina edidre, yu na drabna mina si banan, kuri ta bi yenabiwe di, yegl agle dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Yagl i yegl dugwa ba Abraham di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Wana yo, ene pro! Ene kor mogl, taragl wakai kane kane inga igne, Lasarus taragl kide keme yugwa. Ba erme we, ye dem muduo aragan eruko, wakai moglko, ene giugl podo pitnga. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Te, Lasarus ene motnara unabuka i, kuno erekrukwa. No muglara ya ene motnara suna i, God bidai podo sugwa, paugwa. Ye bidai sugwa i, yoba no muglara yegl mogl, ene motnara enamnedi pribi, ye ta pikraiglkwa pre, ya te, yoba ene motnara meglkwa i no muglara ta ukraiglkwa pre bidai podo si paduglme di, Abraham yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Abraham ka yegl dugo, yagl i aglke kor dugwa, Nina yo, yegl panan, na ene yegl di praglka, ene Lasarus dedin, ye na nina agrama meglmara enabuka. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Na agrama 5-pela meglkwa pre diga. Ye na agrama meglmara pi, ka giglede di tenan, na agrama prisre, dumo kidile na moglmara i ta ukraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ye yegl dugo, Abraham aglke kor dugwa, Moses ka tau bogl atne edugwa i ya ka kep yoba pere pere ka bogl atne edigwa i, ene agiglnma kersre, ka i praiglkwa pamiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Abraham yegl dugwa ba yagl mige mere kan nogwa i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, I ta kuno erekrabuka. Ba yoba goglkwa ta ede ikne pi ye meglmara pidre, ye ka di tenan, ye nomano yake tenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Yegl dugwa ba Abraham aglke kor dugwa, Ene agiglnma Moses kamo ya ka kep yoba pere pere kano i prikribi, yoba goglkwa ta ede ikne pi ye meglmara pidre, ka di tenan, ye pre mediglkraiglmiwe di, Abraham yegl dumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yoba yage si dinamedi eraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matyu 18.6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">18.21-22</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mak 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Taragl tau yoba yage sinaiglkwa pre plau dinan, plau dinabuka keme paugwa. Ba yoba ta ere mogl, yoba pere ta yage sinabedi eran, ye yubun podo inabuka. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Gak kebra magigl meglkwa i, yoba ta yage sinabedi eran, ye yubun podo kide inabuka. Yoba ta ye nugu mina kobuglo podo ta kan kogl padigl, pia si mudi nigl atne edibi, yuwaglke panabuka ba God ye ka tage tenabuka i, podo kide panabuka.<verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ene agitn tadaglme ta eran, ene aglau etniwe di to. Ene di ten, ye nomane yake tenan, ye tadaglmemo koko ede to. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Te, ye ege swara mina ene ege 7-pela taim mere aglau ere tedre, ege 7-pela taim mere ene motnara u, Nomana yake teiwe dinan, ene ye tadaglmemo kide kodo te pai moglo di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba pre medigl moglsre, taragl podo eraiglkwa pre Jisas dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Ana Jisas dedugwa yoba Jisas di tedre, No pre medunga i, u podo enabedi eratnedi prumniwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas tabre di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa i, kebra panan, ene ama taragl podo eraiglkwa. Ene pre mediglkwa i, mastet mogo ta kebra kaima yomere yegl panabuka ba ene pre medigl moglsre, ede ta magigl paugwa i di te, Ene duglanen bogl makan magigl i kide kodo, ede mudi nigl suna ibo po ta dibi, ene dinaiglmere mere erabuka pamiwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas boi paigwa ya bitno yoba mabunono pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Nigl kogon yoba yaglmo kade kogon tenabere ere wan mogl, ikne unabuka igne, ye tabre ame didre, kaya mokna nekrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ye yaglmo kade kaya moknamo komono kana gagl suru tedre, okuo yene kaya moknamo nenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Te, yaglmo kade tabre niglmo kogonmo yoba debie sikrabuka. Siragl pre ye kogonmo pamere erumedi prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Kuno yegl mere, ene na kana prisre, duglo beglkwa igne, No kogon wakai erumga pre debino suo ta dikraiglkwa ba kogono pamere keme eunedi prio di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl 10-pela leprosi paigwa i, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ana Jisas ede Jerusalem enagledi distrik Galili ya distrik Samaria yebrara ede suna ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ye ede suna pidre, yugu togl yeimara ede suna ogo, yagl 10-pela kide leprosi paugwa i, eglke iro mogl, Jisas kandre, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ye ka podo di te, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade Jisas yo, ene no mitno goglo digwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yegl digo, Jisas yagl 10-pela i kandre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene pi tawa teigwa yoba meglmara pidre, ogono nagino obuno di teo dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye ede eigo, ye konbauna eimara i, ogono nagino tabre u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />U wakai ogo, yagl swara ta ogona nagna u wakai omedi kandre, God kagie kade tenagledi ka podo didre, ede Jisas moglmara ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ye u Jisas kagle mina yage kobragai padre, ye di wakai yei togwa. Te, yagl i, Samaria yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Ana Jisas yagl i kandre, yegl dugwa, Na prika i, yagl 10-pela ogono nagino u wakai omedi prika. Yagl 9-pela meglkwa i, tau ede aglo eime? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Juda yoba moglkrukwa i keme ede ikne udre, God di wakai yei togwa i, kuno erekrumedi prie dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Jisas yagl i yegl di togwa, Ene adigl, ede po. Ene na pre mediglnga pre ene ogon nagn erme u wakai omiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede ikne unabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matyu 24.23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">24.37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Ana Farisi yoba tau Jisas di pre, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, aunake plau dinabe? digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, ene taragl tau kandre, ege i umiwedi praiglkwa i ta paikrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Te, yoba ta ere mogl, God yoba kingno moglmara i, magigl i plau dumiwe didre, eglke iro plau dumiwe ta dikraiglkwa. I siragl pre God yoba kingno morabuka igne i ene meglmara kwande u kodugwa mere yegl pame di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, na egena plau dinan, ene na kaima kanamnedi praiglkwa ba ene na kaima ta kankraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ege i, yoba tau ene yegl di tenaiglkwa, Ene kanio! Ye magigl i moglmiwe didre, Ye eglke iro moglmiwe dinaiglkwa. Ba ye yegl dinaiglkwa i, ene ye duglo boglkre, pi kankraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />I siragl pre na egena unan, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ede ikne unaglka igne, na nogugl wibo, yoba kanaiglmiwa. Kamun tai dumo swara keme sugo, kamun kua mudu abuglage sumere mere na wibo, yoba mudu kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ba komono kana na giugl tau mere inaglka paugwa. Yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i, mokono naraiglkwa pai moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam unaglka i, Noa egemo yomere yegl panabuka. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Noa egemo yoba kaya mokna podo nedre, gun yei, abu idre, abroma yagl tedre, ere meglkwa. Ye pra munedi ere meglko, Noa ede sip yugugl ogo, nigl kamun podo sidre, ye mudu si goglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Te, Lot egemo kuno yegl yogwa. Yoba kaya mokna nedre, gun yei, taragl tau topo sidre, taragl tau topo boglsre, kaya mokna ere yagl, yugu akie keigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ye pra munedi ere meglko, Lot dumo Sodom kide kodo ede ogo, doga ya kobuglo tau de bauglo ere paugwa i, kamun mitna yage sidre, yoba mudu i si goglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Na Yoba Wam ede nogugl unaglka igne i ama kuno yegl mere panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Jisas ama yegl dugwa, Ege i plau dinan, yoba ta yugu indaule moran, ye taraglmo ta yugugl yenabuka i, inagledi ede yugugl pikre, teke ede enabuka paugwa. Te, yoba ta kaya mokna ere yaglmara kogon ere morabuka i, ye taraglmo pre kan ikne edekrabuka paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Lot ebie kan ikne edugo, siragl taragl ye moglmara plau dugwa i, ene pre meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Yoba ta makandigle mogl kor moragledi eran, ye gorabuka. Ba yoba ta Na goraglka i, taragl kebra yomedi pran, ye kaima kor morabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ege i, eduer plau dinan, bogl swara mina yoba suo pai miur, na swara ta auro i ede ebo, ta pai morabuka. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35-36" />Te, abu suo wit mogo akie si deduagle ere miur, na swara ta auro i ede ebo, ta yoko morabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35-36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yoba prisre, ye di pre, yegl digwa, Taragl yegl mere plau dinabe dinga i, aglo mere plau dinabe? digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Yoba ta goran, ye ogo nagie aglo mere ta yenabara i, kua kigla u dumo i makai sidre, i nogugl edenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Abu ta jas moglmara pidre, ege mere ka dugwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, yoba oglka erekrisre, ege ege kamage eramga pamedi praiglkwa pre ka ebrie ta dugwa, <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Dumo swara ta jas ta moglkwa. Jas i, ye God kuduglmo goglkre, yoba pere ama pre i mitna edekrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ana dumo swara i, abu werai ta ama moglkwa. Abu werai i, ege mere jas i moglmara pidre, ye yegl di togwa, Na kudana ikne ta moglkwa i, na ere kide ere naragledi erumiwa. Ene na kotna prisre, ake ple di naratnedi priwe di, yegl di moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Abu i yegl di moglkwa ba jas i, ye ake ple di tenagledi prikrukwa. Ake ple di tenagledi prikrukwa ba okuo ye ta prukwa i, Na God kuduglmo goglkre, yoba pere we di prikre, erika <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ba abu werai i, ye nigade u didre, yubun narukwa pre ye ake ple di tenagliwa. Ta manan, ye ege ege u pai moran, na oglka eraglka pamiwe di, yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Yagl Kade ama yegl dugwa, Jas kide ka dumara nomane io. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ye abu kamo pre mogl, mogl, okuo ake ple di togwa pre God kere yugwa yoba ta etne eduer God agle di pre meglkwa i, God mabuno du ersre, tabre ake ple dinabo mo dikrabe? Mo, kanige ere pai morabedi primo? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Na ene kaima di teiga, ye tabre mabuno du ersre, yobama ake ple di tenabuka. Ba na Yoba Wam ede ikne unaglka igne i yoba mere na pre medigl meglbi, na u kanaglo mo kankragle? di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisi yagl ya taks yugwa yagl kamage eribrere Jisas ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Pharisee and tax collector in the temple" file="FM 164 Pharisee and Tax Collector in the Temple_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="18.9" />Ana yoba tau ye yene mabuno erimara yoba du munedi pre, yoba tau mudu kide meglmedi prikwa i, Jisas ere mogl, ka ebrie ta yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Aglke ta yagl suo ere mogl, God kamage ere tenabugledi ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara ebre dugwa. Ta Farisi yoba moglko, ta taks yugwa yagle moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ana ye ede suna ebriko, Farisi yoba i nomane mina kamage yegl erukwa, God yo, na yoba kide meglmere yegl ta moglkrika pre na ene di wakai yei teiwa. Yoba tau yoba pere bakagl tedre, mabuno kide bogl, abu kunogl nedre, erimere yegl na ta erekrika. Te, taks yugwa yagle magigl moglkwa i moglmere ama moglkrika pre diwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Na wakan swara swarade ege suo mina kaya mokna mawagl ersre, taragl mudu iga i br 10-pela boglsre, ene swara ta teiwe di, Farisi yoba yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Yegl dugwa ba taks yugwa yagle i we, ye kuri ta mogl eglke ido edidre, Na kan heven ibo edenaglka i, kuno ta erekrumedi kan atne edidre, na yoba kide moledi prukwa i, i nogugl edenagledi yene pirie wagle sidre, yegl dugwa, God yo, na tadaglme yoba moliwa. Ene na mitna goglo! di, yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Na ene di teiga, God taks yugwa yagle i yagl du moglmedi kanugo, ye ede ikne yugomugl ogwa. Ba Farisi yagl i, God ye yagl du moglmedi kankrukwa. I siragl pre yoba ta yene pre i mitna edenabuka i, God ye i atne edenabuka. Ba yoba ta yene pre i atne edenabuka i, God ye i mitna edenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas gak kebra na moglmara unaiglmedi kanige erio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matyu 19.13-15</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mak 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Ana yoba tau gak kebra ya gak kuglabu pra, Jisas akenabedi auro yuigwa. Auro yuigo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kandre, mane di, ka teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ba Jisas ye gak wio di tedre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Gak kebra na moglmara unaiglkwa i, ene mane dikre, kanige erio. I siragl pre yoba ta gak meglmere yegl ta moraiglkwa i, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabara yoba i pre yenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga. Yoba ta ye gak kebra meglmere yegl ta moglsre, God na kingna mogl, na suglna morabedi prabuka i keme God yoba suglno morabara ede suna enabuka. Ba yoba nomane yegl ta paikrabuka i, ye suna ta pikrabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl mige moni mere kan nogwa ta Jisas bogl ka dibrika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matyu 19.16-30</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mak 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ana yagl kade ta Jisas moglmara udre, yegl dugwa, Tisa, yagl wakai, na mabuno siragl mere ersre, aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa ikra kaima inagle? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yegl di prukwa, Ene siragl pre na yagl wakai we dine? Yoba wakai ta moglkrikwa ba God swara wakai moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ana God lomo siragl mere paugwa i, enene pitnga, Ene yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekre, yoba ta si goglkre, taragl ta kunogl nekre, kot mina ka kibi dikre, nen ya man pre i mitna edidre, kano prio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.12-16, Lo 5.16-20</char></note> di, God lomo yegl dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na gak mogl ede u erme wiga i pra, lo mudu i, na duglo boluwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yegl dugo, Jisas prisre, yegl dugwa, Ene taragl swara ta erekitnga pai moglkwa i, ene taraglnen mudu i pi topo boglsre, mige i pi goduglme yoba yubu si to. Ene yegl etn, ene heven ibo taragl wakai wakai inatnga. Te, ene yegl ersre, u na duglo boglo di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i prisre, kide pre, ede ogwa. I siragl pre ye taragl mere kaima kan nogwa yagl ta moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Ana yagl i kide prisre, ede ogo, Jisas kandre, yegl dugwa, Yoba taragl podo ere neigwa i, ye God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara ede suna enaiglkwa i, waragne paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Bugla kamel ta kar nil kwie yomara ede suna enabuka i, yuaglke paugwa ba yoba ta taragl podo kan neigwa i, God yoba kingno moglmara ede suna enaiglkwa i, waragne kaima pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Yegl dugo, yoba pre meglkwa i, yegl digwa, Yegl eran, God yoba ira ere inan, kuno erabe? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba taragl tau eribi, kuno erekrabuka i, God erabuka keme pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Pita ye yegl di prukwa, Kano. No taraglno mudu kide kodidre, ene duglo buniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba yegl di togwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, yoba swara ta God yoba kingno morabuka ka i di tenagledi ye yugumo toglmo kide kodinabuka mo ye ebie nagiglema kide kodinabuka mo ye agiglema mo nem mam kide kodinabuka i, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ye erme magigl i taragl mere kide kaima ikne edidre, ege okuo ta unabuka i, aimadi kamin wakai kaima morabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor enabuka pre aglke kor dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matyu 20.17-19</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mak 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela di i bina edidre, yegl di togwa, Ene kanio. Nono ede ido Jerusalem enauniwa. Omun, God kamo kep yoba taragl kane kane na Yoba Wam moglmara plau dinabedi ka beglkwa i, kaima plau dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Yoba na i pi yugobuno pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i ogono mina yebi, ye na agai goratnedi ersre, na ere kide ere nare, eur si naraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Ye yegl ersre, ama na duglnai sidre, na si goraiglkwa paugwa. Si geglbi, na ege suota mogl, adigl u kor enaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Jisas yegl dugwa ba ye ka dugwa i, ye duglo beglkwa yagl kaima pre pogl sikrikwa. Ka i ye meglmara teke paugwa mere yegl paugwa pre ye pre pogl sinaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl gumuglo kin yogwa ta Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matyu 20.29-34</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mak 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Ana Jisas konbauna wan ede pi dumo Jeriko yomara ede magigl ogo, yagl gumuglo kin yogwa ta konbo bina ame di mogl, ogo kugl, mige pre yana di moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ana yagl i ame di moglsre, yoba tau mere konbauna wo pi dimiwedi prisre, siragl taragl plau dugwa i pragledi kira pogl prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Kira pogl pruko, yoba tau wigwa i ye di ikne ede te, Jisas, dumo Nasaret nem ikra, umiwe digo, prukwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ye Jisas umedi prisre, ka podo di, yegl dugwa, Jisas yo, Devit Gawamo motnga i, na mitna goglo dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Yagl i yegl dugo, yoba tau Jisas unabara ede okna wigwa i ye ka tedre, Ka kodo! digwa. Yegl digwa ba ye kano prikre, ka podo kaima di, Devit Gawamo motnga i, na mitna goglo! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Ana Jisas u adigl moglsre, yoba tau yagl i auro yu wio dugo, ye auro yuigwa. Auro yuigo, ye ede magigl ugwa igne, Jisas ye di pre, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />Ene siragl ere tenaglka pre dine? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, Yagl Kade yo, na aglke kor kanagledi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Kanatniwa. Ene na pre mediglnara i pre ene gumugln u wakai omiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i gumuglo tabre kaima u wakai ogo, ye aglke kor kandre, Jisas omara duglo bogl, God kagie kade te moglkwa. Te, yoba kan meglkwa i mudu ama God kagie kade teigwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ede Sakius kipamara ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Zacchaeus" file="CN01776B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="19.1" />Ana Jisas ede Jeriko suna pidre, konbo wan ede pi taun meda enabara ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Ye ede ogo, yagl swara ta konbo bage moglkwa, kagie Sakius we digwa. Yagl i, ye taks igwa yoba bitno ta moglsre, mige moni podo ere nogwa yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ana Jisas konbo wan ede ogo, Sakius ye Jisas siragl mere moglkwa i kanagledi eruko, manugwa. I siragl pre yoba mere kide mogl kegl digo, Sakius ama yagl sugunagle ta moglkwa pre ye Jisas kankrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Yegl pre Jisas okuo unabedi ye muku di ede okna pidre, ede fik ta mogo ede mitna pidre, Jisas unan, kanagledi sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Sugl moglko, Jisas ede magigl udre, kan mitna ede Sakius kandre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Sakius yo, ene tabre ede atne wo. Siragl pre na erme ene kipanara moraglka pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Yegl dugo, Sakius tabre ede atne udre, gun yei, Jisas auro i pi ye kipamara ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ana Jisas Sakius kipamara ede yugugl ogo, yoba mudu kandre, ka kane kane di, yegl digwa, Ye tadaglme yagl ta kipamara moragledi ede yugugl ogwa i, kuno ta erekrumiwe digwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ana Jisas ye Sakius kana moglko, Sakius adiglsre, Yagl Kade yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene kano, na taragl ta kan neiga i, ikne i pi goduglme yoba tenaglka. Te, na yoba tau bakagl tedre, migeno iga i, na mige swara ta imara, mige 4-pela te ikne edinaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Sakius yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Abraham okna pre meduglmere yegl, ene ama pre mediglnga pre God erme ene ebin gagiglnma bogl ere yugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, na yoba ta wau beglkwa i doko kandre, ere inagledi wiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kogon yagl 10-pela mige imere ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matyu 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Ana yoba Jisas kamo prikwa meglkwa i, ye yegl di prikwa, Jisas ede Jerusalem magigl ugwa pre God yoba kingno morabuka igne i magigl kaima erumedi prikwa pre <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Jisas ka ebrie ta yegl dugwa, Yoba dumo eglke ta moglsre, yagl kade ta di te, Ene dumonen kide kodo ede un, no ene King moratnedi edumun, King moglsre, aglke ede ikne yugunmugl pidre, yobanen sugl moratniwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ana ye ede enagledi ere, ye nigl kogonmo yoba 10-pela agle dugo, wigwa. Wigo, ye swara swarade mige gol podo ta tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene mige i idre, na bisnis ere nare meglbi, na ikne unaluwe didre, ede ome dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ye ede ogo, yene yugomugl i, ye kide kanigwa pre yoba ta dedidre, yagl i no kingno moglkrabedi prumniwe dio digo, ye ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Ye okuo eigwa ba yagl kade i kwade king mogl kodo, ede ikne yugomugl ugwa. Ye ede ikne udre, nigl kogon yoba 10-pela mige teiga i, ikra wio dugwa. Ye udre, bisnis siragl mere erikwa i dibi, pragledi wio dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ana nigl kogon yoba swara ta komono kana udre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene mige swara ta natnga i mina na kogon ersre, mige 10-pela mere kia i tebe ede padigl, i wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Yegl dugo, yagl kade i ye yegl di togwa, Ene nigl kogon yoba wakai moglsre, wakai etniwe dugwa. Na taragl kebra ta ene teigo, ene sugl wakai motnga pre erme ene taun 10-pela sugl moratniwe di, yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Ana nigl kogon yoba namba 2 udre, yegl dugwa, Ene mige ta natnga i mina na mige 5-pela mere kia i tebe ede padigl, i wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Yegl dugo, yagl kade i ye yegl di togwa, Ene ama taun 5-pela sugl moratniwe di, yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Ana nigl kogon yoba suo udre, ede ebriko, ta okuo udre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene mige ta natnga ikra, na lap mina were teke yeiga, yoma kano. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />I siragl pre na ene kudugln goglka. Ene yagl gigledi moglsre, yoba taraglno kwi idre, yoba pere toglno mina ene kaya mokna ama singa pre na kudugl gogl, migenen i kogon ta erekre, teke yeiwe di, yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Nigl kogon yagl i yegl dugo, yagl kade di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene nigl kogon yoba kide motniwe dugwa. Enene ka dinara i mina na prisre, ene yubu sinaglka. Ene pitnga i, na yagl gigledi ta moglsre, yoba pere taragl tau yeigwa i, na idre, yoba pere kaya mokna ere yaiglkwa i, na si yumedi pitnga paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Na yegl moglmedi pitna, ene na migena i pi beng edingo. Ene yegl etna, na migena kia bogl igo we dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Yegl didre, yoba tau magigl adigl meglkwa i yegl di togwa, Yagl i mige swara ta ake moglkwa i, ene idre, yagl ta 10-pela yugwa i teo dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Yegl dugo, yoba i di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ba yagl i, mige 10-pela i kodugwa pre i kuno ta erekrumiwe di, yegl dime dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Ana yoba i yegl digo, yagl kade i yegl dugwa, Na ene di teiga, yoba taragl tau mere kan nogwa i, na taragl tau ama i tebe ede tenaglka. Ba yoba taragl tau mere kan nekrukwa i, ye taragl kebra ta ake morabuka i ama ake i eglke edenaglka. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ba yoba tau na kudana ikne moglsre, na ye kingno mogl dinabedi prikwa i, auro yudre, na gumuglnamugl magigl i ye si golo di, yagl kade i yegl dumedi, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, konbauna ta ede egli Jerusalem ogwa i, aglke kor duglo bogl ede ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas king mere yegl mogl, ede Jerusalem suna ugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matyu 21.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mak 11.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede taun Betfage ya Betani muglo Oliv ibo yebrara ede magigl wigo, Jisas ye duglo biurka yoba suo dedidre, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" /><figure style="fig" alt="Donkey tied to doorpost" file="hk00033b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="19.30" />ye yegl di togwa, Ene dumo ta yomara iro suna pidre, donki ta kane kogl padiglbi, kanabrika. Donki i, yoba ege swara ta au sikrikwa. Ene donki i kandre, kane poko ede, yunabrika. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Te, yoba ta ene di pre, ene siragl pre donki i kane poko edibre? dibi, ene yegl diro, Yagl Kade kogonmo ta paugwa pre yuiro dume di, ene yegl diro dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo biurka yagl suo ede ebriko, Jisas dumere mere plau dugo, kanibrika. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ye donki kandre, kane poko ede miurko, donki nem yagl meglkwa i ye di pre, Ene siragl pre donki nagigle i kane poko edibre? digo, <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Ye di ikne ede, Donki kogonmo ta paugwa pre Yagl Kade yuiro dumiwe dibrika.<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ana yagl suo i, ye donki yu Jisas moglmara edidre, ir gaglno gugl, donki moko bolamugl kuglsre, Jisas donki au sinabedi ake ple di tebrika. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ake ple di tebriko, Jisas donki au sidre ede ogo, yoba tau mere ama ir gaglno guglsre, konbauna enabara kugl yeigwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Ana Jisas muglo Oliv konbauna ta yei ede atne umara i, ugo, ye duglo beglkwa yoba mere kide ye ede atne ugwa i, kandre, kimagl erukwa i, poglo di prisre, ka podo di, aglage kaglkane ere, God kagie kade teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Ye yegl digwa, King i Yagl Kade dedugo, ugwa pre God ye ere wakai ere tenabuka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.26</char></note> Te, God, mogl mitna kaima edugwa i, nono kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Ye ama deno muduno wida di norumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Ana yoba mere meglmara suna i, Farisi yoba tau moglsre, Jisas yegl di teigwa, Tisa yo, ene duglo beglkwa yoba i, ka yegl di dinaiglmedi ka to! digwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene di teiga, yoba i drano si kegl dibi, kobuglo magigl paigwa i drano a di, agle didre, God kagie kade tenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Jerusalem pre kai erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ana Jisas ede dumo Jerusalem magigl udre, ye dumo i kaimo erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Ye kai ersre, yegl dugwa, Kamun erme tagugwa i, ene siragl mere deno muduno wida di inaiglkwa i ta prima, wakai kaima paugo. Ba konbauna i erme teke paugwa, ene ta kankraiglkwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43-44" />God ene ake ple dinagledi erme ugwa i, ene ta kankrikwa pre okuo ene yubun inaiglkwa. Ene kudano ikne bage bage mogl udre, ene tauno yomara mogl winabo di, kobuglo togl yomara ede kuglo enamnedi makan gaba si yu edenaiglkwa. Makan si yu edidre, taun si atne ede, yoba suna moraiglkwa i ere kide ere tedre, kobuglo swara ta kobuglo pere ta yenabara tebe yenabedi kanige erekraiglkwa. Ye mudu si deduagle ere kodinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:43-44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba taragl tau topo beglkwa i, Jisas si meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matyu 21.12-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mak 11.15-19</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Temple mount" file="lb00250b.tif" size="span" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="19.45" />Ana Jisas ye ede Jerusalem suna udre, tawa teigwa yugu yomara ede togl suna ogwa. Ye togl suna pidre, yoba taragl tau i pi topo bogl meglkwa i, si meda edidre, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />ye yegl di togwa, God kamo mina dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Na yuguna i, yoba kamage eraiglkwa dumo ta yenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 56.7</char></note> dugwa. Ba ene dumo i, ere i kunogl gogl yoba teke paigwa dumo mere yegl edimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 7.11</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Ana Jisas ege swara swarade tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, yoba ka beke te moglkwa. Ka beke te moglko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i yeigo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba i yeigo, ye Juda yoba yobano kade bogl Jisas si goramnedi konbauna dokigwa <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ba ye konbauna ta kankrikwa. I siragl pre yoba yoko meglkwa i, ye mudu Jisas kamo prisre, wakai prikwa pre yoba kade kanigwa i, no Jisas ta si gun, yoba kide praiglkwa mere yegl pamedi kanigwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ira kagn kade tomedi yoba kade wagle Jisas kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matyu 21.23-27</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mak 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ana ege swara ta Jisas tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna moglsre, ye kamo wakai i, yoba beke te moglko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya te, Juda yoba yobano kade pra, ye moglmara udre, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />kira pogl pre, yegl digwa, Ira ene dedugo, taragl yegl etne? Te, ira taragl yegl ero dugwa i, no di noro! digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ama ka kira ta poglbo, ene di ikne ede naraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Jon yoba nigl bugl togwa i, God dedugo, erumo mo yoba dedigo, erume? Na di nario dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Jisas yegl dugo, yoba kade wagle yene meglmara di ikne ikne ede, ka di pre, yegl digwa, Nono di ikne, God ye Jon dedume dumun, yagl i ere mogl, Ene siragl eruko, ye kamo pre mediglkrime? di norabuka. <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ba nono di ikne ede, Makadigle yoba nomano idre, erume dumun, yoba magigl meglkwa i Jon ka kep yoba kaima ta moglmedi prikwa pre kobuglo idre, no si goraiglmiwe di, yene yegl digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Yegl paugwa pre Jisas di ikne ede te, No ta pre kan erekrumniwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Yegl eran we, ira kagna kade naruko, kogon yegl erika i, ene ta ama di tebo, prikraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba kide ede wain sugl moglsre, mabuno kide beglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matyu 21.33-46</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mak 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Vineyard" file="LB00103b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="20.9">Gaden wain yogwa</figure>Ana Jisas yegl didre, yoba magigl meglkwa i ka ebrie swara ta dugwa, Yagl ta ede wain podo ere yaglkwa. Ere yaglsre, ede meda pi kanana wan moraglka pamedi yoba sugl mogl, ere nedre, kia ikne ye ere nedre, ikne na naraiglmedi sugl molo didre, ede dumo bage ta ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Pi mogl prukwa i, erme wain mogo bogl yenabuka egemo yomedi prisre, ye nigl kogonmo yagl ta komono kana dedugwa. Dedidre, Ene ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba meglmara en, ye mige kia ta tebi, idre, ede ikne unatniwe didre, dedugwa. Dedugo, ogwa i, ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i, ye ere sidre, siragl ta tekre, yoko dedigo, ede ikne ugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Ede ikne ugo, wain nem yagl aglke kor nigl kogonmo yoba ta dedugo, ede ogwa. Ba ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i erimere ere, nigl kogon yoba i ama ere sidre, agai gorabedi ere, wain mogo kia ta tekrikwa ba yoko ede ikne ugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Yegl mere ugo, wain nem yagl i aglke kor nigl kogon yoba namba 3 dedugo, ye ede ogwa i, ye ama podo kaima ere sidre, si meda edigwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yegl erikwa pre ede wain nem yagl i, kina gudu mogl, kaima siragl mere eragledi prukwa. Prisre, nomane ta idre, Na pra wana dena mudna suna moglkwa i, dedibo, enan we, ye kandre, kamo praiglmiwe di prisre, ye wam dedugo, ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ba wain sugl meglkwa yoba ye kandre, yene di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Wain nem yagl ikra wam ugwa pre siragl mudu sugl kan munga i, ye mudu inabuka umiwe digwa. Yegl pre ye si gun we, nono taragl mudu kan munga i, no nono pre yenabiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Yegl didre, wain nem yagle wam ugwa i, si meda edidre, si geglme dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ana ede wain nem yagl yoba kade moglkwa i, ye erimara i siragl ere tenabedi prime? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ye ede ikne udre, ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i mudu si gogl, ye makanmo i, yoba pere ogono wagle yenabiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl dugo, yoba prisre, yegl digwa, Kodo, taragl yegl ta plau dikro do! digwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ana yoba ka gigledi yegl digo, Jisas ye kan gigle gogl moglsre, yegl dugwa, Ene ka yegl dimiba God kamo siragl pre bogl padiglkwa pamedi prime? God kamo ta yegl beglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">Kobuglo yugu keigwa yoba i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ye kobuglo gade imara i kobuglo swara ta kide yomedi kandre, kide kodigwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">Ba God yugu ta kenagledi kobuglo swara ta kide kodigwa i, idre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">Yugu kei ede mitna enabara i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">Mabunomugl mabuno bogl paduglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.22</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:17">di, yegl beglme dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Yoba ta kobuglo i mina yage sinan, ye bogl bagla dinabuka. Te, kobuglo i yage si, yoba ta sinan, yoba i si deduwagle ere kodinabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye Jisas ka ebrie dugwa i, no di boglmedi prisre, ye ege i, Jisas si kane sinamnedi prikwa ba ye yoba kuduglno goglsre, si kane sikrikwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taks tenamno mo tekramnedi yoba Jisas kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matyu 22.15-22</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mak 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ana Juda yoba kade meglkwa i, ye Jisas aglau ta eran, kanamnedi sugl kan moglsre, ama yoba tau teke konbo mina Jisas nodo ere kanaiglmedi dedigwa. Yoba i, ka kibi kogl u Jisas kamo kaima wakai prikwa dagl erikwa ba kan moraiglmara Jisas ka dinabara aglau eran, ye i pi gavana moglmara kot ere tenamnedi prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Ana yoba i Jisas yegl kira pogl prikwa, Tisa yo, no prumga i, ene ka du keme didre, yoba beke tenga. Ene yoba kade meglkwa mo yoko meglkwa i kerekre, God konbaunamo kuno keme yoba beke tenga. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Yegl pre ene siragl we di pitne? Nono mige taks Rom king tenamga kuno erumo mo tekramne? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas ye bakagl narimedi kan pogl sidre, ye yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />Ene mige silva ta naribi, kanaluwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye mige silva ta yu teigo, Jisas mige i kandre, yegl dugwa, Ira kwiamo ya kagie mige i mina pame? dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede, Rom king kwiamo ya kagie pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Yegl eran we, taragl ta Rom king pre yenabuka i, Rom king teo. Te, taragl ta God pre yenabuka i, God teo! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ana ka yegl dugwa igne, yoba mudu gumuglnomugl ye bakagl tenamnedi erikwa i, manugo, ye nagino podo kogl, drano si kegl digwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadyusi yoba Jisas di pre, yoba geglkwa adigl u kor enaiglmo mo ta pikraiglme digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matyu 22.23-33</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mak 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ana okuo, Sadyusi yoba tau Jisas moglmara wigwa. Sadyusi yoba digwa i, yoba ta goglsre, adigl u kor ta pikraiglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Ka yegl didre, tau Jisas moglmara u ka yegl digwa, Tisa yo, Moses ka ta bogl norumara i, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta abu inabuka ba gak kuglkre, goran, ye agigle ta morabuka i, abu werai i inan, gak kurabrika i, nem goglkwa agaimo idre, makanmo inabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Moses ka bogl norumara i mina ka kira ta poramga. Aglke ta agigle agigle 7-pela meglkwa. Ta komono moglkwa i, abu ta yugwa ba ye gak kuglkre, goglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Te, agigle namba 2 moglkwa i, ama yegl eruko, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />agigle namba 3 ede pi namba 7 i, mudu abu werai i idre, gak kuglkre, geglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ana okuo kaima abu i ama goglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Agigle agigle 7-pela i, mudu abu swara i igwa pre yoba adigl u kor enaiglkwa igne, abu i, ira ebie morabuka i di noro! digwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Ana Sadyusi yoba yegl digo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Makadigle yoba ka kaima yagl abu bogl inaiglkwa meglkwa <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />ba ege okuo ibo yegl ta paikrabuka. Yoba geglkwa adigl u kor pi God yoba suglno morabara moraiglkwa kuno erikwa meglkwa i, ye ta bogl ikraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ye igne i, angelo meglmere mere kuno moglsre, aglke kor dagl ta goglkraiglkwa. God ye adigl u kor enaiglmedi eruko, erme ye God gagiglma kaima mogl kodigwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Ba yoba geglkwa ka kaima adigl u kor enaiglkwa paugwa i, Moses kaima i nogugl ede kodugwa. Okna ibo God ede kebra ta de bauglo erumara u suna moglsre, yegl dugwa, Na yagl Abraham, ya Aisak, ya Jekop Godno mogl pai moluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 3.6</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />God ye yoba gogl kodigwa i, Godno moglkwa pre ta dikrukwa ba yoba kor mogl pai meglkwa i, Godno moglkwa pre dugwa. I siragl pre yoba mudu God gumuglo mina kor yoko meglmedi kanugwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba tau prisre, ka yegl digwa, Tisa yo, ene ka wakai kaima diniwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Te, mokomugl i, yoba tau ye Jisas kira pogl praiglkwa i, kudugl geglkwa pre ka ta dikrikwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Kere Yugwa Yagle, ye Devit gawamo yoko ta moglkrabuka ba God Wam ama morabuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matyu 22.41-46</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mak 12.35-37</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Giglage 110.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Ana Jisas yoba kira pogl yegl dugwa, Siragl pre yoba God Kere Yugwa yagl unabuka i, Devit gawamo ta morabe dime? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Devit yene buk Giglage mina God Kere Yugwa Yagl pre didre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Neno Kade ere mogl, na Yaglna Kade yegl di togwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Ene ogona wo kra ame di moglo,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Na ene kudanen ikne yobuglo ere tedre, kagln mina atne edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gigagle 110.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:43">di, Neno Kade ka yegl di, na Yaglna Kade di tome dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Devit yene God Kere Yugwa yagl i pre na Yaglna Kade we dugwa ba yoba tau Devit gawamo morabe digwa i we, siragl pre ka yegl dime? Na di nario di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">God lomo beke teigwa yoba pre kan kun erio!</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matyu 23.1-36</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mak 12.38-40</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Luk 11.37-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ana yoba mudu ye Jisas kamo pre meglko, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba yegl di togwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />God lomo beke teigwa yoba i, ene bakagl te dinaiglmiwa. God lomo beke teigwa yoba meglkwa i, ye gagl suna olto, wakai yogwa i edinamnedi prisre, ye maket wanigwa igne yoba ye wakai we di teigwa i, gun podo yeigwa. Te, ka mabuno yugu yugugl eigwa igne mo yoba kaya mokna podo gaiglkwa igne, ye sia wakai, gumamugl iro ame dinamnedi prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Ba ye abu werai meglmara bakagl te, yuguno toglno kunogl idre, ama yoba wakai muniwedi kamage olto kuri kaima erikwa. Yegl pre God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, ye ka podo kaima inaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Abu werai ta mige gogl suo God togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mak 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Widow's offering" file="cn01794B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="21.1" />Ana Jisas tawa teigwa yugu mige boks yomara i moglsre, yoba mige podo kan neigwa i, mige ofa tenamnedi mige i pi boks mina atne edigo, kan moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Kan mogl, abu werai ta goduglme moglkwa i ama mige mogo gogl suo ta i pi atne edugo, kanugwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Kandre, yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, abu werai ta goduglme moglkwa i, mige podo togo, ye mudu mige kebra teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />I siragl pre ye mudu migeno podo kawa tomara i mina ofa teigwa ba abu werai i, mige ta kan nomere mudu togwa. Ye migemo tau yoko yenan, ye ere nenabuka i ta yeikrume, dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba tawa teigwa yugu ere kide eraiglkwa i pre Jisas dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matyu 24.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mak 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba tau tawa teigwa yugu i kan moglsre, yegl digwa, Yugu i kobuglo wakai wakai idre, keigo, taragl wakai kane kane yoba yu ofa teigwa i idre, yugu i, ekin wakai gagl teimiwe digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />Ene yugu magigl kan digwa i, ege okuo ta plau dinan, yoba udre, yugu i si gurdi atne edibi, kobuglo swara ta kobuglo ta yenabara tebe ta yeikrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yubun podo podo okuo plau dinaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matyu 24.3-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mak 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba tau Jisas yegl di prikwa, Tisa yo, taragl yegl mere plau dinabuka i, aunake plau dinabe? Te, no siragl taragl kandre, taragl i plau dinabuka i, magigl erumedi pramne? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ene bakagl te dinaiglmedi kan kun erio. I siragl pre yoba tau mere na kagna mina udre, Na Krais moliwe didre, Taragl mudu dudunabuka igne i ede magigl u kodumiwe dinaiglkwa. Ye yegl dinaiglkwa ba ene ye duglo boglkrio. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Te, kuda kane kane, kebra ya kade plau dume dibi, ene prisre, kudugl goglkrio. I siragl pre taragl i mudu plau dinaiglkwa paugwa ba taragl pra pra dudunabuka ege i, okuo kaima unabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Kantri ikne ikne kuda beglbi, te, king ikne ikne ama kuda boraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Imem podo podo unan, bage tau kidan podo kaima panaiglkwa. Paibi, bage tau yoba kide sinan, mere geglbi, diu ama tau kamun mitna ibo plau dibi, yoba kandre, kudugl podo goraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ana taragl mudu i, plau dinaiglkwa ba komono kana yoba ene si ake gi di mogl, ere kide ere tedre, ka mabuno yuguno yenabara i kot ere tedre, si i pi kane yugu edenaiglkwa. Te, ene na duglo beglkwa pre ye ene gudu i pi king ya gavana moraiglmara edenaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Edibi, na kana yoba kade wagle i di tenaiglkwa egemo yenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Yenan, ene ka siragl mere di ikne edenaiglkwa i, ere wakai eramga i ta paikrumedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />I siragl pre ege i, nana ene ka siragl mere dinaiglkwa i di tebo, ene kano mem wakai panan, ene kudano ikne ta moraiglkwa i, ene kano si atne edenaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Enene neno mano ya agroma ene i pi kudano ikne ogono mina yebi, kabagleno ya yoba bormai swara meglkwa ama yegl eraiglkwa. Te, ene meglmara suna tau si goraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Te, ene na duglo beglkwa pre yoba mudu ene kide kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ba yoba i, ene kiano mina ere kide ere tebi, kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ene yubun idre, adigl gigledi meglbi, ene kiano mina wakai kaima moraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba dumo Jerusalem ere kide ere tenaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matyu 24.15-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mak 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ana ami u Jerusalem mogl winabo dinaiglkwa igne, ene Jerusalem ere kide ere tenaiglkwa ege ede magigl u kodumedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ana igne i yoba ta distrik Judia suna moraiglkwa i, ye teke ede muglo meglbi paimara ebi, yoba ta taun Jerusalem suna moraiglkwa i, teke ede meda ebi, yoba taun meda moraiglkwa i, ama ede suna ukraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />I siragl pre ege i, God dem kubrukwa ege yenan, God kamo mina siragl kane kane ta plau dinabedi beglkwa ikra, ege i plau dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Igne i, abu ta dano panabuka mo gak kebra am te moraiglkwa i, mitno erabuka. I siragl pre ege i, yubun podo kide makandigle plau dinan, ege i God Israel yoba dem kubro togwa i, i nogugl ede tenabuka. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Israel yoba kudano ikne udre, ye tau mere bainet mina si gogl, tau mere ama si kane si i pi kantri bage bage edenaiglkwa. Yoba yugobuno pere Israel yoba moglkrikwa i, dumo Jerusalem egre i atne edidre, sugl mogl ebi, God ye yugobuno pere dumo Israel sugl moraiglmedi ege paduglkwa i dudinan, pra, okuo ta sugl moglkraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba Wam ede ikne unabuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matyu 24.29-31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mak 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ade ba ya kugl kuri mina diu podo plau dinan, mudi nigl ama podo kaima si pepigl didre, mu podo dinan, yoba yugobuno pere pere moraiglkwa i nomane sidre, kudugl podo goraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Te, ege i, taragl podo podo kamun mitna ibo paigwa i, gua gua wanibi, yoba dumo makan dudinabedi kandre, kudugl goglsre, gumuglno magran, yage sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Ana igne i na Yoba Wam moglka i, kamun kua mitna ibo udre, na yobuglna ya abuglagena podo paugwa i nogugl edibo, kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Taragl yegl mere plau dinagledi erabuka igne, ene adigl gigledi mogl, kan mitna ede, sugl kan molo. I siragl pre God ene ikne edenabuka ege ede magigl u kodumedi praiglme di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ede fik kandre, nomane inaiglkwa ka padum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matyu 24.32-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mak 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye ka ebrie swara ta yegl di togwa, Ede fik ya ede kane kane ta paigwa i, poglo di prio. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ye yaudo kor sigwa igne, ene kandre, niga dinabuka ege i, ede magigl umedi kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Kuno yegl mere, na taragl tau plau dinaiglme diga i plau dibi, ene kandre, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka igne i ede magigl u kodumedi praiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Yoba erme meglkwa i goglkribi, taragl yegl mere mudu plau di kodinan, okuo goraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan dudunabuka kuno erabuka ba na kana ta dudukre, aimadi kamun pai morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba i, ye Jisas unabedi sugl kan moraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene kan kun erio. I siragl pre ene gua gua ere, spak ersre, erme makandigle siragl mere mogl pai eraiglkwa i pre yubun debi, taragl i ene nomano mina kau sinabuka. Kau sinan, ege i tabre plau dinan, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />dua kabu kigln keglko, simere mere yegl, ene wai kuraiglkwa. I siragl pre ege i, makandigle yoba mudu moraiglmara plau dinabuka. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Yegl pre ene ege ege sugl kan moglsre, God yobuglo bogl norabedi kamage erio. God ene yobuglo bogl tenan, yubun i ene si atne edekran, ene na Yoba Wam gumuglna mina adigl mogl, wakai moraiglme di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Ana Jisas ege swara swarade tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, yoba ka beke te moglkwa ba eduer keme ye Jerusalem kide kodo, muglo Oliv we dimara i ugl paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Te, yoba mudu tagna kide kana adiglsre, Jisas ka dinan, pramnedi muku di ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara eigwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Judas Jisas i pi kuda ikne ogono mina yenagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matyu 26.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">26.14-16</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">14.10-11</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ana bret yis edekre, neigwa ege ikra, ede magigl ugwa. Te, ege kade i, ama God nono kowano awano oglo sugwa ege we digwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Ana ege i, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba i, ye Jisas si goramnedi prikwa ba ye yoba kuduglno goglsre, atne kra si goramendi konbauna dokigwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Ana Judas, kagie ta Iskariot we digwa i, moglmara Satan ede suna ogwa. Yagl Judas i, ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba 12-pela swarano ta moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ana Judas moglmara Satan ede suna ogo, Judas ede pi Juda yoba kade wagle meglmara ogwa. Yoba kade i, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i yeigo, soldia tau tawa teigwa yugu sugl meglkwa i bitno tau yeigo, ye Judas bogl akie ka tau digo, Judas konbo ta yenan, Jisas yu ene ogono mina yenagliwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Yegl dugo, yoba kade wagle i gun yedre, mige silva tau Judas tenamnedi ka di keglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yegl digo, Judas pra we didre, ege wakai ta, yoba tau mere Jisas bogl akie moglkraiglkwa igne, Jisas ye ogono mina yenagledi sugl kan moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ya Jon kaya mokna ere wakai eribrika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matyu 26.17-25</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mak 14.12-21</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Ana Juda yoba bret yis edekre, gagl neigwa ege i, u kodugwa. Ege i, ye sipsip si goglsre, God nono kowano awano oglo sumedi praiglkwa pre kaya mokna nenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Ege i, Jisas ye Pita ya Jon dede, God nono kowano awano oglo sugwa i pre moramnedi kaya mokna nenamga i, ene pi ere wakai eriro dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Yegl dugo, ye, No aglo mere ere wakai erabredi pitne? dibrika. <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ye yegl dibriko, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ede taun kade suna ebr, yagl ta nigl migi kake yunan, ene ye tegigl yedre, ye enabara ene sika si pi yugu ta ede yugugl enabara i, ene ama ede yugugl piro. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Ene ama pidre, yugu nem kandre, yegl di tero, No tisano ene yegl di prukwa, God nono oglo sugwa i, na duglo beglkwa yoba bogl pre moramnedi kaya mokna nenamga i, agai aglo mere mogl nenamne? di, tisano yegl dumiwe diro. <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ene yegl dibr, yugu nem ene agre ede kuglo ibo pidre, agai kade ta tenabuka. Ana kiule i tebol ya ki yei, ere wakai ere kodigwa. Ye dumo i ene obuno di tenan, ene dumo i ere wakai eribr, nono kaya mokna akie nenamniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl suo i ede taun suna pidre, taragl kane kane Jisas plau dinabedi dumere mudu plau dugo, kanibrika. Kandre, God ye Israel yoba oglo sugwa i pre moramnedi kaya moka ere wakai eribrika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba bret ya nigl wain togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matyu 26.26-30</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mak 14.22-26</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Korin 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Last supper" file="CN01803B.TIF" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="22.14" />Ana ye kaya mokna nenaiglkwa ege i, ugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba ame di meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ame di meglko, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, God nono kowano awano oglo sugwa i pre moramnedi kaya mokna erme nenaunga i, na ka kaima akie nenamnedi pre mogl wigo, erme ege ugwa. Te, nono ne kodumun, na giugl praglka paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Nono erme kaya mokna i ne kodumun, na kaya mokna yegl nekre ebo, God yoba kingno morabuka ege i, unabuka. Ege i, kaya mokna i mabunomo nogugl plau dinan, na aglke kor nenaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, kap ta wain nuglo atne moglkwa i idre, God di wakai yei te, ye duglo beglkwa yoba yegl di togwa, Ene kap idre, wain nuglo yubu si neo. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />I siragl pre na ene di teiga, na wain nuglo okuo nekre moglbo, God yoba kingno morabuka ege i, unabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, bret ta ake i mitna ede, God di wakai yei tedre, bret i ake buko dugwa. Ake buko di, ye duglo beglkwa yagl swara swarade nenaiglmedi tedre, yegl dugwa, Bret i, na nagna mere yegl yogwa. Na nagna ene kumapno pre tebo, ene okuo na goraglka i pre moramnedi ama bret yegl buko di neo di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ana kuno yegl mere Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba bogl kaya mokna ne kodigo, Jisas kap ta wain nuglo atne moglkwa idre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba di te, yegl dugwa, Wain nuglo i, na bormaina mere yegl moglmiwa. Na ene kumapno tenagledi bormaina suru ede meda edibo, God ka kaima ta ene di te paduglkwa i, ka kaima plau dinabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene kanio, yoba ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, nono bogl akie tebol swara mina ame di munga. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, God okna na goratnedi di paduglmere yegl goraglka ba yagl ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, ye kaima yubun podo ta inabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yoba i ere mogl, ye yene yegl di pre meglkwa, Nono munara suna i, yoba ira mabuno yegl erabe? digwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba ye ira mogl mitna edenabuka pre nonga digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba i ka di mogl, nonga ta digwa. Ye nonga digwa i, ye meglmara suna i, yoba ira ta mogl mitna edidre, tau tenabuka i pre digwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, ye kingno mogl mitna edidre, ye bitno meglkwa. Yegl eriko, yoba ye meglmara atne meglkwa i, ye no ake ple di norikwa yoba meglmiwe di, ka kibi mere yegl digwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ye yegl erikwa ba ene meglkwa i, yegl ta erekraiglkwa paugwa. Ene meglmara suna i, yoba ta yoba kade moragledi pran, ye gak kebra mere yegl morabuka paugwa. Te, yoba ta ede okna enagledi prabuka i, ye yoba pere niglno kogono ere tenabuka paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Yoba ta tebol mina ame di moglsre, kaya mokna nogwa i, mogl mitna edugo, yoba ta kaya mokna suru togwa i, mogl atne edugwa. Yoba ta tebol mina ame dugwa i, mogl mitna edugwa paugwa. Ba ene prio. Na ene meglmara suna i, mogl mitna edekre, ene niglno kogono ere teiga. Yegl pre ene ama mabuno yegl mere erio di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yubun tau na moglmara plau dugwa igne, ene na moglmara mogl pai meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ana na Nina na pre ka gigledi di paduglkwa i, Ene yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno moratne dugwa. Kuno yegl mere, na ene pre di padiglka i, ene ama yoba pere bitno moraiglmedi di padiliwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Te, na king moraglka igne, ene na bogl akie tebol swara mina ame di mogl, kaya mokna nedre, nigl nedre, eramga. Yegl erumun, ene ama sia king 12-pela mina ame didre, Israel yoba yugobuno 12-pela meglkwa i, suglno moraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ye Jisas pre kan erekriwe dinabuka i pre Jisas di poglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matyu 26.31-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14.27-31</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Saimon yo, ene pro. Ene na duglo beglkwa yoba meglkwa i, Satan ene kinano sinagledi God di pruko, God kanige eragle dumiwa. Ye ene kinano sidre, ene adigl moraiglmo mo i, eribi, kanagledi erabuka. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ba ene na ene pre kamage erika i, ene na pre mediglnga i, dudukrabedi kamage erika. Ene yage sinatnga ba ene kor adratnga igne, ene agiglnma deno muduno si gigle di to! dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Jisas yegl dugo, Pita ye yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade yo, na ene bogl kane yugu panabuglka mere panan, mo akie gorabuglka mere panan, na pra we di priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Pita, na ene di teiga, Erme eduer, koduagle kumugl wi sikran, ene ege suota na moglka i, pre kan erekriwe dinatniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duglo beglkwa yoba i, bek ya ki idre, ede bage bage enaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Okna na ene taragl tau ikre, na kogona eraiglmedi ede bage bage pio diga i, ene prio. Ene paus ya bek ikre, su tau ama ikre, ede pio diga igne, ene taragl tau dokimo? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, Ta manume digwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor ye yegl di togwa, Okna ene taragl tau ikre, ede bage bage pio diga ba erme ene paus mo bek ta yen, ene idre, ede enatnga paugwa. Te, ene bainet ta kan nekitn, ene ir gaglnen topo boglsre, bainet ta topo si kan nenatnga paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />I siragl pre God kamo na pre dugwa i, plau dinabuka paugwa. God kamo dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Yoba ye kanaiglkwa i, lo si buko dugwa yoba ta moglmedi kanaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 53.12</char></note> di, yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Kano, no bainet suo yomne digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas dugwa i, I pra yomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede muglo Oliv pamara pidre, kamage erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matyu 26.36-46</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mak 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus praying in garden" file="FM 181 Jesus Praying in the Garden_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="22.39" />Ana Jisas ye Jerusalem kide kodidre, ye muglo Oliv, ege mere omara ogo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ye mokomugl sika si ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ana ye pi dumo ta enamnedi eimara plau digo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Yagl kide ene kinano si dinabedi kamage ere molo dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ye yegl didre, kuri ta eglke iro pi, goglko bodugl, kamage ere moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Ye kamage ere, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, ene wakai pitn, na nigl kide ta kogl nenaglka i, i eglke ede naratnedi priwa. Ba nana primere ta erekraglka. Ene siragl mere ta pratnga i, plau dinabedi priwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ana Jisas kamage yegl eruko, angelo ta heven ibo kide kodidre, u ye moglmara plau dugwa. Plau didre, Jisas dem muduo si gigle di togwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ana igne i Jisas pre yubun kaima dedre, kamage gigledi kaima ere mogl, pitn boglkwa. Ye pitn boglkwa i, bormai mere yegl yage makandigle sugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ana Jisas kamage ere kodidre, adigl ede pi ye duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara pi kanugwa i, ye ugl pai meglko, kanugwa. Ye ugl pai meglkwa i, siragl pre ye deno muduno yubun dogwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ana Jisas ye ugl pai meglkwa i kandre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene siragl pre ugl pai meglme? Ene adiglsre, yagl kide ene kinano si dinabedi kamage ere molo dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas ye Jisas kudamo ikne auro yugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matyu 26.47-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14.43-50</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jon 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di moglko, yoba tau mere ye moglmara wigwa. Te, ye wimara i, yagl Judas, ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela meglmara suna moglkwa i, ede okna ugwa. Ye ede okna udre, Jisas moglmara magigl u Jisas pauna si nogwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Pauna si nogo, Jisas ye yegl di prukwa, Judas yo, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ene na paunana si nedre, na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yeno? dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl magigl moglsre, siragl taragl plau dinagledi erukwa i, kanigwa pre ye Jisas di pre, No yoba wigwa i, bainet mina sinamno? digwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yegl digo, swarano ta bainetmo idre, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, niglmo kogonmo yagl sidre, ye kina ogo wo kra paugwa i, si bugl di edugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Si bugl di edugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, yegl di togwa, Kodio! Ene yegl ta erekraiglkwa pamiwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ye yagl i kina mina akidre, ere i kor edugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ana Jisas yegl ersre, yoba kade tau ye moglmara wigwa i, ka ta di togwa. Yoba kade ye moglmara wigwa i, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i yeigo, soldia tau ye tawa teigwa yugu sugl meglkwa i bitno tau yeigo, Juda yoba yobano kade bogl wigwa. Ana Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene na kunogl gogl yoba ta moglmedi prisre, bainet ya kuba idre, wimo? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Na ege ege tawa teigwa yugu yomara ene bogl akie munga ba ene na si kane sikrikwa. Ba erme ene egeno yogwa. Te, erme mim erukwa sugl moglkwa yagl i, yobuglo erukwa pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Jisas pre kan erekriwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matyu 26.57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26.69-75</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mak 14.53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14.66-72</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jon 18.12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, yoba ye moglmara wigwa i ye si akidre, ye auro i pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno ta moglkwa i, kipamara eigwa. Te, ye ede eigwa igne, Pita eglke iro mogl, ye eimara sika si ede ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno yagl kipamara togl suna i, yoba tau ede ere gaglsre, ede pramnedi ame di meglko, Pita ede togl suna udre, ye meglmara suna i ame dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ye ame didre, ede pre moglko, nigl kogon abai ta ye toro kan moglsre, yegl dugwa, Yagl moglkwa magigl i, ye yagl Jisas i bogl akie miuriwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Yegl dugo, Pita mane didre, yegl dugwa, Abai yo, na yagl i ta pre kan erekriwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Pita yegl didre, kuri ta moglko, yoba pere ta ye kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene yagl i duglo boglnga yagl ta motniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Pita ye di te, Na ta maniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Pita yegl dugo, aua swara mere yegl ede ogo, yagl pere ta ka gigledi di moglsre, Ene ka kaima yagl i bogl akie miurka pamiwe dugwa. I siragl pre ama Galili yoba ta motniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Yegl dugo, Pita di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ka dinga i, na ta pre kan erekriwe dugwa. Ana ye ka yegl di moglko, koduagle kumugl ta wi sugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Koduagle kumugl ta wi sugo, Jisas ama kan ake te, Pita kanugwa. Jisas ye Pita kanugo, Pita ye Yagl Kade ka ta dugwa i, pre moglkwa. Yagl Kade dugwa i, Erme eduer koduagle kumugl ta wi sikran, ene ege suota na ta pre kan erekriwe dinatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, Pita pre moglsre, ede meda pi, kai podo erukwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba kade Jisas kot ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-68">Matyu 26.59-68</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:55-65">Mak 14.55-65</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jon 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Ana yoba tau Jisas ake meglkwa i, ye kenaglmo sidre, ere sigwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Te, ye gumuglo were si kegl di tedre, ye ere si, yegl digwa, Yoba ira ta ene sugwa i, ka kep ere, di pogl noro! digwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Yegl didre, ye kenaglmo sinamnedi ka kide tau mere ama digwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ana kamun tagugo, Juda yoba kaunsilno wagle u makai sigwa. Kaunsil wagle i, ye tau tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglko, tau God lomo beke teigwa yoba meglko, erukwa. Ana ye u makai sidre, Jisas auro i pi ye makai si si erimara yugugl edidre, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />ye di te, yegl digwa, Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl motn, di noro digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene di tebo, ene na ta pre mediglkraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Te, na ene kira pogl pribo, ene di ikne edekraiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ba erme we, na Yoba Wam moglka i, God, ye yobuglomo podo paugwa moglkwa i, ogo wo kra ame di moraluwe dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, yoba kade wagle makai si meglkwa i, ye yegl di prikwa, Ana ene God Wam motno? digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene digwa i, na yegl moluwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye ere mogl, yegl digwa, Yoba ta ye aglaumo di porabuka i, ta paikrumiwa. Yene dra mina ka aglau ere dugwa i, nono mudu prumniwe digwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Jisas agre i pi, Pailat moglmara eigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matyu 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27.11-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mak 15.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jon 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ana yoba kade wagle makai sigwa i, mudu adiglsre, Jisas auro i pi Pailat moglmara edigwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Edidre, ye aglau erumiwedi, yegl digwa, Yagl i, no yugobunono, Israel yoba meglmara i, yoba nomano ere kide ere tomiwe digwa. No mige taks Rom king tenamga i, ye mane didre, yene Krais mole didre, king ta mole dumiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Yegl digo, Pailat ye Jisas di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene Juda yoba kingno motno? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene dinga i, kuno ere diniwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Jisas yegl dugo, Pailat ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya yoba mere kide magigl kan meglkwa i di tedre, Yagl i aglau erukwa mere yegl ta kankriwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Pailat yegl dugwa ba yoba kade wagle i, ka gigledi di moglsre, yegl digwa, Yagl i Juda yoba mudu nomano ere kide ere togwa. Ye distrik Galili mabuno bogl yoba ka beke tedre, ede u distrik Judia suna i, dumo mudu pidre, yoba ka kibi beke te moglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba kade wagle Jisas auro i pi Herot moglmara edigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ana yoba kade wagle ye Jisas distrik Galili mabuno bogl kogon erume digwa i, Pailat prisre, Ye Galili yoba ta moglmo? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, Galili yoba moglme digo, Pailat prisre, Herot ye distrik Galili sugl moglkwa pre Herot ye kamo pran, kuno erabedi prukwa. Ana igne i Herot dumo Jerusalem moglkwa pre Pailat ye yoba tau Jisas i pi Herot moglmara edinaiglmedi dedugo, i ede eigwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ana yoba tau Jisas yuigo, Herot kanugwa igne, ye gun podo yogwa. I siragl pre okna Jisas kamo digo, ye prisre, Jisas kimagl ta eran, kanagledi prukwa. Prisre, tau kanana sugl mogl ogwa ba Jisas ta kankrukwa, erme kanugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Ana Pailat ye Jisas kandre, kira tau mere kide ye pogl prukwa ba Jisas ka swara ta di ikne edekrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Jisas di ikne edekruko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, God lomo beke teigwa yoba i, magigl adigl moglsre, ka gigledi di, Jisas aglau kane kane erume digwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Yegl digo, Herot ye soldiama bogl Jisas yagl yoko ta moglmedi kandre, ye kenaglmo sidre, ir gagl wakai ta pogl dugwa i ye moglmara ede te, ede ikne Pailat moglmara enabedi dedigwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ana Herot ya Pailat ye okna ikne ikne kide kanibrika ba igne i ye u kabagle mere yegl miurka.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pailat Jisas i pi ede prak mina si goraiglmiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matyu 27.15-26</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mak 15.6-15</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Ana Pailat ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya, Juda yoba yobano kade ya te, yoba yoko meglkwa i pra, agle dugo, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ede magigl wigo, Pailat ye yegl di togwa, Ene yagl i yu na moglmara edidre, ye yoba kuda boraiglmedi erume digwa ba ene kanio. Na ene gumuglno mina ye kira pogl prika ba ene ye aglau erume dimere yegl, ye ta erukwa mere yegl poglkrumiwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Te, Herot ye kira pogl prisre, ede ikne nono munara unabedi dedugwa pre ye ama aglau ta erekrumedi kanugwa paugwa. Ene kanio, ye aglau podo ta erekrukwa pre na ye si goraglka i, kuno ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16-17" />Yegl pre na ye duglnai keme sidre, di meda edinaluwe di, Pailat yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ana Pailat Jisas di meda edenagle dugwa ba Israel yoba magigl makai sigwa i, mudu u swara pidre, ka podo di, Ene yagl i, i pi si goglsre, yagl ta Barabas we digwa i, i meda ede noro digwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Yagl Barabas i, ye Jerusalem mogl, yoba Rom gavman kuda bogl tenaiglmedi ake nu sidre, yoba tau si goglkwa pre ye si kane si i pi kane yugu edigo, pai moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Ana Israel yoba yegl digo, Pailat ye Jisas di meda edenagledi prukwa pre ye aglke kor yoba magigl meglkwa i, ka tau di togwa <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />ba ye ka podo di moglsre, Ye si goglo! didre, Ye ede prak mina si goglo! di meglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Yegl di meglko, Pailat ege namba 3 di ikne ede tedre, yegl dugwa, Ye mabuno kide siragl mere erume? Ye mabuno kide podo ta eran, na ye si goraglka i ta paikrukwa pre na ye duglnai keme sidre, di meda edinaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Yegl dugwa ba Israel yoba ye ka dimara adigl gigledi moglsre, Pailat ye ede prak mina si gorabedi ka podo di meglkwa pre ye kano ede podo pidre, Pailat kamo si atne edugwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ka yegl digwa pre Pailat ere mogl, ye dimere Jisas si goraiglmedi prawe didre, <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />yagl ta kuda kogl, yoba kuda boraiglmedi ersre, yoba tau si goglkwa pre di prikwa ikra di meda edugwa. Yagl kide i di meda edidre, Israel yoba primere yegl, Jisas i pi Rom soldia ogono mina yogwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede prak mina sigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matyu 27.32-44</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15.21-32</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus carrying cross" file="cn01833B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="23.26" />Ana soldia wagle Jisas auro i ede taun meda eigo, yagl ta taun meda mogl, ede suna unagledi ugo, tegigl yeigwa. Tegigl yeigo, soldia ye Jisas edemo prak kake tenatniwe digo, ye Jisas omara mokomugl ede prakmo kake i ede ogwa. Yagl i, kagie Saimon we digo, ye dumo Sairini nem ta moglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ana Jisas omara i, yoba tau mere mokomugl sika si eigo, abu wagle tau ye eimara suna i, Jisas kai ere tedre, kai giglage sigwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yegl eriko, Jisas kan ake tedre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene Jerusalem abu meglkwa i, na pre kai erekrio. Ba ene enene pre kai ersre, gagroma pre ama kai erio. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />I siragl pre ege kide ene meglmara plau dinabuka magigl erukwa. Plau dinan, yoba ere mogl, yegl dinaiglkwa, Abu ta temne padre, gak kebra am tekrikwa i, tau wakai meglkwa ba abu ta gak kiglkwa i, mirie erumiwe dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Ege i, yoba ere mogl, muglo meglbi kade ya kebra yage sidre, no si goraiglmba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosea 10.8</char></note> dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ene prio, na aglau ta erekrisre, yubun yegl mere iga. Yegl pre yoba aglau podo erikwa i, yubun siragl mere inaiglmedi prime? di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Soldia ye Jisas auro i ede eigwa igne, ye kunogl gogl yoba suo ama akie si goramnedi auro i ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ye auro i pi dumo ta Bitno Yobuglo Dumo we dimara i pidre, Jisas ya kunogl gogl yoba suo i, ede prak mina si padiglkwa. Ye Jisas suna si padiglko, kunogl gogl yoba swara ta ye ogo wo kra paugo, swara ta ye ogo koda kra paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Ede prak mina si padiglko, Jisas kamage ere, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, ye tadaglme erikwa i, gugl ede to. I siragl pre ye aglau erikwa i, ta pre kan erekrimiwe dugwa. Te, soldia wagle i, ye Jisas kuguglmo gaglmo yubu si inamnedi kas mere yegl sigwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Leaders mocking" file="cn01838B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="23.35" />Ana Jisas ede prak mina si padiglmara i, yoba magigl adiglsre, kan meglko, Juda yoba yobano kade meglkwa i, ye Jisas kenaglmo si mogl, yegl digwa, Yagl i, yoba tau ere yume digwa. Yegl pre ye kaima Krais, God Kere Yugwa Yagl ikra moran, ye yene ere yo do! digwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Yegl digo, te, soldia tau meglkwa i, ama Jisas kenaglmo sinamnedi wain nuglo tau ku erukwa i yu tenamendi ersre, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />yegl digwa, Ene kaima Juda yoba kingno motn, ene enene ere yo! digwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Te, ye Jisas ede prak mina sigwa igne, ye pamara bre tebe i, ka yegl bogl padiglkwa, Yagl i, ye Juda yoba kingno moglmiwe di, yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ana kunogl gogl yagl suo ta Jisas bogl akie ede prak mina sigwa ikra, swarano ta Jisas kenaglmo sidre, yegl dugwa, Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl motno? Ene kaima yegl motn, ene enene ere idre, no ama ere yo! dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Yegl dugwa ba kunogl gogl yagl ta moglkwa i, ye ka tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene goratnga magigl erukwa ba ene God kuduglmo goglkitno? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Nono aglauno pamara gorabuglka kuno erukwa ba yagl i aglau swara ta erekrumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Yegl didre, ama Jisas yegl di togwa, Jisas yo, ene king moratnga igne, ene na pre moratnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga. Ene erme na bogl akie dumo wakaile morabugle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matyu 27.45-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15.33-41</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ana igne i 12 klok mere yogo, ege i ede pi 3 klok mere yegl, dumo magigl i mudu ake mim erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />I siragl pre ade abuglage sikrukwa. Te, tawa teigwa yugu yugugl i, lap podo ta kogl kegl digwa i, suna wom argla dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Ana taragl yegl plau dugo, Jisas ka podo yegl dugwa, Nina yo, na kiana ene ogon mina yeiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 31.5</char></note> dugwa. Ye yegl didre, goglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Jisas goglko, yagl ta soldia 100 mere bitno moglsre, magigl kan moglkwa i, ye taragl kane kane plau dugwa i kandre, God kagie kade te, yegl dugwa, Yagl goglkwa i, ye kaima yagl du ta moglkwa pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Te, yoba mere u makai sidre, taragl kane kane plau dugwa kan meglkwa i, ye kide pre, ye yene pitno tama sidre, dumo i kide kodo, ede eigwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ana Jisas kabaglema mudu meglkwa i ya te, abu tau okna distrik Galili moglsre, Jisas duglo bogl wigwa i, ye eglke adigl moglsre, taragl kane kane plau dugwa i, kan meglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ogo nagie i pi kobuglo mur yeigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matyu 27.57-61</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15.42-47</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />
    <figure style="fig" file="cn01847B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="23.50-51" />Ana yagl ta moglkwa, ye kagie Josep we digwa. Ye taun Arimatea, distrik Judia suna yogwa i, nem ta moglkwa. Te, ye ama Juda yoba kaunsilno mina moglsre, yagl du mogl, yagl wakai ta moglkwa. Kaunsil wagle makai sidre, Jisas siragl mere ere teigwa i, ye pra we dikre, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabedi sugl moglkwa yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ana yagl i ye Pailat moglmara pidre, Jisas ogo nagie inagledi di pruko, Pailat pra we dugo, <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />ye Jisas ogo nagie ede prak mina paugwa i, i atne edidre, lap kruo mina were, ye ogo nagie i pi kobuglo mur kor ta perimara yogwa. Kobuglo mur i yoba ogono nagino okna yeikrikwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ana igne i Sabat de tagna yenabuka pre yoba kaya mokna ya ki ede yugugl ede yeigwa ege yogo, min panagledi erukwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Josep Jisas ogo nagie i ede ogwa igne, abu tau ye okna Jisas bogl distrik Galili kide kodo, ede wigwa ikra ye duglo boglsre, Josep ogo nagie kobuglo mur mina atne yogwa i, kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Kandre, ede ikne pi Jisas ogo nagie kugo ere tenamnedi taragl tau demene wakai erukwa i, ere wakai ere yeigwa. Ere wakai ere yedre, lo dumere mere Sabat de wakan meglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Jisas adigl u kor ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matyu 28.1-10</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mak 16.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ana Sande, tagna kide kana, abu wagle ikra adiglsre, taragl demene wakai erukwa, ere wakai ere yeigwa ikra, idre, ede kobuglo mur eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Ede kobuglo mur pidre, kanigwa i, kobuglo paglkane podo ta kobuglo dra si kegl dugwa i, i eglke edigo, kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Kandre, ede kobuglo mur yugugl eigwa ba Yagl Kade Jisas ogo nagie yekruko, kobuglo mur yoko yogo, kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ana abu wagle ye nomano si, kinano gudu meglko, tabre yene yagl suo ta ye meglmara plau dibrika. Ye kuguglno gaglno pogl di yogwa kanigwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Yagl suo i plau dibriko, abu wagle i kudugl goglsre, goglkono bodugl, gumano drano i pi makan mina edigo, yagl suo i ye yegl di tebrika, Ene yoba ta dokigwa i, kor moglkwa pre yoba geglkwa padiglmara dokigwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ye adigl u kor ogwa. Magigl i ta pai moglkrukwa. Ye okna distrik Galili moglsre, ene ka ta di togwa i, pre meglmo? <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Ye yegl dugwa, Yoba ere mogl, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, i pi tadaglme yoba ogono mina yenaiglkwa paugwa. Ogono mina yebi, yoba i na ede prak mina si goraiglkwa ba na ege suota pai mogl, adigl u kor enaglka pamiwe di, Jisas ene okna yegl di tome di, angelo suo i yegl dibrika.<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ana angelo suo i yegl dibriko, abu wagle ye Jisas siragl mere okna dugwa i pre moglsre, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />kobuglo mur kide kodo, ede ikne eigwa. Ye ede ikne pi siragl taragl plau dugwa i, Jisas dedugwa yagl 11-pela meglkwa i ya yoba tau ye bogl akie meglkwa i, mudu di teigwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Abu wagle i, Maria, dumo Makdala mam moglkwa i yogo, Joana yogo, Maria ta Jems mam moglkwa i yogo, ye abu tau bogl akie u Jisas dedugwa yoba i, ka i di teigwa <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />ba yagl wagle i, ka i mem wakai ta paikrumara dimedi prisre, ka digwa i ta pre mediglkrikwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Yegl prikwa ba Pita adiglsre, muku di ede pi kobuglo mur pidre, magi didre, kan yugugl edidre, kanugwa i, lap kruo ikra yoko yogo, kanugwa. Kandre, ede ikne pi taragl tau plau dugwa i pre nagie koglsre, yene nomane mina kina gudu prukwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo biurka yagl suo ede dumo Emeus enabugledi ebriko, Jisas ye ebrara plau dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mak 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ana Jisas adigl u kor ogwa ege i, ye duglo biurka yagl suo ta dumo Jerusalem kide kodo, ede dumo ta Emeus we dimara enabugledi ebrika. Dumo Jerusalem ede dumo Emeus enabrika i, 11 kilomita mere yegl yogwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Ana yagl suo i, konbauna pi mogl, taragl tau plau digwa i di pre, pre, ede ebrika. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ye ka di pre ede ebriko, Jisas ede magigl ugo, ye konbauna akie ede eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Akie ede eigwa ba yagl suo i gumuglno mina Jisas kan pogl sikre, yoba pere ta moglmedi kanibrika.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ana yagl suo i, Jisas bogl akie konbauna ede eigo, Jisas ye yegl di prukwa, Ene konbauna pidre, ka di ikne ikne edibrika i, siragl pre dibre? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl suo i adigl miurko, ye deno muduno yubun domara i, gumano drano ama u kide ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yegl eruko, swarano ta, kagie Kliopas we digwa i, di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Taragl tau erme dumo Jerusalem plau digwa i, yoba mudu pra pra pre kan erikwa ba ene swara ta pre kan erekitnga pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yegl dugo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ene siragl taragl plau digwa pre dine? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl suo i ere mogl, ye yegl di tebrika, Taragl plau digwa i, Jisas, ye dumo Nasaret nem to moglkwa i, moglmara plau digwa pre dubuglka. Ye God kamo kep yagl ta moglsre, God gumuglo mina ya yoba mudu gumuglno mina kogon gigledi ersre, ka ama gigledi didre, erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya nono yobano kade i, ye Jisas i pi Rom yoba ogono mina yeigo, ye kot ere tedre, ye ede prak mina si geglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />No okna pre gi dumga i, yagl Jisas i, ye no Israel yoba ere inan, wakai moramgra we di prumga. Ba taragl kane kane yegl plau digo, ama ye Jisas si geglko, erme ege suota ede omiwe dibrika.<verse eid="LUK 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Yagl suo i yegl didre, ama yegl dibrika, Erme tagna kana, abu tau no bogl akie meglkwa i, ede pi yagl Jisas kobuglo mur yeimara pidre, ede ikne u ka tau di noriko, no nagino kunga. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Ye Jisas ogo nagie ta kankrikwa ba ye u di norikwa i, Angelo suo kanumniwe digwa. Angelo suo i, kanumgo, ye no di noro, Jisas kor moglmiwe dibredi, abu wagle yegl digwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Yegl digo, yagl tau no bogl akie munga i, ede kobuglo mur pi kandre, abu wagle kobuglo mur yoko yome dimere yegl yogo, kanigwa ba ye Jisas ta kankrimiwe di, yagl suo i yegl dibrika.<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ana yagl suo i yegl dibriko, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Ene nomane wakai ta paikrukwa paugwa. God kamo kep yoba ka mudu okna beglkwa i, ene tabre pre medra kiribrika. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />God Kere Yugwa Yagl i, ye giugl yegl mere prisre, okuo keme kagie kade inabuka paugwa i, ene ta prikribro? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Jisas yegl didre, God kamo okna beglmara i bage tau ye yene pre dugwa i, ye yagl suo i beke te ede ogwa. Ye Moses ka tau boglkwa i mabuno bogl idre, ka kep yagl mudu ta ka okna beglmara i mina bage tau idre, yagl suo i beke te ede ogwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ana yagl suo i ye Jisas bogl konbauna pi mogl, ye dumo ta enabugledi ebrara i, ede magigl eigwa. Ede magigl eigo, Jisas konbauna pi pai morabuka mere yegl erukwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Yegl eruko, yagl suo i ye ka gigledi di tedre, Erme min pama. Nono akie mogl panamniwe dibriko, Jisas ye bogl akie moramnedi ede yugugl ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ede yugugl ogo, ye akie kaya mokna nenamnedi ame digo, Jisas bret ta idre, God di wakai yei te, bret ake buko di, yagl suo i togwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Togo, ye Jisas moglmedi pre kan eribriko, Jisas tabre imim daglkwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Jisas imim daglko, yagl suo i di ikne ikne ede, yegl dibrika, Nono konbauna u mungo, God kamo mem siragl mere paugwa i beke noro ugwa i, nono deno muduno mina pogglau boglko, wakai kaima prubuluwe dibrika.<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ana yagl suo i tabre adigl, ede ikne Jerusalem pidre, Jisas dedugwa yoba 11-pela yoba tau bogl akie makai si meglko, kandre, ede suna ebrika. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Ede suna ebriko, yoba u makai si meglkwa i yegl digwa, Yagl Kade ka kaima adiglsre, Saimon moglmara plau dumiwe digwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Yegl digo, yagl suo i ye konbauna ebrara taragl tau plau dugwa i ye di tedre, Jisas ye bret ake buko dugwa igne ye kan pogl sibrika i, di tebrika.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba meglmara plau dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matyu 28.16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16.14-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus appears to His disciples" file="cn01865B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="24.36" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba i, ka yegl di meglko, Jisas ye meglmara tabre yene plau didre, Ene deno muduno wida dinabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Yegl dugo, ye nagino koglsre, kudugl gogl, murubuglo ta kan munedi prikwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Yegl priko, Jisas yegl di prukwa, Ene siragl pre nagino keglme? Te, ene siragl pre kinano suo yome? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Na nana kaima wiga. Ene na ogona kaglna kandre, na ama ake prio. Na murubuglo ta ukrika. Murubuglo ogono nagino ta paikrukwa pre ene erme na ogona nagna ake prisre, pre kaima yenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ye yegl didre, ogo ya kagle ye obuno di togwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Obuno di togo, ye gun podo yeigwa ba Jisas kaima adigl u kor omedi pre medraiglkwa i, kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa pre Jisas ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene kaya mokna ta yeigwa yomo? dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Yegl dugo, buglo bagle ta kodo gaiglkwa i, mie ta dre teigo, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Jisas idre, ye gumuglnomugl nogwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, ye duglo beglkwa yoba i, yegl di togwa, Okna nono akie munga igne, na ene di teiga, God kamo mina ka kane kane ta na pre beglkwa i, Moses lo boglmara suna i ya te, ka kep yoba tau ka beglmara suna i, ya te, buk Giglage beglmara suna i, mudu plau dinaiglkwa pre diwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Jisas yegl didre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba nomano mina ye God kamo pre pogl sinaiglmedi ere togwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ere tedre, yegl dugwa, God kamo mina okna kibo beglkwa i, God Kere Yugwa yagl i, giugl prisre, gorabuka ba ege namba 3 adigl u kor enabe dugwa i, plau di kodumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Ana na kana Jerusalem mabuno bogl beke tedre, okuo uglo kogl koglo di te ede enaiglkwa. Didre, ene yegl dio, Ene nomano yake tedre, Jisas pre mediglbi, God ene tadaglmeno gugl ede tenabe dinaiglme dugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Ana taragl kane kane na moglmara plau dugwa i, ene kanigwa pre ene yoba di tenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Te, ene prio. Na Nina ka di paduglmere na kuri ta moglsre, ene Mudu Murubuglo inaiglmedi dedibo, inaiglkwa. Ba ene dumo Jerusalem magigl i sugl kan meglbi, na Mudu Murubuglo dedibo, God igne i, ene yobuglo tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Jisas auro i ede heven ibo ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mak 16.19-20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 1:9-12">Aposel 1.9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba auro i pi dumo Betani yomara magigl edugwa. Auro i pi edidre, ye ogo koglo koglo ake mitna ede, God kagie mina ye di wakai yei togwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ye di wakai yei te moglko, God ye auro i ede heven ibo ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Jisas ede ogo, ye duglo beglkwa yoba i goglkono bodugl tedre, ye kagie kade teigwa. Yegl ersre, ye gun podo yei, ede ikne dumo Jerusalem suna eigwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Ye ede ikne Jerusalem pidre, ege ege tawa teigwa yugu yomara moglsre, God kagie kade te pai meglkwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>